<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">Piencilna</book>
  <para style="h">Piencilna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Piencilna</para>
  <para style="toc2">Piencilna</para>
  <para style="mt">Piencilna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kipat cilin Pasien in vantung le leitung a siem hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />leitung in limlemel nei loin a hawmpi ahi a, tuaci’n khuomiel in tuipi thuh tung teng khucipin tui tungah Pasien’ Hlagau a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in, “Khuovah om heh,” ci hi; tuale khuovah om pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien in tua khuovah hoi a sa hi; tuale Pasien in khuovah le khuomiel a khenkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien in tua khuovah “Sun” ci a, khuomiel “Zan” ci hi. Tuale nitah le zingmawng om a, a ni khatna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien in, “Tui le tui kikalah vanthamzawl khat om hinlen tui le tui khen heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien in vanthamzawl bawlin vanthamzawl tunga tuite le vanthamzawl nei-a tuite a khenkhie hi. Tua ma bangin a om pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien in vanthamzawl pen “Van” ci hi. Tuale nitah le zingmawng om a, a ni nina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien in, “Van nei-a om tuite mun khatah kikhawm hinlen, leigaw kidawh heh,” a ci hi. A ci bangin a pieng pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien in leigaw pen “Lei” ci a, tui kikhawmtuote pen “Tuipi” ci hi. Pasien in tua khu hoi a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in, “Leitang in singkung lopate posah hinlen, a tang nei singkungte, a ga sunga a tang om singga kungte, amau’ nam cietin leitungah po heh,” a ci hi. Tua ma bangin a pieng pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leitang in singkung lopate amau’ nam ciet tawh kizui-in, khaici a nei lopate le amau’ nam ciet tawh kizui-in a sunga tang a nei a ga singkungte piengsah hi. Tua khu Pasien in hoi a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale nitah le zingmawng om a, a ni thumna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien in, “Sun le zan a khen dingin vanthamzawl ah khuovahte om heh; tuate khu khuohunte, nite le kumte ciemte nading hi hinlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />leitung a tanvah dingin vanthamzawl ah khuovah hi uheh,” a ci hi. A ci bangin a om pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien in khuovah gol ni bawl a, khuovah a golzaw pen sun a uh ding, khuovah a neuzaw pen zan a uh dingin bawl a, aasite zong a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitung a tanvah ding,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />sun le zan tunga thunei ding, le khuovah le khuomiel a khen dingin Pasien in vanthamzawl ah tuate a koi hi. Pasien in tua khu hoi a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin nitah le zingmawng om a, a ni lina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale Pasien in, “Tuite in hinna nei ganhing honpite piengsah hinlen, leitung vanthamzawl ah vate leng uheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien in tuipi ganhing golpite le hinna a nei a pia thei ganhing namcin le a leng thei va namcin amau’ namcietin a piengsah hi. Tua khu Pasien in hoi a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasien in amate thupha pie a, “Cipha-in pungin tuipi sung dim unlen, leitungah vate pung uheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuale nitah le zingmawng om a, a ni ngana ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasien in, “Leitung in amau’ nam cietin hinna nei ganhingte piengsah heh. Amau’ nam cietin innsate, a bawhva ganhingte le gamsate pieng uheh,” a ci hi. Tua ma bangin pieng pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pasien in gamsa, innsa le a bawhva ganhing zosie amau’ nam cietin a piengsah a, tua khu Pasien in hoi a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in, “Eima’ lim, eima’ mel sunin mihing siem vai; amate in tuipi sunga ngate, vantunga vate, innsa, gamsa zosie, le leitunga a bawhvate zosie tungah thu neisah vai,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien in ama’ lim sunin mihing siem a, ama in Pasien’ lim bangin amate a siem hi. Ama in pasal le numei a siem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien in ama gel thupha pie a, Pasien in ama gel kungah, “Cipha-in pung unlen leitung luodimin zo un; tuipi sunga ngate, vana leng vate, le leitunga gamta hinna nei zosie tungah thu nei un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasien in, “En un, na tung vuah leitung maitang cin tenga om, a tang nei kungno zosie le a ga sunga a tang nei singkung zosie kang pie zo hi; note in an-in tuate na nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuale leitung ganhing zosie, vana va zosie, leitunga a bawhva zosie, hinna hu a nei zosiete tungah an dingin kunghing zosie kang pie zo hi,” a ci hi. Tua ma bangin a pieng pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasien in a siemsa na vannuoi en a, hoi a sa mama hi. Tuale nitah le zingmawng om a, a ni guhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua bangin van le lei le a sunga na om zosie kiman sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuale a ni sagina ni-in Pasien in a nasep zosie man a, a ni sagi ni-in a sepna zosie panin a tawlnga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien in ni sagi ni thupha pie-in siengthosah hi, bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in siemcil nasepna zosie manin tua ni-in a tawlnga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamte pen a kisiemcil lai-a van le lei tangthu ahi hi. Topa Pasien in van le lei a bawl ni-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />leitungah singkung lopa kici a po nai sih hi. Azieh pen Topa Pasien in leitungah guo a zusah nai sih hi, lo hlo ding zong koima a om nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin lei nei panin tuihu phulto-in leitung zosie a nomsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa Pasien in lei panin leivui tawh mihing bawl a, a nahkuo sungah hinna hu mop hi; tuale mipa pen hinna nei mihing a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Pasien in nisuona lamah Eden um khat a bawl hi; ama in tua munah a siemsa mipa koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa Pasien in lei sung panin a etlawm, a tuituoh singkung namcin posah a, um laikimah hinna singkung le a sie le a pha theina singkung zong a posah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Um a nomsah dingin Eden panin gun khat luong a, khum mun panin tua gun kikhenzahin gun li a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gun masa pen a min Pishon hi a, kham pienna Havilah gamsung zosie kuolkhumin a luong pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua gama khamte hoi thei mama a, khum munah bedolak singnai le onyx suong manpha a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gun a nina pen a min Gihon hi a, Cush gam kuolkhumin a luong pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Gun a thumna pen a min Tigris hi a, Assyria gam nisuona lamah a luong hi. Gun a lina pen a min Euphrates ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa Pasien in Eden um hlo ding le a cing dingin mipa koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale Topa Pasien in tua mipa kungah, “Um sunga singga zosie na dei bangin na ne thei ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />hinanle a sie le a pha theina singga na ne sih ding hi, azieh pen na neh ni-in na si ding hi,” ci-in thu a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa Pasien in, “Mipa ama guoha a op ding hoi lo hi; ama a hu ding kithuopi khat ka bawlpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa Pasien in lei panin gamsa zosie le vana leng va zosie siem a, a min uh bang ahisah eimah ci-in a thei nuom ziehin mipa kungah tuate a peipi hi; hinna a nei zosie, tua mipa’ law bangbang a min uh hi paipai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua mipa in ganhing zosie, vana leng va zosie le gamsa zosie min a vaw ciet hi; ahi vangin mipa a hu thei ding mi khat zong a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa Pasien in tua mipa a kimut suohsah mama a, tuale ama a kimu hi; tua ciengin ama in a nahgu khat la a, a lahna mun teng a telin a tuomsahkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa Pasien in mipa tung pana a lah a nahgu pen numei khatin bawl a, mipa kungah tua nu a zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin mipa in, “Tam pen ka gute pana ka gu le ka tel pana ka tel ahi hi; ama pen Mipa sung pana kila ahi ziehin Numei kici ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin pasal in a nu a pa nuasie-in a zi tawh kigawm a, ama gel pum khat a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuale mipa le a zi a guohtangin a om tuoh gel a, a maizum sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Topa Pasien bawlsa gamsa cinteng sangin gulpi a pilkhel pen ahi hi. Ama in numei kungah, “Pasien in, ‘Um sunga singga khat beh ne lo ding,’ ang ci amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Numei in gulpi kungah, “Um sunga singgate ka ne thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ahi vangin Pasien in, ‘Um laikima singga pen neh zong na neh lo ding uh, khoi zong na khoi lo ding uh ahi hi. Tua bang na bawl uleh na si ding uhi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin gulpi in numei kungah, “Na si sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile tua singga na neh ciengun na mit uh kihongin a sie le a pha thei-in Pasien tawh na kibah ding lamtah uh Pasien in thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n numei in tua singkung a mu ciengin neh dingin tuituohsa a, a mit zong a la mama hi. Tuale mi pilsah dingin tua singkung a deihuoi lam a mu ciengin tua nu in a ga loin a ne hi; tua nu in ama tawh a omton a pasal zong themkhat pie a, a pasal in zong a ne hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin a nipi-un a mit uh kihong a, a guohtanga a op lam a kithei uhi; tuale ama gel in theina khui-in ama gel adingin puon a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nitah lam nidai hunin um sungah Topa Pasien peina huging ama gel in a za vua, tuale Topa Pasien’ opna panin mipa le a zinu, umlai singkungte lahah a kiphuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa Pasien in mipa hlanin ama kungah, “Nang hei-a om na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, “Um sungah na huging ka za a, ka guohtanga ka op ziehin zau-in ka kiphuol hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in, “Guohtanga na op lam koi hing gen ahiei? Ne si’n, kang ci tua singga na ne ta amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipa in, “Kithuopi dinga nei pieh numei in singga ei pie a, ka ne hai ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa Pasien in numei kungah, “Bang dinga hici gamtat na hiei?” a ci hi. Numei in, “Gulpi in ei sol a, ka ne hai ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa Pasien in gulpi kungah, “Tam bangin gamta zo na hi ziehin, ganhing zosiete le gamsa zosiete lahah samsiet na thuoh ding hi; na awm tawh na kithol ding a, na hin sung tungtawnin leivui na ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang le numei kikal le na suonlehlahte le tua nu suonlehlahte kikalah kilangneina ka omsah ding hi; ama in na lutang ang tuoncil ding a, nang in ama’ ketul na tuhpieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in tua numei kungah, “Naupaaina-ah gimnate nasie tahin ka khangsah ding a, a thuohla pipi-in nau na suoh ding hi. Hinanle na pasal ma na lunggul bembom ding a, ama in nang tungah ang uh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale mipa kungah, “Nang in na zi thugen mangin, ‘Na ne sih ding hi,’ ci-a kang thupieh singga ne zo ta na hi ziehin, nangma vangin leitang kisamsie hi; na hin sung tungtawnin gim le tawlin na semin an na ne ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />nang adingin ling le khaute hing po ding a, nang in gamlaha ante lohingte na ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lei-ah na peikia masangsie na maitangah opsakai-in an na ne ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile nang pen leivui pana ang kila na hi hi; nang leivui na hi a, leivui ma ah na peikia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipa in a zi pen mihing zosie’ nu ahi ziehin a min Eve vaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale Topa Pasien in mipa le a zi adingin savun puon bawlpiehin ama gel a silsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa Pasien in, “En un, mipa pen eite khat tawh kibang a, a sie le a pha a thei ta hi; tu-in mipa in hinna singga lo hinlen hing ne kha mawh leh ang nungta den ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa Pasien in mipa pen a pienna leitang hlo dingin Eden um panin a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in mipa a notmang hi; ama in hinna singkung zuotna lampi a cing dingin Eden um nisuona lamah meikuong namsau tawh Cherub-te a pangsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in mipa in a zi Eve luppi a, ama gai-in Cain nei a, “ Topa panpina tawh mi khat ka nga zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a naupa Abel neikia hi. Tu-in Abel pen tuucingpa ahi a, Cain pen lo hlopa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hun a cin ciengin Cain in Topa kungah lei pana a pieng singga biehna peipi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abel in zong a tuuhonte lahah tacilte le a thau tuituoh pente peipi hi. Topa in Abel le ama’ biehna thusimpieh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ahi vangin Cain le ama’ biehna a thusimpieh sih hi. Tuaci’n Cain lungthah mama a, a mai a tuop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in Cain kungah, “Bang dingin lungthahin bang dingin mai tuop na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hoi bawl lacin ang kisanpieh lo ding amah? A hoi na bawl sih leh, mawna in kotbiengah ang buh khinkhian hi; ama lunggul pen nang na hi a, ahi vangin tua pen na zaw lo a poimaw ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cain in a sanggampa Abel kungah, “Lo va kuon ta vai,” ci hi. Lo a tun ciengun Cain a sanggampa Abel tawh kihau-in ama a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Cain kungah, “Na sanggampa Abel hei-a om ahiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Ka thei sih hi; ka sanggampa kem pa ka hi laizang amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale Topa in, “Bang teng pi khat bawl zo na hi tai? Ngai vawi; leisiet panin na sanggampa’ sisan kei kungah ang kiko hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in na khut pana a luongkhie na sanggampa’ sisan hup dinga a kamkah leitang tungah nang samsiet thuoh na hi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leitang na hlaw ciengin nang adingin lei panin an a pieng nawn sih ding hi; nang pen leitungah a galtai, a vahvai na hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cain in Topa kungah, “Kei dan ei kipiehna pen kei thuoh zawh ding za sangin nasie zaw me izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuni-in leitang panin kei nei notmang ta a, na maitang panin kei ka kiphuol ding hi; kei a galtai le leitungah a vahvaih ding ka hi ta a, kei ei mu poma in ei that ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in ama kungah, “Tua bang hi lo ding hi! Mi khatpo in Cain a tha leh a za sagi-in phulahna thuoh ding hi,” a ci hi. Ama a tuohkha mi koima in ama a tha lo nadingin, Topa in Cain tungah melcina khat a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa kung panin Cain pei dawhin Eden um nisuona lam Nod gamah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cain in a zi luppi a, ama gai-in Enoch nei hi. Tuale ama in khuo sat a, tua khuopi pen a tapa Enoch’ min tapin Enoch a hisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Enoch’ sung panin Irad suoh a, Irad pen Mehujael’ pa ahi hi. Mehujael pen Methushael’ pa ahi a, Methushael pen Lamech’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lamech in zi ni nei a, a khat’ min Adah ahi a, adang khat’ min Zillah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adah in tapa Jabal nei a, ama pen puonbuh sunga teng, gankhawite pienna pupi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sanggampa’ min Jubal ahi a, lyre le theile tumte zosie’ pienna pupi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zillah in Tubal-cain nei a, sumngo le sia vanzah nam zosie a bawlpa ahi hi. Tubal-cain’ sanggamnu pen Naamah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lamech in a zite kungah, “Adah le Zillah aw, ka aw ngai un. Lamech’ zite aw, ka thugen ngai un: Kei ei liemsah mi khat ahi, kei ei sat tangval khat keima in ka that ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cain tung bawn-a a za sagi-a phu kila ahile, a tahtahin Lamech a thatte a za sawmsagi le sagi vei-in phu kila ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Adam in a zi luppi leuleu a, tua nu in tapa khat nei-in a min Seth phuo hi. Azieh pen tua nu in, “Cain in Abel a tha ziehin Pasien in Abel tangin kei adingin tapa adang khat ei pie zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Seth in zong tapa khat nei a, a min Enosh a hisah hi. Khum hunin mite in Topa’ min a lo pan ta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam pen Adam suonlehlahte’ khang laibu ahi hi. Pasien in mihing a siem lai-in ama in Pasien’ mel tawh kisunin amate a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in ama gel pasal le numei-in a na siem a, a kisiem hun lai-in ama gel “Mihing” ci-in na minvaw a, tuaci’n ama gel thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Adam kum za le kum sawmthum a phah ciengin a kisutpi, ama’ lim le mel a puo tapa khat nei a, a min Seth ahisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Seth’ pa ahi zaw ciengin Adam kum zagiet sung a hing hi; ama in adang tanute le tapate nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua bangin Adam hin sung teng zosie pen kum zakuo le sawmthum ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seth kum za le kum nga sung a hin zaw ciengin ama pen Enosh’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Enosh a suo zaw ciengin Seth kum zagiet le kum sawmthum hing a, tanu le tapate a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua bangin Seth’ khan sung teng zosie kum zakuo le kum sawm le ni ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Enosh kum sawmkuo sung a hin zaw ciengin Kenan’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kenan a suo zaw ciengin Enosh kum zagiet le sawm le nga hing a, tapa le tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua bangin Enosh’ khan sung teng kum zakuo le nga ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kenan kum sawmsagi a hin zaw ciengin Mahalalel’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahalalel a suo zaw ciengin Kenan kum zagiet le kum sawmli hing a, tapate le tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua bangin Kenan khan sung teng zosie kum zakuo le sawm ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahalalel kum sawmguh le nga a hin zaw ciengin Jared’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jared a suo zaw ciengin Mahalalel kum zagiet le sawmthum hing a, tapate le tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua bangin Mahalalel’ khan sung teng zosie kum zagiet le sawmkuo le nga ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jared kum za le kum sawmguh le ni a hin zaw ciengin Enoch’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Enoch a suo zaw ciengin Jared kum zagiet hing a, tapate le tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua bangin Jared khan sung teng zosie kum zakuo le sawmguh le ni ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Enoch kum sawmguh le nga a hin zaw ciengin Methuselah’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Methuselah a suo zaw ciengin Pasien tawh Enoch kum zathum sung zawhton a, tapate le tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua bangin Enoch’ khan sung teng zosie kum zathum le sawmguh le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasien tawh Enoch a zawhton hi; tua ciengin Pasien in ama a lah ziehin ama om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Methuselah kum za le sawmgiet a hin zaw ciengin ama pen Lamech’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lamech a suo zaw ciengin Methuselah kum zasagi le sawmgiet le ni hing a, tapate le tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua bangin Methuselah khan sung teng zosie kum zakuo le sawmguh le kuo ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lamech kum za le sawmgiet le ni a hin zaw ciengin tapa khat’ pa a suoh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ama in ama’ min Noah hisah a, “ Topa samsietsa leitang panin tam mipa in i nasepna ule i khut tawh i sep uh gimnate panin ei nuomtuomsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Noah a suo zaw ciengin Lamech kum zanga le sawmkuo le nga hing a, tapate le tanute a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua bangin Lamech khan sung teng zosie kum zasagi le sawmsagi le sagi ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Noah kum zanga a phah zaw ciengin, Noah pen Shem, Ham, le Japheth-te’ pa a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leisiet maitangah mite pun a kipat ciengun amate in tanute a nei vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien’ tapate in amate hoi a sa uhi. Tuale amate in a dei zosie uh telin zi-in a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “Mihingte sungah ka hlagau a teng den sih ding hi, azieh pen amate cilesa ahi uhi; amau’ khan kum pen kum za le sawmni hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in leitungah Nephilim a kici mite om a, tuale khum zaw ciengin zong Pasien’ tapate in mihing’ tanute a luppi ciengun ta a nei uhi. Tamte pen khanglui lai-a mi thahat mi minthangte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitungah mihing gitlona lien mama a, tuaci’n Topa in mihing lungsim ngaisutna poma a sie ngentang ahina thu a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing a siemkhah pen Topa a kisia a, tua thu in a lungsim a dasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in, “Ka siemsa mihing, ganhing, a bawhva ganhingte le vana leng vate tawh ka sumaimang ding hi. Azieh pen amate ka siemkhah ka kisia hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Noah in Topa’ maipha a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam teng pen Noah’ suonlehlahte ahi hi. Noah a thuman mi khat ahi a, a khan sungin paubaang lo hi; Pasien tawh Noah a zawhton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuale Noah in tapa thum nei a, Shem, Ham, le Japheth-te ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in Pasien’ muna-ah leitung kisiegawp a, leitung pen tatsietna tawh a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuale Pasien in leitung pen a kisie-in a mu hi; bangzieh ahei cile leitungah mi zosie a siehuoi-in a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien in Noah kungah, “Mi zosie suhmaimang dingin ka khentat zo hi, azieh pen amate ziehin tatsietna tawh leitung a kidim hi; tu-in leitung tawh amate ka susie ton ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang mama in taasing tawh tembaw khat bawl in; tua tembaw sungah khan a dan danin omsah inlen, a sung le a pu singnai tawh hubih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na bawl dan ding tam bang ahi hi: Tembaw a dung tong zathum, a vai tong sawmnga, le a sanna tong sawmthum hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tembaw adingin a innkhum khat bawl inlen, tua tung tong khat ciengah hiel bawl in; tembaw pangah kotpi khat bul in; a dan neita, a ni na, le a thumnate bawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei lam panin vansin nei-a om zosie, a sunga a husang thei zosie a susie dingin leitungah tuizin ka tungsah ding hi; leitunga om zosie a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima in nangma tawh ka thuciemna ka kipsah ding hi; nangma, na tapate, na zi le na tapate’ zite tawh tembaw sungah na lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale hinna nei zosie, mi zosie lah panin nangma tawh a hington dingin nam khatah ni ciet tembaw sungah na peipi ding hi; tuate anu le apa hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vate lah panin amau’ nam cietin, lei-ah a bawhva ganhing zosie amau’ nam cietin nam khatah ni ciet na kungah ang pei ding vua, tuate a hin nadingin na kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kine thei an namcin zong la inlen tuate khol in; tuate pen nangma le amate adingin an hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Noah in tuate a bawl hi; Pasien in ama tunga a thupieh zosie ama in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Noah kungah, “Nangma le na innkuonpi zosie tembaw sungah lut un. Azieh pen tam khang mite sungah nang beh ka mai-ah a thumanin kang mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ganhing a sieng zosie nupa kop sagi le ganhing a sieng lo nupa kop khat la in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuale vana leng vate zong nupa kop sagi ma, leitungah a ci man lo nadingin kemcing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen ni sagi ciengin leitungah sun sawmli le zan sawmli sung guo ka zusah ding a, leitung maitang panin ka bawlsa hinna nei vannuoi ka sumang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuale Noah in Topa’ thupiehsa zosie a un-in a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leitungah tuizin a tun lai-in Noah kum zaguh a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale tuizin panin a suotah nadingun Noah, a tapate, a zi le a mote tawh tembaw sungah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien in Noah a thupieh bangin ganhing a siengte, ganhing a sienglote, vate, lei-a a bawhva zosie lah panin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a nupa kopin Noah tawh tembaw sungah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni sagi a cin zaw ciengin leitungah tuizin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noah’ khan a kum zaguhna kum, a hla nina, tua a hla ni sawm le ni sagi ni-in vantunga om a thuh mama tuinah zosie pawhkeh a, vantung tawlet zosie kihong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leitungah sun sawmli le zan sawmli guo zu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khum ni ma-in Noah le a tapate, Shem, Ham, Japheth, le Noah’ zi le a mote thum, amate tawh tembaw sungah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate tawh gamsa zosie a nam ciet, innsa zosie a nam ciet, lei-a a bawhva poma a nam ciet, le va poma a nam ciet, va namkim, le hlanei zosie a nam cietin a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Noah’ tembaw sungah hinna hu nei zosie kopni cietin a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien in Noah tunga a thupiehsa bangin hinna a nei zosie, a nupa-in tembaw sungah a lut uhi; tuale Topa in ama kot a khalu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leitungah ni sawmli sung a kizomin gua a zuzu hi; tuale tui tam semsemin tembaw a lamto a, leitungah khangin a sangto lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leitungah tui khang valuhin tuitungah tembawpi a lamto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leitungah tui nahpi tahin a khan ziehin vansin nei buppi-a a om muol sang zosie a hlummang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />muolteng tungah tui letto lai a, tuate tungah tong sawm le tong nga thuhin hlummang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leitungah hinna a nei zosie, vate, innsate, gamsate, lei-a a hon gamtat ganhing zosie le mi zosie a si sieng hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />leigaw lahah a nahvanga hinna hu a nei poma a si sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in mihing, ganhing, a bawhvate le vana leng vate, leitunga hinna a nei poma a sumaimang hi; Noah le tembaw sunga a ompite beh a suohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ni za le ni sawmnga sung leitungah tui a khang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in Noah le ama tawh a omton gamsate le innsate a phawh hi. Tuale Pasien in leitungah hui langsah a, tui a kiem hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a thuhna-a om tuinahte le vantunga tawlette kikha a, guo kitheusah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuale leitung panin tuite a kiem hieihiei hi. Ni za le sawmnga a cin zaw ciengin tuite a kiem sieng hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a hla sagina, a ni sawm le ni sagina ni-in Ararat muol tungah tembaw kinga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A hla sawmna dongin tui kiem hieihiei a, a hla sawmna, a ni khat ni-in muol dawn sangte a kidawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sawmli a cin zaw ciengin Noah in a bawlsa tembaw tawlette hongin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />va-ah khat a hla hi; tuale leitungah tui a kan masangsie a leng kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin leitungah tui a kiem ta amah ci a thei nadingin vakhu khat a hlakia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ahi vangin lei maitang zosie-ah tui let lai ahi ziehin a tuh nading maimaw-in tembaw sungah tua vakhu a kilekia hi. Tuaci’n ama in a khut zahin vakhu man a, tembaw sungah a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in ni sagi sung ngahkia a, tuale tembaw panin tua vakhu a hlakia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nitah lamin ama kungah vakhu kilekia a, olive singna a tuhtha khat a nephu-ah petin a tunpi hi; tuaci’n Noah in leitung panin tuite kiem zo hi, ci-in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ni sagi ma ngahkia-in, tua vakhu a hla kia hi; tua vakhu ama kungah a kilekia ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noah a khan kum zaguh le khatna, a hla masa, tuami hla ni masa pen ni-in leitungah tui a kang sieng hi; tuale Noah in tembaw khuna ladawhin a khuodah leh leitang pen a na hul sipsep ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A hla nina, tua hla ni sawmni le sagi ni-in leitung a hul sieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in Noah kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nangma le na zi, na tapate le na mote tawh tembaw panin peidawh ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na ompi hinna nei zosie - vate, ganhingte le lei-a a bawhva zosie - leitungah nosangin, khanpha-in a pun thei nadingin peipi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n a tapate le a zi le a mote tawh Noah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ganhing zosie, a bawhva zosie, le va zosie, leitunga a gamta zosie a innkuon kuonin tembaw panin a pusuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Noah in Topa adingin maitam khat lam a, ganhing le va siengtho zosie lahah khat ta la-in maitam tungah meihal biehnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuale Topa in tua gimnamtui a zah bepin a lungsim sungah, “Mihing ziehin leitang ka samsie nawn sih ding hi. Azieh pen mihing’ lungsim ngaisutnate naupang ahi lai vua kipanin a gilo ahi tabo hi. Tu-a ka bawl bangin hinna nei zosie zong ka susie nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leitung a om laisie khaitu hun le anlah hun, khuovot hun le khuolum hun, khal hun le phalbi hun, sun hun le zan hunte tawp lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien in Noah le a tapate thupha pie a, amate kungah, “Cipha-in pung unlen, leitung luodim un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung ganhing namcin teng, vana leng va namcin teng, lei-a a bawhva cinteng le tuipi sunga a om zosie in hing giingin ang zatah ding uhi; na khut sung vuah tuate ang kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A pia thei a nungta ganhing zosie na an uh hi ding hi. Keima in ante lohing note kang pieh bangin na vannuoi zong note kang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin hinna ahi sisan pen a sa tawh na ne ton sih beh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hinna uh ahi sisan tangin sisan ma ka kal valon ding hi: Ganhing zosie tung le mihingte tungah ka kal ding a, mi khat ciet’ sisan tangin midang khat ciet’ sisan ka kal ding a, mihing hinna tangin mihing sisan ma ka kal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing sisan suo poma, mihing ma in tua mipa sisan a suo ding hi. Azieh pen Pasien in ama’ lim bangin mi a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuale cipha-in pung unlen, leitung luodimin a sungah pung un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in Noah le a ompi a tapate kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei ka hile nangma le na nua-a na suonlehlahte le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />no tawh a omton hinna nei zosie, vate, innsate, le note tawh a omton leitung gamsa zosie, tembaw sung pana a pusuoh zaza tawh ka thuciemna ka kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinna a nei zosie, tuizin tawh sumaimangkia ngai nawn loin, leitung susie dingin tuizin ka tunsahkia ngai nawn lo nadingin note tawh ka thuciemna ka kipsah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasien in, “Tam pen keima, note le no tawh ang omton hinna nei zosie kikala ka bawl, mai lama ang pieng ding na suonlehlahte dinga lim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Meii lahah ka sakhi-guihlung ka kaisah zo a, tua pen kei le leitung kikalah thuciemna lim hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leitungah meiilum kaisahin meiilum lahah sakhi-guihlung a kimu leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />keima, nohaw le hinna a nei zosie tawh ka thuciemna ka phawh ding a, hinna a nei zosie susie dingin tuizin tung ngai nawn lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Meiilum lahah sakhi-guihlung a op ciengin keima in ka en ding a, Pasien le leitunga om hinna nei zosie kikalah tawntung thuciemna ka phawh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien in Noah kungah, “Tam pen kei le leitunga om hinna nei zosiete kikalah ka kipsahsa thuciemna lim ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tembaw pana pusuoh Noah’ tapate pen Shem, Ham, le Japheth-te ahi uhi. Ham pen Canaan’ pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam mihing thum teng pen Noah’ tapate ahi vua, tam teng panin leitung buppi mi tawh a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noah pen lohlo mi ahi a, lengga um bawl masa pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in lenggazu themkhat dawnin a kham a, tuale puonbuh sungah puon sil loin a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Canaan’ pa Ham in a pa a guohtanga a lup a mu bepin, a pulama om a sanggam ni tegel kungah a ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Shem le Japheth in puon khat la-in, a liengko tuoh vuah a baang vua, nuatawnsa-in pei-in a pa uh’ guohtang opna a khupieh uhi; ama ni in a lengat zieh gelin a pa uh’ guohtanga a opna a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A zukhamna panin Noah a khuophaw ciengin ama tungah a tapa tumpen gamtat dan teng thei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ama in, “Canaan in samsiet thuoh hinlen, a sanggamte adingin sila ngiempen hi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in zong, “ Topa ka Pasien in Shem thupha pie hinlen, Canaan, ama’ sila hisah heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pasien in Japheth adingin mun bawlpieh hinlen, Shem’ puonbuhte sungah ama tengsah heh. Tuale Canaan pen ama’ sila hisah heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuizin tunzaw ciengin Noah kum zathum le kum sawmnga sung hing lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Noah’ khan sung teng pen kum zakuo le kum sawmnga ahi hi; tuale ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Noah’ tapate ahi Shem, Ham, le Japheth-te’ suonlehlahte ahi hi; tuizin a tun zaw ciengin amate in tapate a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Japheth’ suonlehlahte: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, le Tiras ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gomer’ suonlehlahte: Ashkenaz, Riphath, le Togarmah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Javan’ suonlehlahte: Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim, le Rodanim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tam teng panin tuipi gei-a teng mite a kizel uhi. Tam teng pen Japheth’ suonlehlahte ahi vua, amau’ gam sungah amau’ kamham ciet zangin, a innkuon kuonun amau’ ci le namte lahah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ham’ suonlehlahte: Cush, Egypt, Put, le Canaan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cush’ suonlehlahte: Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah, le Sabteca ahi hi. Raamah’ suonlehlahte: Sheba le Dedan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cush pen Nimrod’ pa hi a, leitungah a thahat galhang masa pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa mai-ah ama pen mi thahat sabengpa khat ahi hi; tua ahi ziehin ama pen, “ Topa mai-ah Nimrod bangin mi thahat sabeng pa,” na kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kumpi gam kipatna Babel, Erech, le Accad ahi a, tam teng zosie Shinar gam sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua gam panin Assyria gam sungah pei-in Nineveh, Rehoboth-ir, Calah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nineveh le Calah kikalah Resen khuopite a sat hi; Calah pen khuopi lien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Egypt pen Lud-te, Anam-te, Lehab-te, Naphtuh-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathru-te, Casluh mite le Caphtor-te’ pienna pupi hi a, tuate panin Philistia-te pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Canaan pen a ta masa Sidon le Heth’ pa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jebus-te, Amor-te, Girgash-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiv-te, Arki-te, Sin-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arvad-te, Zemari-te le Hamath-te’ pienna pupi ahi a, tam teng nua-ah Canaan-te a kithezah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Canaan-te’ gam in Sidon panin Gerar lam muhin Gaza cieng dong ban a, Sodom lam panin Gomorrah, Admah, Zeboiim, le Lasha cieng dong ban hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ innkuon, amau’ kamham, amau’ leitang le amau’ minamin Ham’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eber mi zosie pienna pupi, Japheth’ upa, Shem sung panin zong tate a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Shem’ suonlehlahte: Elam, Asshur, Arpachshad, Lud, le Aram ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aram’ suonlehlahte: Uz, Hul, Gether, le Mash ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arpachshad in tapa Shelah nei hi; Shelah in Eber tapa khat ma nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eber in tapa ni nei a, a masa pen Peleg kici-a, ama hun sungin a gam kiphalsuo ahi ziehin a naupa’ min pen Joktan ahisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joktan pen Almodad, Sheleph, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Obal, Abimael, Sheba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ophir, Havilah, le Jobab-te’ pienna pa ahi hi. Tam teng zosie pen Joktan’ suonlehlahte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Amau’ tenna gam pen Mesha panin Sephar lam muhin nisuona lam muoltung gam cieng dong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ innkuon, amau’ kamham, amau’ leitang le amau’ minamin Ham’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam teng pen a khangsimna uh zui-a, a gam sung vuah Noah tapate’ innkuon ahi hi. Tuizin tun zaw ciengin tam teng tung panin leitungah minamte a kithezah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amasa-in leitung buppi in kamham khat le kamteng kibang a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nisuona lam panin a na lal vua, Shinar gam sungah zanglei mun khat mu-in tua mun ah na teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate khatlekhat kiho-in, “Hing pei un, tehlei khengin halgaw vai,” kici uhi. Amate in suong tangin tehlei a zang vua, a tuhkip nadingin suongmeihol nai zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in, “Hing pei un, eimahaw adingin khuopi khat le a khumvum in vantungte dong a ban ding tausangpi khat lam vai-in, i min than nadingin bawl vai; tua banga i bawl sih leh leitung buppi-ah i kithethang ta ding uhi,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihingte’ lamsa khuopi le tausang en dingin Topa a kumsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in, “En un, amate minam khat ahi vua, amate zosie in kamham khat a nei uhi; tam pen a sep ding uh a kipatna ahi nabo hi; amate adingin sep dinga a gelte uh bangma a pieng thei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hing pei un, kuonsuh vai-in khatlekhat a thugen uh a kithei lo nadingin khum munah a kamham uh va sawpawi ta vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa in leitung muncin tengah amate thezah sieng a, a khuopi bawl uh a khawl ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tam khuopi pen Babel kici hi. Azieh pen Topa in khum munah leitung mi zosie’ kamham a sawpawipieh hi; khum mun panin Topa in leitung muncin tengah amate a thezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam teng pen Shem’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi. Shem kum zakhat a cin, tuizin tun zaw kum ni ciengin ama in Arpachshad kici tapa khat a nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Arpachshad pien nua-in Shem kum zakhat pha ta a, tapate le tanu dangte zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Arpachshad kum sawmthum le kum nga a phah zaw-in, Shelah kici tapa khat nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Shelah pien nua-in Arpachshad kum zali le kum thum dam lai a, tanute le tapa dangte zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Shelah kum sawmthum a phah zaw-in, Eber kici tapa khat nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eber pien nua-in Shelah kum zali le kum sawmthum dam lai a, tanute le tapa dangte zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Eber kum sawmthum le kum li a phah zaw-in, Peleg kici tapa khat nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Peleg pien nua-in Eber kum zali le kum sawmthum dam lai a, tanute le tapa dangte zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Peleg kum sawmthum a phah zaw-in, Reu kici tapa khat nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Reu pien nua-in Peleg kum zani le kum kuo dam lai a, tanute le tapate zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Reu kum sawmthum le ni a phah zaw-in, Serug kici tapa khat nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Serug pien nua-in Reu kum zani le kum sagi dam lai a, tanute le tapa dangte zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Serug kum sawmthum a phah zaw-in Nahor kici tapa khat nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nahor pien nua-in Serug kum zani dam lai a, tanute le tapa dangte zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nahor kum sawm ni le kum kuo a phah zaw-in Terah kici tapa khat nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Terah pien nua-in Nahor kum za le sawm le kuo dam lai a, tanute le tapa dangte zong nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Terah kum sawm sagi a phah zaw-in Abram, Nahor, le Haran te nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tu-in Terah’ suonlehlahte tam teng ahi hi. Terah in Abram, Nahor le Haran nei a, Haran in Lot nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Haran pen a pienna Chaldea gam Ur khuo-ah a pa Tera a si masangin a si hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abram le Nahor in zi nei uhi; Abram’ zi min pen Sarai hi a, Nahor’ zi min pen Haran’ tanu Milcah ahi hi. Milcah le Iscah’ pa pen Haran ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tu-in Sarai ciing a, ta a nei thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Terah in a tapa Abram le Haran’ tapa, a tupa ahi Lot, le a tapa Abram’ zi ahi a monu Sarai zawpi a, Canaan gam lam zuonin Chaldea gam Ur khuo panin a peiton uhi. Ahi vangin Haran a tun ciengun khum munah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Terah’ khan sung kum zani le kum nga hi a, Haran-ah ama a si hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Abram kungah, “Na gam, na be na phung le na pa’ inn nuasie inlen, kang lah ding gamah pei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minam lien khatin kang bawl ding a, thupha hing pie-in, na min ka liensah ding a, tuaci’n midangte adingin thupha na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang thupha ang piete thupha pie-in, nang ang samsiete ka samsie ding hi; nang tungtawnin leitung minam zosie in thupha a ngalaw ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa gensa bangin Abram pei a, Lot in zong a zui hi. Haran pan a peikhietin Abram kum sawm sagi le nga a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abram in a zi Sarai, le a sangampa’ tapa Lot, a kholsa a nei a lam teng, le Haran-a a sila nei teng zawpi-in, Canaan gam lam a zotpi hi. Canaan gam a tun ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abram in tua gam nawhin Shechem mun, Moreh gangpi sing lahah a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abram tungah Topa kilang a, tuale ama kungah, “Na suonlehlahte tungah tam gam ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin ama in a kunga a kilang Topa adingin maitam khat a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua mun panin Bethel nisuona lam muol tungah kituon a, nitumna lam Bethel, nisuona lam Ai khuo kikalah a puonbuh a sung hi. Khum munah Topa adingin maitam khat a lam a, ama in Topa’ min loin thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Negeb gam lam zuonin khuolzin kia dingin Abram kipan a, tua mun a tun dongin a banbanin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in Canaan gamah kielpi a tung hi. Tuaci’n kielpi a siet huoi ziehin Egypt gamah a pem dingin Abraham a peisuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Egypt gam a lut kuonin a zi Sarai kungah, “Nang pen numei melhoi khat na hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Egypt-te in ang mu cieng ule amate in, ‘Tam nu ama’ zi ahi hi,’ ang ci ding uhi; tua bepin kei ei thatin nang ang hinkhawi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang vang tawh kei ei kihinkhawi-in ei na kihoi bawl nadingin ka sangamnu-in hing kigen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Egypt gamah Abram a tun bepin Egypt-te in a zi a et ule melhoi a sa mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuale Pharaoh’ vaisaite in ama nu a mu ciengun, Pharaoh mai-ah a phat uhi. Amate in Pharaoh’ inn sungah tua numei a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua nu ziehin kumpipa in Abram a limbawl hi; tuaci’n ama in tuute, bawngtangte, laatangte, numei le pasal silate, laanute, le kalaoh-te a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in Abram’ zi Sarai ziehin Pharaoh le a innkuonpite tungah gimna lienpi a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh in Abram hlanin ama kungah, “Kei bang nei law ahiei? Ama na zi ahi lam bang dinga nei gen lo ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bang dinga ama, ‘Ka sanggam nu hi,’ na ci-a ka zi dinga nei lahsah ahiei? Tu-in na zi tanah om hi. Ama zawpi inlen pei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama tawh kisai-in Pharaoh in a mite thupie a, amate in a zi le a neisa teng tawh lampi-ah a hla uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n Abram in a zi, a neisa zosie, le Lot tawh, Egypt panin Negeb gam lam a zuonto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu-in Abram in ganhing, ngun, le kham a hau mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Negeb gam panin Bethel le Ai khuo kikala a puonbuh a lamcilna mun le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a maitam bawl masahna mun dongah ama pei a, khum munah Abram in Topa kungah thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abram tawh a zawhton ahi Lot in zong tuuhon, ganhon, le puonbuhte a hau ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tuaci’n a ni gela a tenton thei nadingin leitang in ama gel a va zo nawn sih hi; azieh pen ama gel’ neisa tam sengin a tengton thei ta sih gel hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale Abram’ gancingte le Lot’ gancingte kikalah kihauna a om ta hi. Tua gamah khum hunin Canaan-te le Perez-te a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abram in Lot kungah, “Kei le nang kikal, na gancingte le ka gancingte kikalah kihauna kici omsah sih vai; bangzieh ahei cile ei tegel pen sanggam khat i hibo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na mai-ah gam buppi om hi lo amah? Keima kung panin kikhen khie ta’n. Nang veilama na pei leh, kei zietlamah ka pei ding hi; nang zietlama na pei leh kei veilamah ka pei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lot in a kim a pam en a, tuale Jordan zanglei mun zosie in tui limtahin nga-in Topa’ um tawh hitale, Zoar lama Egypt leitang tawh hitale kibang hi, ci-in a mu hi. Tam pen Topa in Sodom le Gomorrah a suhsiet masang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Lot in ama adingin Jordan zanglei zosie teel a, nisuona lam zuonin Lot a zin hi. Ama gel tam bangin khatlekhat a kikhen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zanglei-a khuopite lahah Lot tengin Sodom dongah a puonbuhte khinin a om laitahin, Canaan gamah Abram a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua laitahin Sodom mite pen migilo ahi vua, Topa tunga mawna lien bawlte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lot tawh ama a kikhen zaw ciengin Topa in Abram kungah, “Tu-in na opna panin leilu lam, leitaw lam, nisuona lam, le nitumna lam ento in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />azieh pen na mu gam zosie nang le na suonlehlahte kang pie peisuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in na suonlehlahte, leitung leivui za-in tampi ka phasah ding hi; tuaci’n mi khat in leitunga leivui a sim thei leh na suonlehlahte zong kisim thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ding inlen, leitang a dung a vai kantanin pei in. Azieh pen nang tungah tua gam kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n a puonbuh tuo-in Abram pei a, Hebron gamsung, Mamre gangpi singte lahah a teng hi; ama in khum munah Topa adingin maitam khat a lam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Shinar Kumpipa Amraphel, Ellasar Kumpipa Arioch, Elam Kumpipa Chedorlaomer, le Goiim Kumpipa Tidal-te hun lai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tam kumpite in Sodom Kumpipa Bera, Gomorrah Kumpipa Birsha, Admah Kumpipa Shinab, Zeboiim Kumpipa Shemeber, le Bela (tua pen Zoar) kumpite tawh a kido uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam teng kipawlin Siddim kuom (Ci Tuipi) ah a galkapte a gawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in kum sawm le ni sung Chedorlaomer’ na a sem uhi. Ahi vangin kum sawm le thumna a cin ciengin amate in a ledo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kum sawm le li a cinin Chedorlaomer le a panpi kumpite a pei vua, Ashteroth-kalnaim gama Rephaim, Ham gama Zuzim, Shaveh-kiriathaim gama Emim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />le Seir muol tunga Hori mite gam, senel gam monga om El-paran gam dong a la uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua ciengin a kilekia vua, En-mishpat (Kadesh) ah pei-in Amalek-te’ gam zosie le Hazazon-tamar gama a teng Amor-te zong a zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Sodom kumpipa, Gomorrah kumpipa, Admah kumpipa, Zeboiim kumpipa, le Bela kumpipa (tua pen Zoar) a kuonkhie vua, Siddim kuomah kipawltonin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Elam kumpipa Chedorlaomer, Goiim kumpipa Tidal, Shinar kumpipa Amraphel, le Ellasar kumpipa Arioch tawh a kido vua, kumpi li in kumpi nga a do uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siddim kuom pen suongmeihol nai khuhte tawh a kidim hi. Sodom kumpi le Gomorrah kumpite a tai ciengun, tua khuhte sungah pawlkhat a kie vua, a omlai teng muol tungah a tai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n galte in Sodom le Gomorrah-te’ neisa zosie a tomgam vua, amau’ lampi-ah a pei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />amate in Sodom-a a teng Abram naupa’ tapa Lot le a nei a lam teng zong tomgam piehin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a suohta mi khat pei-in, Eshcol le Aner’ sanggampa, Amor mi Mamre’ gangpi singte gei-a a teng Hebrew mi Abram kungah a gen hi; tam teng pen Abram’ kipawlpite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sala a tupa a kimatna thu Abram in a zah ciengin, a inn sunga a suoh galsim dan a siem mi zathum le sawm le giet zawpi-in Dan dong del uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zan lai-in amate sim dingin ama’ galkapte, ama le a nasemte khenin amate a vatgawp vua, Damaskas’ leilu lam Hobah cieng dong a del uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a tupa Lot le a neisa zosie, numei le a galmatte tawh a peipikia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abram in Chedorlaomer kumpipa le a panpi kumpite a zawna panin a kilekia zaw ciengin, ama dawn dingin Shaveh kuom (Kumpipa’ Kuom) ah Sodom kumpipa a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Salem Kumpipa Melchizedek in an le lenggazu a puoh hi; ama pen Sangpen Pasien’ siempu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in tua pa thupha pie a, “Van le lei a siem, Sangpen Pasien in Abram thupha pie taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na galte na khut sunga ang pie Sangpen Pasien in thupha nga taheh,” a ci hi. Abram in na vannuoi’ sesawm-suo-sekhat ama a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Sodom kumpipa in Abram kungah, “Mi teng ei pie’n len, van zosie nangma’n kitan ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Abram in Sodom kumpipa kungah, “Van le lei a bawl Sangpen Topa Pasien kungah ka kiciem zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang in, ‘Abram keima hausah ahi hi,’ na ci khah lo nadingin na neisa vauzam khat ahi a, kedap khau khat ahi a, ahi sihle na neisa khat popo ahi zongin ka la sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tangvalte’ nehsate le kei ang zawpite’ satanh ding teng simlo bangma zamtawng ka la sih ding hi. Aner, Escol, le Mamre-te amau’ satanh ding pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng zaw ciengin a mangmuna sungah Topa’ kammal Abram tungah tung a, “Abram aw, zau sin, keima na lum ka hi hi. Na thaman gol mama ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahi vangin Abram in, “ Topa Pasien aw, kei bang nei pie diei? Azieh pen ta ka nei nai sih a, ka inn luo ding pen Damascus khuo mi Eliezer ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abram in, “Nangma in suonlehlah nei pie sih a, tuaci’n ka inn sunga a suoh sila khat ka gamhluo ding ahi ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin a kungah Topa’ kammal tung a, “Tam mipa pen na gamhluopa ahi sih ding hi; nangma-a’ tahtah lo buong koima na gamhluopa ahi sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a pulamah Abram peipi a, “Van lam enin aasite na sim thei leh sim in,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Na suonlehlahte tua bang ahi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuale ama in Topa a um a, Topa in tua khu dihna-in a simpieh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah, “Tami gam na luo nading vua Chaldea gam Ur khuo pana note ang peipi pa keima Topa ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “ Topa Pasien aw, tua gam ka luo ding lam bangci thei ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in, “Bawnglaa kum thum a cingsa khat, keelnu kum thum a cingsa khat, tuutang kum thum a cingsa khat, gam vakhu no khat le palva no khat ka kungah hing peipi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in tam teng zosie peipi a, tuate phal ni ciet suo-in phal khat le phal khat kimai ngatin a koi hi; ahi vangin vate phal ni a suo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ganhing site tungah sasielne vate a tuh uh ciengin Abram in tuate a heumang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ni a tum ciengin Abram a kimut a suoh mama a, tuale ama tungah a zauhuoi mielkingpi khat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Abram kungah, “Amau’ gam ahi lo gam khatah na suonlehlahte pemta-in a om ding vua, khum munah amate sila suohin kum zali sung kibawlsie ding hi, ci theicien in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ahi vangin a na a seppieh uh minamte tungah thukhenna ka tungsah ding a, tua zaw ciengin nei le lam tampi tawh amate a peikhie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang na hi leh na pu na pate kung lungnuom tahin na zuon ding a, a vuoikawnin ang kivui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khang lina ciengin amate tam munah a peikia ding uhi; azieh pen Amor-te’ mawna kicing nai lo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni a tum zaw khuo a miel ciengin a kiphalsuo sate kikalah meikhu beel khat le meivah kuong khat a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khum ni-in Topa in Abram tawh thuciemna bawl a, “Na suonlehlahte tungah tam leitang, Egypt gun panin Euphrates gun cieng dong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ken-te, Keniz-te, Kadmon-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hit-te, Periz-te, Rephaim-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amor-te, Canaan-te, Girgash-te, le Jebus-te’ leitang ka pie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Abram’ zi Sarai in ta nei lo hi. Ama in Hagar min nei Egypt-te sila numei khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sarai in Abram kungah, “ Topa in ka ta nei ding ei khahtan lam na thei hi; pei inlen ka sila numei nu va luppi ta’n; ama sung pana ta nei ding ka hi kha ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale Abram in Sarai’ thugen a mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n Canaan gamah Abram kum sawm a ten zaw ciengin Abram’ zi Sarai in Egypt mi a sila numei Hagar la-in a pasal Abram kungah a zi-in a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in Hagar luppi-in tua nu a gai hi; tuale a gai lam a kithei ciengin a pinu simmaw bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Sarai in Abram kungah, “Kei tunga a manlo-a ei kibawlna pen nang tungah tung taheh! Na kawi dingin ka sila numei kang pie a, ama in a gai lam a kithei bepin kei ei simmaw bawl hi. Topa in nang le kei kikalah thu khen taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin Abram in Sarai kungah, “Na thuneina sungah na sila numei a om hi; na dei bangin ama tungah bawl in,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin Sarai in tua nu a huotbawl pai a, ama kung panin a taimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in senel gam ciatui gei khatah tua nu a mu hi. Tua pen Shur zotna lampi gei-a ciatui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuale ama in, “Sarai’ sila numei Hagar aw, nang hei pana hing pei a, hei lam zuon ding na hiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Ka pinu Sarai kung pana a taimang ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in ama kungah, “Na pinu kungah peikia inlen ama tungah ki-ap in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa’ vantungmi in ama kungah, “Na suonlehlahte nahpitahin ka pungsah ding a, amate kisim zo lo ding hi,” zong a cibe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale Topa’ vantungmi in ama kungah, “Tu-in nang in nau na pai zo a, tapa khat na nei ding hi; Topa in na gentheina hing thudon zo ahi ziehin, ama’ min pen Ishmael na phuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama pen mihing lahah a gelsuoh laa bang ding a, ama’ khut in mi zosie langpangin, mi zosie’ khut in zong ama a langpang ding hi; a sanggamte zosie galbawlin a nungta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama a hopi Topa pen, “Nang, El-roi na hi hi,” ci-in a min phuo hi; azieh pen tua nu in, “Keima in Pasien ka mu zo tahtah ta a, tuale ama ka mu zaw-in kei a hing lai ka hi amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tua tuikhuh pen a min Beer-lahai-roi kici hi; tua khu Kadesh le Bered kikalah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abram in Hagar tawh tapa khat a nei hi. Abram in Hagar tawh a nei a tapa pen a min Ishmael phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hagar in ama adingin Ishmael a nei hunin Abram kum sawmgiet le guh a pha hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abram kum sawmkuo le kuo a phah ciengin ama kungah Topa kilah a, ama in, “Keima, Vanglien Pasien ka hi hi; ka mai-ah hoi gamtat inlen kawbaang sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima le nangma kikalah ka thuciemna ka bawl ding a, a tampitah kang phasah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abram mai kunsuh a, Pasien in ama kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tami khu kei adinga nangma tawh ka thuciemna ahi hi: Nang, minam tampite’ pa na hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na min Abram hi nawn lo ding a, Abraham hi ta ding hi. Azieh pen minam tampite’ pa dingin kang bawlzo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in nahpi tahin kang ciphasah ding hi. Minam liente kang suosah ding a, nang sung panin kumpite ang pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in nang le nang zaw cienga na suonlehlahte tungah Pasien ka hi nadinga tawntung thuciem ahi dingin, kei le nang le nang zaw cienga na suonlehlahte tungah a khan tungtawnun ka thuciemna ka kipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tulaitah pemta na hina leitang ahi Canaan leitang zosie, nang le nang zaw cienga na suonlehlahte tungah na nei den dingun kang pie ding hi; kei pen amau’ Pasien ka hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien in Abraham kungah, “Nang le nang zaw cienga na suonlehlahte in a khangkhangun ka thuciem na zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tami khu nang le kei kikal, nang le nang zaw cienga na suonlehlahte tawh kikala na zui ding uh ka thuciem ahi hi: Note lahah pasal zosie in tep a tan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang in na vundawn na tan ding a, tua pen keima le note kikalah thuciemna lim khat hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na khang tungtawnun note lahah a om pasal poma, na inn sung pieng silate, le na suonlehlahte ahi lo sum tawh na lei uh pasal poma a suo zaw uh ni giet a cin ciengin a tep uh kitan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na inn sunga piengte hile na sum tawh na lei silate hile, a nipi-in a tep kitan ding hi. Tuaci’n na tahsa sung vua ka thuciem pen kumtawn thuciem hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tep kitan lo pasal poma, ka thuciem palsat ahi a, ama’ mite kung panin kisumaimang ding hi; ama in ka thuciemna palsat zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasien in Abraham kungah, “Na zi Sarai ahile Sarai na ci nawn sih ding a, ama’ min Sarah hi ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama thupha ka pie ding a, tua banah ama tung panin tapa khat zong kang pie ding hi. Ama thupha ka pie ding a, ama in minam liente a piengsah ding hi; ama sung panin minamte’ kumpite pieng ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abraham a mai tuolkunin nui a, “Kum za pha pasal khat in ta nei thei ding amah? Kum sawm kuo a pha Sarah in ta a nei na ngel diei mah?” ci-in a lungsim sungah ama le ama a kiho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abraham in Pasien kungah, “Na mai-ah Ishmael hing nungtasah po lacin,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasien in, “Hilo hi, na zi Sarah in nang adingin tapa khat nei ding a, a min Isaac na phuo ding hi. Ama tawh ka thuciemna ka sukip ding a, tua khu ama zaw cienga a suonlehlahte adingin kumtawn thuciem ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ishmael adinga na ngetna ahileh ka za zo hi; ama thupha pie-in ka ciphasah ding a, pungsahin tampitah ka phasah ding hi; kumpi sawm le nite’ pa hi ding a, minam thupi khat ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin khuovei tuhun ciengin Sarah sung panin nang dinga ang suoh ding Isaac tawh ka thuciem ka sukip ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama tawh a kiho zaw ciengin Abraham kung panin Pasien a peito ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abraham in a tapa Ishmael le a inn sunga suoh pasal popo, silate ahi a, sum tawh kileite ahi zongin, ama’ inn sunga a om pasal zosie a unpi-in zawpi a, Pasien in ama kunga a gensa bangin tua ni mama-in a tep uh a tan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abraham a tep a kitan lai-in kum sawmkuo le kuo pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A tapa Ishmael a tep a kitan lai-in kum sawm le thum pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ni mama-in Abraham le a tapa Ishmael a tep uh kitan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A inn sunga pasal zosie, inn sunga suohte ahi a, gamdang mite’ tung pana sum tawh kileite ahi zongin, ama tawh a tep uh kitan ton hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mamre gangpite gei puonbuh lutna-ah sun nisat laitahin Abraham to a, tua laitahin ama kungah Topa kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a khuodah to leh a gei-a a ding mi thum a mu hi. Amate a mu bepin a dawn dingin puonbuh lutna panin tai a, tuolah bawhsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka Topa aw, na maipha ka nga leh na nasempa ei hleng sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui tawmkhat lasah vai-in na keng uh sil unlen sing hlim nei-ah khawl tadi un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nasempa kunga nang tun zo tah ngalun na toidam nadingun an halkhat hing tawi vangin, tua zaw ciengin peisuoh bep un,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n amate in, “Na ci bangin bawl in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sarah’ puonbuh sungah Abraham lutpai zinzianin ama kungah, “Annel hoite a tena thum mallangtahin bawl inlen, metnawi-in mohin hing bawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawnghon lahah Abraham tai-in, bawngno a dawng tuituoh khat man a, a nasempa pie-in a sa naw bawlsah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin bawngnawi thaukhal, bawngnawi, bawngsa minsa tawi-in a mai vuah a lui hi; singhlim nei-ah a neh laitahun a gei vuah ama a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in a kungah, “Na zi Sarah hei-a om ahiei? a ci ule ama in, “Khum taha puonbuh sungah,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin khat in, “Nau suo hun ciengin na kungah pel loin kang peikia ding a, na zi Sarah in tapa khat nei ding hi,” a ci hi. Sarah in ama’ nua puonbuh lutna-ah na ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu-in Abraham le Sarah a vuoikawn ta vua, a kum uh a ham mama ta hi; Sarah zong a numei ngaina teng tawp zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n Sarah amatangin nui a, “Kei ka vuoi zaw, ka pasal a vuoi zaw-in nuom ka sa na ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Abraham kungah, “Bang dingin Sarah nuinui-in, ‘Tu-in kei lah vuoikawn ta’ng a, kei ta nei tahpi ding ka mah? ci ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa adingin a lamdang seng khatpo a om amah? A kisesa nau suo hun ciengin na kungah kang peikia ding a, Sarah in tapa khat a nei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin a zau ziehin Sarah in niel a, “Ka nui sih hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Hina ve aw, nui ma teh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin khum mun panin mite pei-in Sodom lam a en uhi; amate hla dingin a lampi vuah Abraham in a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in, “Ka sil bawl dingte Abraham kungah ka pha talawm ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abraham pen nam lien le nam thahat suoh ding a, leitung minam zosie in ama ziehin thupha ngalaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pha vawt sih vang. Azieh pen Topa in Abraham tunga a ciemsa thu a tunsah thei nading, ama zaw cienga a pieng a tate le a innkuonpite in dihna le thutang sepna tawh Topa’ lampi a zui nadingun a hil dingin ama ka teelzo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in, “Sodom le Gomorrah langkhatah kikona bangza tahin lienin, a mawna uh bangza tahin siehuoi ahi tadiei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka kunga ang tung kikona bangin amate a gamta uh amah ci a kan dingin ka kumsuh kul hi; tua banga ahi sihle zong ka va thei ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Topa mai-ah Abraham a din laitahin khum mun panin mite kihei-in Sodom lam zuonin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abraham in va nai a, “Mi thumante, migilote tawh phietmangtha tahpi ding na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Gentena-in tua khuopi sungah mi thuman sawmnga om leh tua sunga om mi thuman sawmngate ziehin tua khuopi ngaidam loin tua mun phietmang ding na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi thumante, migilote tawh a kibah nadingin mi thumante le migilote thatton ding ci bang silte bawl vawt sin! Tua bangin na bawl poma sih ding hi! Leitung pumpi thukhenpa in a dihin khen lo ding amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuale Topa in, “Sodom khuopi sungah mi thuman sawmnga ka mu leh amate ziehin a khuozangun ka ngaidam ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abraham in dawng a, “Leivui le vut bang bep lel ahi keima in Topa kungah thu ei gensah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gentena-in mi thuman sawmnga muna dingah mi nga in sam ta leh tua mi nga a sap ziehin a khuozangin na susie veve diei mah?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Khum munah mi sawmli le nga ka mu leh ka susie sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abraham in ama hopikia a, “Gentena-in khum munah mi sawmli cieng beh om taleh,” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Mi sawmlite ziehin ka susie sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “ Topa aw, na lungthahsah sinlen thu kang gen ding hi. Gentena-in khum munah mi sawmthum kimu taleh,” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Mi sawmthum ka mu leh ka susie sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in, “ Topa kungah thu ei gensah in. Gentena-in mi sawmni cieng beh kimu taleh,” a ci hi. Ama in dawngin, “Mi sawmnite ziehin ka susie sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “ Topa aw, na lung thahsah sinlen khatvei kang gen lai ding hi. Khum munah mi sawm kimu leh,” a ci hi. Ama in dawngkia a, “Mi sawmte ziehin ka susie sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abraham tawh a kiho zaw ciengin a lampi-ah Topa a pei hi; tuale a inn ah Abraham a kilekia ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nitah lamin Sodom ah vantungmi ni tung a, Sodom khuo kulkotpi ah Lot na to hi. Lot in tua gel a galmu bepin a dawn dingin ding a, a mai tuolah kunin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka pute aw, hing thum ing. Na nasempa’ inn lamah hing kihei-in hing gieh ta unlen, na keng uzong sil un; tua ciengin zingmawng tungin thobai-in na maban uh na zom na ding uhi,” a ci hi. Ama gel in, “Hilo hi; ko pen khuolai tuol-awnga gieh ding ka hibo uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in nahpi-in ama gel a hlo hi; tuaci’n ama kungah ama gel kihei-in a inn sungah a lut uhi; tuale ama gel adingin pawi khat a bawlpieh a, tol saw lo anlum emin a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin a lup masangun tua khuosung mite, Sodom khuomite, a teh a khangin mi zosie in tua inn a imtawm uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />amate in Lot a hlan vua, “Tuzan na kunga zin hing tungte hei-ah a om ta uh ahei? Amate ka luppi thei nadingun ka kung vuah hing peipi in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lot zong kotkhah panin tua mite kungah pei-in a kot lekha a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka sanggamte aw, hing thum ing. Tam bangin gitlo gamtat sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En un, pasal tawh lumton nai lo ta ngahnu ni ka nei hi; note kungah tua gel hing puoh vangin na nop bangbangun ama gel tungah kigamtat ta un; tam mite bangma law sih beh un, azieh pen ka innhlim bel a ang lut ahi bo uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in a dawngkia vua, “Nuakin vawi!” a ci uhi. Tuale amate in, “Tam mipa ta sungah pemta khat a ang tung hi lel bo a, thukhen dan a ang kinei viel amah! Tu-in amate sangin nang kang khelbawl zaw ding uhi,” a ci uhi. Tua ciengin Lot a phul tentun vua, kotkhah phukeh dingin a nai tehteh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin inn sunga mite in a khut uh zahin inn sungah Lot kaiphitin amate tawh kot a kikhalu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale inn kotkhah-a om pasalte, a gol a neu-in kotkhah a mu lo nadingun amate in a mit uh a tawsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua zaw ciengin mite in Lot kungah, “Tam sungah adang koi a om lai ei? Mahte, tapate, tanute ahi sihle tam khuopi sungah mi khatpo na nei leh tam panin pusuopi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa mai-ah a mite kimawsahna awging lien luo mama a, a susie dingin Topa in kote ei sawl zo ahi ziehin tam mun a susie ding ka hi ta uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Lot pei-in a tanute a kinunpi ding amah dingte kungah, “Ding unlen, tam mun panin peidawh ta un; azieh pen Topa in tam khuopi a suhsiet ding ahi ta hi,” a ci hi. Hinanle amahte adingin ama pen a ciemmui tawh a kibang lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zingmawng phalvah ciengin vantung mite in, “Tho inlen, tam sunga a om na zi le na tanu nite la in. Tua ahi sihle khuopi danpiehna sungah no zong na sigam ding uhi,” ci-in Lot kungah genin a pausawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama a onton lai hi; tuaci’n Topa in ama a hepi ziehin vantung mite in ama, a zi le a tanu nite a bantang ah kai-in a pusuopi vua, khuopi pulamah a nuasie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in pulam a tut zaw ciengun, “Na hinna uh taipi un; kinua hei sih unlen, zanglei mun khatpo ah zong khawl vawt loin muol tungah kitai pai un, ahi sihle na sigam sieng ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lot in amate kungah, “Hilo hi, ka pute aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />en un, na mitmu-un na nasempa in maipha ka nga zo a, ka hinna nei hutdam nadingun kei tungah migitna lienpi nei lah zo ta uhi; ahi vangin muol tungah ka taizo sih a, gimna in ei nua phahin si ding ka zau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />En un, tai nading khopin khum khuopi a nai a, khuopi neu khat ahi hi. Khum tahah ei taisah un; khuopi neu khat hi lel lo amah? Tua hile suohta bep vang!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in tua pa kungah, “Hoi mama hi, tam maipha zong nang kang pie a, na khuopi gen pen ka lumlet sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kinaw inlen khum munah tai in. Azieh pen khumtah na tun masangsie ken bangma ka bawl thei sih hi,” a ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin khum khuopi pen Zoar kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zoar-ah Lot a tun ciengin leitungah ni suoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin van panin Topa in Sodom le Gomorrah khuopite tungah kaat le meikuong a zusah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ama in khuopite, zanglei zosie, khuopi sunga a teng mi zosie le leitunga po bangkim a lumlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahi vangin a nua-a om Lot’ zi a kinua hei le cikhuom a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa mai a dinnasa munah zingmawng tungin Abraham a pei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ama in Sodom, Gomorrah le zanglei muncin teng a ensuh leh meikhuh pana a khu bangin leitang pan meikhu kitung valuh pi a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pasien in zanglei tunga om khuopite a suhsiet ciengin Abraham a phawh a, Lot’ tenna khuopite a lumlet ciengin tua a lumletna panin Lot a peikhiesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zoar ah a ten ngam lo ziehin Zoar panin Lot peito-in a tanu nite tawh muol tungah a teng hi, azieh pen Zoar ah ama teng ngam lo hi; tuaci’n suonghawm sung khatah a tanu nite tawh a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A tanu tapen in a naunu kungah, “I pa lah vuoi ta a, tuale leitung ngaina banga i kiluppi ding pasal khat zong leitungah a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hing pei in, i pa lenggazu tekham vai, i pa tungtawnin suonlehlah i kepcing thei nadingin ama tawh lumton vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama gel in khum zanin a pa uh lenggazu a tekham uhi; tuale a unu pei-in a pa tawh a lumton hi. A pa in a tanu a lup lam le a thawkia lam a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A zing ni-in a unu in a naunu kungah, “En in, zani zanin i pa tawh ka lumton hi; tu zanin zong ama zu tekham vai. Tua ciengin i pa tungtawnin suonlehlahte i kepcing nadingin va pei inlen, ama tawh va lumton ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum zanin zong a pa uh zu a tekham uhi; tuale a naunu pei-in ama tawh a lumton hi; a pa in a tanu a lup lam le a thawkia lam a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua bang danin a tanu tegel a nipi-un a pa utawh a kigai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A unu in tapa khat nei a, a min Moab phuo hi; ama pen tuhun Moab-te’ pienna pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A nau in zong tapa khat nei a, a min Benammi ahisah hi; ama pen tuhun Ammon-te’ pienna pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum tah panin Negeb gam lamah Abraham khuol a zin a, Kadesh le Shur kikal Gerar ah a teng hi. Gerar ah pemta bangin a ten laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham in a zi Sarah pen, “Ka sanggamnu hi,” a ci le Gerar’ Kumpipa Abimelech in zong mi sawlin Sarah a lasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin zan khat Abimelech’ mangah Pasien pei-in a kungah, “Zi dinga na lah numei ziehin a si ding na hi hi; azieh pen ama pasal neisa ahi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hunin Abimelech in tua nu kung neh nai lo hi; tuaci’n ama in, “ Topa , mawpeng minam khat a susie ding na hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amama in keima kungah, ‘Ama ka sanggamnu hi,’ ei ci hi lo amah? Tuale amama in zong, “Ama ka sanggampa hi,” ei ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin lungsim siengtho le khut siengtho tawh tam banga gamta ka hi bo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mang sungah Pasien in, “A hi hi, lungsim siengtho tawh na bawl ahi lam ka thei hi; tua banah kei tungah nang maw lo nadinga nang ang kempa khu keima ka hi hi. Tua zieha ama kang khoisah lo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin tu-in tua mipa’ zi piekia in; azieh pen ama kamsang khat hi a, ama in nang thu ang ngetpieh ding a, tuaci’n nang na hing ding hi. Ahi vangin ama na piehkia sih leh nangma le na mite na unpi-un pel loin na si ding lam uh thei in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n zingmawngin Abimelech a tho bai a, ama in a nasemte zosie hlanin tam thu teng a unpi-in a kung vuah a gen hi; tuale mite a zau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abimelech in Abraham hlanin ama kungah, “Ko tungah bang hing bawl na hiei? Kei tung le ka kumpi gam tungah tam bang khielna lienpi nang tunsah nadingin nang tungah ken bangza-in mawna bawl ka hei? Keima tungah nang bawl dinga a kilawm lo nate nang bawlzo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abimelech in Abraham kungah, “Bang ngaisun a, tam na bawl ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham in, “Tam munah Pasien zatahna a om vawt sih ding a, ka zinu ziehin ei that ding uhi, ci-a ka ngaisut zieha tam ka bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua banah ama ka sanggamnu tahtah ahi a, ka pa’ tanu hi-in, ahi vangin ka nu’ tanu ahi sih hi; tuale ama keima’ zi ang suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien in ka pa’ inn panin ei pusuohsah ciengin keima in ama kungah, ‘Ka tunga nang bawl lo a phamaw na migitna tam ahi hi: I peina mun zosie-ah ama ka sanggampa ahi hi, ei ci’n,’ ka ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abimelech in tuu le bawngtangte, sila numei le sila pasalte la-in Abraham a pie a, ama kungah a zi Sarah zong a piekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abimelech in, “Na mai-ah ka leitang a om hi; na nopna mun popo-ah teng in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in Sarah kungah, “En in, na sanggampa ngun tang tulkhat ka pie zo hi; tami khu na oppi mi zosie mai-ah na maw nei lo lam kipulahna ahi hi; na maw lo lam kilang kilkel hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abraham in Pasien kungah thu ngen hi; tuale Pasien in Abimelech damsah a, ama gel in ta a nei thei nadingin a zi le a sila numeite zong a damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in Abraham’ zi Sarah ziehin Abimelech innkuon’ naubute zosie a khacip pieh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in a gensa bangin Sarah tungah bawl a, Topa in a khapsa bangin Sarah adingin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sarah gai a, Pasien in ama kunga a gensa hun a vuoi zaw-in Abraham in tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abraham in Sarah tawh a nei a tapa’ min Isaac a phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien in ama a thupiehsa bangin ni giet a phah ciengin Abraham in a tapa Isaac a tep a tanpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tapa Isaac a suo hunin Abraham kum zakhat a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in Sarah in, “Pasien in kei adingin nuizat nading ei bawlpieh zo hi. A za tapo in ei nuipi ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in, “Sarah in nau nawi pie ding hi, ci-in Abraham kungah koi in gen ngai poma ding ahei? Hizongnanle a vuoi a teh zaw-in ama tawh tapa khat ka nei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua naupang khangin nawi a tang hi; Isaac in nawi a tan ni-in Abraham in pawi thupi khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Abraham tawh a nei Egypt mi Hagar’ tapa in a tapa Isaac a ciemmui bawlna Sarah in a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Abraham kungah, “A tapa tawh tami sila numei nu notmang dawh ta’n; bangzieh ahei cile tami numei’ tapa in ka tapa Isaac tawh gou luoton lo ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama’ tapa zieha a pieng thu in Abraham lunggimsah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in Abraham kungah, “Naupang le na sila numei ziehin lunggim sin; Sarah in na kunga ang gen popo a gen bangin bawl lel in, azieh pen Isaac tungtawnin nang adingin na suonlehlahte kisim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua sila numei’ tapa zong na cihlah ma ahi ziehin minam khatin ka bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n zingmawngin Abraham a thobai a, an le savun tuithawl la-in Hagar a pie a, a liengko ah khaipiehin naupang tawh a sawlmang dawh ta hi. Tua nu pei-in Beer-sheba senel gamah a vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Savun thawl sunga tui a tawp ciengin ama in sawlbawh nei khatah tua naupang a sep dawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama nu pei-in thalkap khat tan a gamlatna munah a tapa elngatin a to hi; azieh pen ama in, “Tua naupang’ si ei ensah sih un,” a ci hi. Naupang elngatin ama a to laitahin a aw neiza tawh awngin a kap vapo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in naupang pa’ kaa a za hi. Van panin Pasien’ vantungmi in Hagar hlanin a kungah, “Hagar aw, bang in nang hing lungkhamsah ahei? Zau malmal sin; bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in naupang opna munah a kaana awging a za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hing pei in, tua naupang phong inlen, na khut tawh tupom in, bangzieh ahei cile ama minam lien khat ka suohsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in tua nu’ mit a honpieh a, tuikhuh khat a mu hi. Ama pei-in savun thawl-ah tui a dim a, naupang pa dawn dingin a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pasien in tua naupang ompi a, ama a khanglien hi; ama gamlahah teng a, thalkap siem khat a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Paran gamlahah ama a teng hi; tuale a nu in ama adingin Egypt panin zi khat a lahpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum hun laitahin Abimelech le a galkapmangpa Phicol in Abraham kungah, “Na sepna zosie-ah Pasien in nang ang ompi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tua ahi ziehin tu-in nang in kei, ka suonlehlahte le ka neisa zosie tungah a man lopi-in ei bawl loin, na tungah thuman tawh kang gamtat bangin kei tung le pemta banga na tenna leitang tungah nang gamtat nadingin Pasien tawh ka kungah hing kiciem in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuale Abraham in, “Ka kiciem hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Abimelech’ nasemte in a na lahpiehsa uh ahi tuikhuh tawh kisai-in Abraham in a lungkim lona teng Abimelech kungah a gen ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abimelech in, “Tam koi pen bawl ci ka thei sih hi; nang in lah ka kungah nang gen sih a, tuni dongin tam thu ka za sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n Abraham in tuute le bawngtangte la-in tuate Abimelech a pie a, ama gel in thuciemna khat a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abraham in tuuhon lah panin tuuno anu sagi a tuom koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuale Abimelech in Abraham kungah, “Tami na tuomkoi tuuno anu sagite, bang na cinopna ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in, “Tami tuikhuh pen keima tawsa ahina ka teci dingin tami tuuno anu sagite ka khut sung panin na sang ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ziehin tua mun Beer-sheba kici hi; azieh pen tua munah ama gel a nipi-un a kiciem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Beer-sheba ah thuciemna khat a bawl zaw ciengun a galkapmangpa Phicol tawh Philistia-te’ gamah Abimelech a kinuale hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abraham in Beer-sheba ah makeng kung khat suon a, khum munah Tawntung Pasien Topa’ min tawh thu a ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Philistia-te’ gamah Abraham, pemta bangin sawt veipi a teng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam thu teng zaw ciengin Pasien in Abraham a zelah hi. Ama in a kungah, “Abraham!” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Tanah om ing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “Na it na tapa, na tapa neisun Isaac zawpi inlen Moriah gamah pei in. Khum muna nang kunga kang lah ding muoltung khatah meihal biehna-in ama ei pie in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n zingmawngin Abraham thobai a, a laa phaw guongin a nasem tangval ni tawh a tapa Isaac a peipi hi; ama in meihal biehna-a zah dingin sing a tom a, ama dingkhie-in Pasien in ama a lahsa mun gamlatna dongah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in Abraham a khuodah leh a gamlapi panin khum mun a galmu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abraham in a tangvalte kungah, “Laa tawh tanah na om un; naupangpa le kei khumnah ka va pei ding uhi; ko gel in Pasien ka va bie ta ding vua, tua ciengin na kung vuah kang peikia ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham in meihal biehna sing la-in Isaac puosah a, ama in mei le nam a puo hi. Tuaci’n ama gel a zawhton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Isaac in a pa Abraham kungah, “Pa aw!” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Tanah om ing, ka ta aw,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Tanah mei le sing om napi meihal biehna ding tuuno hei sunga om ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham in, “Pasien in meihal biehpiehna dingin tuuno ei pie ding hi, ka ta aw,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama gel a peiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien’ lahsa munah a tun ciengun Abraham in tua munah maitam khat lamin sing a cieng hi. Ama in a tapa Isaac lep-ia in, maitam tunga singvum tungah a siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Abraham in a khut zahin a tapa that dingin naam a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa’ vantungmi in vantung panin ama hlan a, “Abraham, Abraham!” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Tanah om ing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “Naupangpa tungah na khut nga sin. Ama bangma law sin. Azieh pen tu-in Pasien na giin lamtah ka thei ta hi, bangzieh ahei cile na tapa, na tapa khat na neisun kei adingin na it lo lam ka thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abraham a khuodah leh hamphul lahah a ki-a awh tuutang khat a nua-ah na om hi. Abraham pei-in tua tuu man a, a tapa tangin meihal biehna-in a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n Abraham in tua mun pen “ Topa in ei sih hi,” ci-in min vaw a, tuni dongin, “ Topa’ muol tungah ei kisih ding hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Van panin Topa’ vantungmi in Abraham a ni veina hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nang in tam thu na bawl zo a, na tapa neisun it lo na hi ziehin, “Kei mama kang kiciem hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Nang thupha kang pie tahpi ding a, na suonlehlahte vana aasite le tuipi gei-a senel bangin tampi ka phasah ding hi. Nangma’ suonlehlahte in a galte uh’ tunkot a luo ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ka thu na ngai ziehin na suon na hlahte ziehin leitung minam zosie in thupha a ngalaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin tangvalte kungah Abraham kinuale-in Beer-sheba ah a peiton uhi; tuale Beer-sheba ah Abraham a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam teng zaw ciengin Abraham kungah, “En in, Milcah in zong na sanggamnu Nahor tawh tate nei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uz a tapen, Buz a nau, Aram’ pa Kemuel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chesed, Hazo, Pildash, Jidlaph, le Bethuel-te ahi uhi,” ci-in kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bethuel pen Rebekah’ pa ahi hi. Milcah in Abraham’ sanggamnu Nahor tawh tapa giet nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua tham loin a meinu Reumah in Tebah, Gaham, Tahash, le Maacah-te a nei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sarah kum za le sawmni le sagi sung a nungta hi; tam pen Sarah’ khankum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sarah pen Canaan leitang Kiriath-arba (tua pen Hebron) munah a si hi. Sarah ziehin Abraham da-in a kap hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A misi kung panin Abraham dingdawhin Hit-te kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kei pen note lahah ang teng khuolmi le pemta ka hi bo hi; ka muna panin ka misi ka vui thei nadingin a han ding mun khat ei pie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hit-te in Abraham kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka pu aw, ko thu ei ngai in; kote lahah nang a thahat ulien na hi hi. Ka hante uh na deina penpen-ah na misi vui lel in; na misi vui nading han koima’n ang hlaw vawt sih ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham dingin tua gammi ahi Hit-te lamah a kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Ka muna panin ka misi vui ding nei phal uleh ka thugen ei ngai unlen, Zohar’ tapa Ephron kungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama’ neisa Machpelah leihawm ka tanh dinga ei pieh nadingin ei ngetpieh un; tua khu ama’ logei-a om ahi hi. Misi vui nading muna ka nei dingin a man ding cingtaha ka pieh dingin ama in na muna vuah kei tungah ei piesah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua laitahin Hit-te lahah Ephron a to hi. Hit mi Ephron in khuopi tunkota ang lut Hit-te zosie’ zah dingin Abraham dawng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hi lo hi, ka pu aw, na ngai in; ka lo nang kang pie a, tua sunga om ka leihawm zong nang kang pie hi; ka mipite mai-ah nang kang pie hi; na misi vui lel in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua gam mite’ mai-ah Abraham a kunsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tua gam mite’ zahin Ephron kungah, “Pha na saha ahile ka thugen ngai in! Lo man kang pie ding hi; khum sungah ka misi ka vui thei nadingin kei tung panin a man sang in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ephron in Abraham a dawngkia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka pu aw, ka thugen ngai in; leitang beh khat in ngun shekel zali man hi. Nang le kei kikalah tua pen bang hi lel ahei? Na misi kivui lel in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ephron tawh Abraham a thukim uhi; tuale Abraham in Ephron adingin Hit-te’ zaha a gensa, tua hun laitaha sumbawlte tena tawh kituohin ngun shekel zali a te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Mamre nisuona lam Machpelah-a om Ephron’ lo, a sunga om a lo le leihawm tawh, tua mun zosie-a om lo sunga singkung zosie, le lo gam kimvela a po singkung zosie tawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hit-te mai le a khuopi tunkota ang lut mi zosie’ mai-ah a tanh dingin Abraham tungah kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam zaw ciengin Canaan gama om Mamre (tua pen Hebron) lam a kinga ahi Machpelah lolai-a leihawm sungah Abraham in a zi Sarah a vui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lo le a sunga leihawm pen Hit-te tung panin si vuina zah dingin Abraham tungah kipie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Abraham vuoi-in a kum a tam mama ta hi; tuale Topa in sil bangkimah Abraham thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham in a neisa zosie tunga vaihawm, a inn sunga a tapen a nasempa kungah, “Ka phei kawmah na khut hing koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van le lei Pasien, Topa tawh kang kiciemsah ding a, ka tenpi Canaan-te’ tanute lahah ka tapa’ zi ding na la sih ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka pienna gama ka tanaute kungah pei-in ka tapa Isaac’ zi ding na va la zaw ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nasempa in a kungah, “Numei nu in tam gamah ei zui nuom kha lo ding hi. Tuale na pienna gamah na tapa ka peipikia diei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham in ama kungah, “Khum munah ka tapa na son peipikia vawt lo ding thu thei siem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka pa’ inn pan le ka pienna gam panin kei ei ladawhin, ‘Na suonlehlahte tungah tam gam kang pie ding hi,’ ci-in ei hopi-in kei tunga ang kiciem Topa vantung Pasien in na mai-ah ama’ vantung mite hing sawlin nang in ka tapa’ zi ding khat na la ding hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin numei in ang zui nuom vawt sih leh, tami ka kiciemna panin nang na peng ding hi. Khum gamah ka tapa na peipi vawt sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu Abraham’ phei kawmah a nasempa in a khut koi-in tam thu tawh kisai-in ama kungah a kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin nasempa in a pupa’ kalaoh sawm kai a, ama kung panin a deitel letsong namkim la-in a pei hi; tuale ama dingin Aram-naharaim gam Nahor khuopi-ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in Khuopi pulam tuikhuh gei-ah kalaohte a bawhsah hi; tua hun pen nitah lam hi a, numeite tui tawi dinga a pusuo hun tah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka pu Abraham Pasien Topa aw, tuni-in lawcinna ei pie inlen, ka pupa Abraham tungah itna kip hing lah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuikhuh gei tam sungah kei ka ding a, khuopi ngahnute tui tawi dingin ang kuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima in, ‘Tui ka dawn thei nadingin na tuibeel hing ngasuh in,’ ka ci ciengin, ‘Dawn inlen na kalaohte zong tui hing dawnsah vang,’ ei ci penpen nu khu na nasempa Isaac dinga na sesa numei hing hisah ta’n. Tami tawh ka pupa tungah itna kip na lah lam ka thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thugen a man masangin Abraham sanggampa Nahor in a zi Milcah tawh a nei a tapa Bethuel’ tanu Rebekah in a liengko tungah tuibeel puo-in a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama ngaibaang mama a, koima tawh a lumton ngai nai lo ngahnu bih khat ahi hi. Tuikhuh ah tua nu kumsuhin a tuibeel dimin a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama dawntuo dingin nasempa tai pai a, “Hepina tawh na beel sung panin tui themkhat ei dawnsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua nu in, “Ka pu aw, dawn in,” a ci a, a khut tungah a beel ngiemsuhsahin a dawnsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A dawn ding tui a pieh zaw ciengin tua nu in, “Na kalaohte in zong a kham masangun a dawn ding uh tui va tawi ta vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in ganhing tuipiehna kuong sungah tui nawsunin a beel guohsahin tui tawi dingin tuikhuhah taikia-in a kalaoh zosie adingin tui a tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipa in a khuolzinna Topa in a lawcingsah zo ta amah, a lawcingsah sih ahei ci a thei nadingin sip dide-in tua nu a kaihlit khinkhian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kalaohte in tui a dawn zaw uh ciengin, mipa in tua nu adingin shekel lang a gih kham nahba khat, le a khuta a but ding shekel sawm a gih kham taucien ni la-in pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuale ama in, “Nang koi’ tanu na hiei, ei gen in. Na pa’ inn ah ka zangie nading uh ko adingin innkhan a om diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua nu in ama kungah, “Milcah in Nahor tawh a nei a tapa Bethuel’ tanu ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua nu in, “Butu le gan an ding tampi le gie nading mun zong ka nei uhi,” cibe lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mipa lu kunin Topa bie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ama in, “Ka pupa tunga a itna kip le a muonhuoina a taisan lo ka pupa Abraham’ Pasien, Topa in thupha nga taheh. Kei ka hileh ka pupa’ sanggamte inn zotna lampi-ah ama in ei peipi zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua numei tai-in tam thu teng a nu’ innkuonpite kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rebekah in sanggam pasal khat nei a, a min Laban ahi hi; Laban zong tuikhuha mipa kungah a tai pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ama in nahba le a nau nu’ khuta tauciente mu a, “Mipa in tam bangin ang gen hi,” ci-in a sanggamnu Rebekah’ thugen a zah behin mipa kungah ama a peipai hi; tuale tuikhuh-a kalaohte gei-ah ama na ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in, “Hing tum in, Topa’ thupha piehpa aw, bang dingin a pulamah ding den na hei? Inn ka puo zo ta a, kalaohte adingin mun a om hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuaci’n inn sungah mipa a lut hi; tuale Laban in kalaoh vante suo-in kalaohte neh ding butu le ganhingte an pie a, ama’ keng le a zawpite’ keng sil nading tui zong a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mai-ah neh ding an kilui hi; ahi vangin ama in, “Ka thu ka genzaw masangin an ka ne sih ding hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Hing gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in, “Kei, Abraham’ nasempa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa in nahpi tahin ka pupa thupha pie a, ama mihau khat ahi ta hi; Pasien in ama tungah tuuhon, bawnghon, ngun le kham, sila pasal le sila numei, kalaohte le laate tampi pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka pu’ zi Sarah in a vuoi nua-in ka pupa tawh tapa khat nei hi; ama in a neisa zosie ama a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka pupa in ei kiciemsah a, ‘A gam vua ka tenna Canaan-te’ tanute ka tapa’ zi dingin na la sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka pa’ innkuon, ka tanaute kungah pei-in ka tapa ading zi khat na la ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Keima in ka pupa kungah, “A numei in ei zui nuom lo kha thei ding hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in keima kungah, ‘A thu ka man Topa in nang tawh a vantungmi sawlin na peina-ah ang lawcingsah na ding hi. Nang in ka tanaute le ka pa’ innsung panin ka tapa adingin zi khat na la ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ka tanaute kunga na pei leh ka kiciemna pan na peng ding hi; amate in tua nu nang pie vateh sih nan uleh ka kiciemna panin na peng veve ding hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Tuni-in tuikhuh ah pei-in, ‘Ka pupa Abraham Pasien, Topa aw, tu-a ka peina lampi-ah ei lawcingsah in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuikhuh gei tam sungah keima ka ding hi; tui tawi dinga ang pei ngahnu nu kungah, “Ka dawn dingin na tuibeel sunga tui themkhat ei saw in, kang thum hi,” ka ci ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />tuale ka kungah, “Kidawn in, na kalaohte ading zong nang sawpieh vang,” ei ci nu khu ka pupa’ tapa dinga Topa in a sesa numei hing hisah in,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />“Ka lungsim sunga ka thunget a man masangin a liengko tungah a tuibeel puosa-in Rebekah ang pusuoh hi; tuikhuh ah ama peisuhin tui a tawi hi. Tuale ama kungah, ‘Tui ei dawnsah in,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua nu in a liengko tunga om tuibeel ang khiesuh pai a, ‘Dawn aw, na kalaohte zong tui hing pie vang,’ ei ci pai hi. Tuaci’n ka dawn a, ama in kalaohte zong tui a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua zaw cieng in tua nu kungah, ‘Nang koi tanu na hiei?’ ci-in ka dong hi. Tua nu in, ‘Nahor in Milcah tawh a nei a tapa Bethuel’ tanu ka hi hi,’ ei ci hi. Tuaci’n a nahkuo-ah nahba ka basah a, a khutah taucien ka bunsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tua ciengin lukunin Topa ka bie a, a tapa ading ka pupa sanggampa’ tanu ka nga nadingin lampi mana keima ei pui ka pupa Abraham’ Pasien, Topa ka phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin tu-in ka kiziet hei ding le ka kivei hei ding ka thei nadingin ka pupa tungah muonhuoi tah le a mantahin na gamtat ding uleh ei gen un; na gamtat sih ding uleh zong ei gen un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tua ciengin Laban le Bethuel in dawng a, “Tam thu Topa kung pana ang pei ahi hi. Nang kungah a sie ahi a, a pha ahi zongin kang gen thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />En in, na mai-ah Rebekah om hi. Ama la-in pei unlen, Topa in ang gensa bangin ama na pu tapa’ zi hisah in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Abraham’ nasempa in tam thu a zah ciengin Topa mai leilahah a kunsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tuale nasempa in ngun le kham kizepnate le puonte lakhie-in amate tungah Rebekah a pie hi; ama in a naupa le a nu zong a manham kizepnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama le a zawpite in an ne tui dawnin a om vua, khumnah a zan gie uhi. Zingmawng a thaw ciengun ama in, “Ka pupa kungah ei peisahkia ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A sanggampa le a nu in, “A tawmpen ni sawm sung beh khat ko tawh ngahnu nu hing omsah lai un; tua ciengin hing peisah na va ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “ Topa in ka khuolzinna ei lawcingsah zo ta ahi ziehin, ei kihehsah nawn da un; ka pupa kung zuonkia dingin ei peisah ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Amate in, “Ngahnu nu hlanin ama dong vai,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Tuale Rebekah a hlan vua, “Tampa na zui pai ta diei mah?” a ci uhi. Ama in, “Zui vang,” ci pai lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in zong a sanggamnu uh Rebekah le a cing nu, Abraham’ nasempa le a mite tawh a peisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tuale amate in Rebekah thupha pie-in ama tungah, “Kote’ sanggamnu aw, a tul tampite’ nu hi ta’n len; na suonlehlahte in a galte uh’ tunkotte luo ta uheh!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rebekah le a nasem numeite a ding dawh vua, kalaohte tungah tuongin mipa a zui uhi; tua bangin nasempa in Rebekah zawpi-in a lampi-ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Tu-in Beer-lahai-roi panin Isaac pei-in Negeb gamah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Nitah lamin gamlaha pei dingin Isaac a pusuoh hi; a khuodah leh ama in kalaoh ang peite a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Tuale Rebekah khuodahin Isaac a mu ciengin a kalaoh tung panin naw kumsuh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />a nasempa kungah, “Khum gamlaha eite ei dawn dinga ang pei pa koi ahiei?” a ci hi. Nasempa in, “Ka pupa ahi hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a maituom la-in a kikhu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Tuale a nasempa in Isaac kungah a sepnasa zosie a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaac in a nu Sarah’ puonbuh sungah tua nu a tumpi hi. Ama in Rebekah la-in ama pen a zi a suoh hi. Ama in tua nu a it hi. Tuaci’n a nu si zaw ciengin Isaac a hlamuong hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham in zi dang khat la a, a min Keturah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua nu in ama tawh Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak, le Shuah nei hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jokshan pen Sheba le Dedan’ pa ahi hi. Dedan tate pen Asshurim, Lethusim, le Leummim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midian’ tate pen Ephah, Epher, Hanoch, Abida, le Eldaah ahi hi. Tam teng zosie, Keturah’ suonlehlahte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham in a neisa zosie Isaac tungah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahi vangin a zi dang tawh a nei a tate zong ama dam sungin letsongte pie a, a tapa Isaac kung panin nisuona lam manaw-in nisuona gamah amate a sawlmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam pen Abraham khankum ahi a, kum za le kum sawmsagi le nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham in a nukhia pen a hu sang a, a vuoi, kum tampi a pha, a khanghamin si a, a mite tawh kigawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tapa Isaac le Ishmael in Mamre nisuona lam Hit mi Zohar’ tapa Ephron’ logam Machpelah leihawm sungah ama a vui vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua mun pen Abraham in Hit-te kung pana a lei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham si nua-in Pasien in a tapa Isaac thupha a pie hi. Tuale Beer-lahai-roi ah Isaac a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam teng pen Abraham in Sarah’ sila numei, Egypt mi Hagar tawh a nei Abraham’ tapa Ishmael’ suonlehlahte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam teng pen a suona dungzui-in a kiminvaw Ishmael tate’ min ahi hi: A suoh masapen Nebaioth ahi hi; tuale Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Naphish, le Kedemah ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam teng pen Ishmael’ tate ahi vua, a khuo, a giephuol, le a be utawh kizui-in ulien sawm le nite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />(Tam pen Ishmael’ khankum ahi a, kum za le kum sawmthum le sagi ahi hi; ama in a hu tawpna sangin si a, a mite tawh kigawm hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate, Havilah panin Assyria lam zotna Egypt tawh kigalsai Shur khuo-ah a teng uhi; ama’ mite zosie gei-ah ama a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam teng pen Abraham tapa Isaac’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi: Abraham pen Isaac’ pa hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isaac kum sawmli a phahin Paddan-aram gama Aram mi Bethuel’ tanu Laban’ sanggamnu Rebekah tawh kinung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Isaac in a zi adingin Topa kungah thu ngen hi, azieh pen ama in ta nei lo hi; Topa in a thungetna dawngin a zi Rebekah a gai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A sunga nausen gel kibuonbuon uhi. Tuale ama in, “Tam bang ahi mawh leh bang dinga nungta bep ka diei?” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Topa dong dingin ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in ama kungah, “Na gil sungah minam ni om a, na sunga pieng mihing nite a kikhen ding hi; khat pen a khat sangin hatzaw ding a, a uzaw in a nauzaw’ na sem ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A suo hun a tun ciengin a gil sungah takop a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A suoh masa pen a cisan sa-in suoh a, a pum tung zosie mul nei tawh kibang hi; tuaci’n amate in a min Esau phuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin a khutin Esau’ ketul tu kawmin a sanggampa a suoh hi; tuaci’n ama pen a min Jacob kiphuo hi. Ama in tuate a nei hunin Isaac kum sawmguh a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Naupangte a khangliet ciengun Esau pen gamsung mi sabeng siem khat hi a, Jacob pen mi kamtawm, puonbuh sunga teng mi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isaac in a samat a neh ziehin Esau a it hi; ahi vangin Rebekah in Jacob a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khatvei Jacob in ancim a huon laitahin Esau a gamvana pan a gilkielsa-in a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Esau in Jacob kungah, “Ka gil nah kiel seng ahi ziehin tua na ancim san halkhat ei nesah in!” a ci hi. (Tua ahi ziehin ama’ min Edom kici hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jacob in, “Na innluoza ei zua masa in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Esau in, “A si ding ka hi ta hi; innluoza banga ka man ding ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jacob in, “Amasa-in ka mai-ah hing kiciem in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a kungah ama kiciem a, Jacob kungah a innluoza a zua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in Esau an le beme pie a, ama in ne-in dawn a, tuale dingin a lampi-ah a pei hi. Hi ci bangin Esau in a innluoza a simmaw bawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham hun lai-a kielpi masa banah tu-in gam sungah kielpi khat a tung hi. Gerar ah Philistia Kumpipa Abimelech kungah Isaac a haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isaac kungah Topa kilahin, “Egypt gamah peisuh sin; nang kang lah ding gamah teng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tam gamah pemta bangin teng inlen, nang hing ompi-in thupha kang pie ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile nang le na suonlehlahte tungah tam gam kang pie ding a, na pa Abraham tunga ka ciemsa kiciemna ka tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na suonlehlahte vana aasi bangin tampi ka phasah ding a, na suonlehlahte tungah tam gam teng zosie ka pie ding hi; na suonlehlahte ziehin leitung minam zosie in thupha a ngalaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Abraham in ka thumangin ka sawlna, ka thupiehnate, ka thukipte le ka thukhamte a zui hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n Gerar ah Isaac a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khum muna mite in a zi vai a dawh uh ciengin ama in, “Ama ka sanggamnu ahi hi,” a ci hi. Azieh pen, “Rebekah pen ngaibaangin tua gam mite in ama ziehin ei that kha va uh,” ci-in ngaisun ahi ziehin, “Ka zi ahi hi,” a ci ngam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khum munah Isaac sawtveipi a op zaw ciengin Philistia Kumpi Abimelech in a tawlet pan a khuodah leh Isaac in a zi Rebekah a no laitah a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Abimelech in Isaac hlanin, “Na zi tahtah hi mawh lo amah! Tuale bang dinga, ‘Ka sanggamnu hi,’ na ci ahei?” a ci hi. Isaac in ama kungah, “Ama ziehin silaw kha vang ci-a ka ngaisut zieh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abimelech in, “Ko tunga nang bawl tami khu bang ahiei? Mite khatpo na zi tawh na lumton thei mai ding a, tua hile ko tunga khielna ei tun na hi ta ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n Abimelech in mi zosie galgih a, “Tampa ahi a, a zinu ahi zongin a khoi kha poma kithat ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Isaac in tua leitangah khai tu a, tua kum ma-in a za zakhat a la hi. Topa in thupha pie a
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tua pa mihau khat a suoh hi; mihau mama khat a suo dongin a nei a lam a kibelap semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in tuuhon, bawnghon, le innkuon tampi nei a, Philistia-te in ama a eng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />(A pa Abraham hun lai-a a pa’ nasemte in a na taw uh tuikhuh zosie tu-in Philistia-te in lei vua-in a khacip sieng uhi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abimelech in Isaac kungah, “Ko kung panin pei ta un; nang pen ko adingin vang lien ta luo teh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum mun panin Isaac pei-in Gerar kuom sungah phuol satin khum sungah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Isaac in a pa Abraham’ hun lai-a kitosa tuikhuhte a topha kia hi; azieh pen Abraham a si zaw ciengin Philistia-te in tuate a khacip sieng uhi; tuale ama in a pa na phuosa minte ma a phuokia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Isaac’ nasemte in tua kuom sungah tuikhuh to-in tuisam luonna khat a mu vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gerar gancingte le Isaac’ gancingte kihau-in “Tuikhuh ko-a’ hi bo,” a kici uhi. Tuaci’n ama in tua tuikhuh Esek ci-in min phuo hi. Azieh pen amate le Isaac kisel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuikhuh adang khat a tokia vua, tua vai-ah zong a kihaukia leuleu uhi; tuaci’n ama in tua tuikhuh’ min Sitnah ahisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum mun panin ama kituonin tuikhuh adang khat to a, tua vai-ah a kihau nawn sih uhi. Tuaci’n ama in tua tuikhuh’ min Rehoboth hisah a, “Tu-in Topa in eite adingin mun ei bawlpieh zo a, tam gamah i pung ding uhi” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khum mun panin Beer-sheba ah ama peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuale khum ni zan ma-in ama kungah Topa kilah a, “Keima na pa Abraham’ Pasien ka hi hi; zau sin, azieh pen ka nasempa Abraham ziehin nang kang ompi a, nang thupha hing pie-in na suonlehlahte tampitah kang phasah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in khum munah maitam khat lamin Topa bie a, khum mun ma-ah a puonbuh a sung hi. Khum munah Isaac’ nasemte in tuikhuh khat a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Gerar panin a thudawhpi pa Ahuzzath le a galkapmangpa Phicol tawh ama kungah Abimelech haw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Isaac in a kung vuah, “Note in kei ei muda-in na kung pan vua nei nawmang uh hi napi-in bang dingin kei kunga hing haw na hi uh ahei? “ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in, “ Topa in nang ang ompi lam cien tahin ka mu zo ta uhi. Tuaci’n nang le ko kikalah kiciemna khat om leh ka ci vua, tuale nang tawh thuciemna khat bawl vai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuaci’n kote in nang hing sukha vawt loin na tungah sil hoi bawl ding ci simlo note bangma hing law lo a, lungnuom taha kang peisah tehteh bangin, nang in zong kote tungah sietna nang bawl sih ding hi. Tu-in nang pen Topa’ thupha pieh na hi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate adingin pawi khat bawlpiehin an ne tui dawnin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Zingmawngin amate thobai-in khatlekhat kiciemna a bawl uhi; Isaac in a lampi vuah amate hla a, ama kung panin lungnuomin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khum ni ma-in Isaac’ nasemte pei-in a tawsa uh tuikhuh tawh kisai-in ama kungah a gen vua, “Tui ka mu ta uhi!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in tua pen a min Shibah phuo hi; tua ziehin tuni dongin tua khuopi’ min Beer-sheba kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Esau kum sawmli a phah ciengin Hit mi Beeri’ tanu Judith le Hit mi Elon’ tanu Basemath a zi-in a la hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />ama gel in Isaac le Rebekah’ hinkhuo gentheisah mama uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isaac vuoi-in a mit mangin khuo a mu thei nawn lo ciengin ama in a tapa tapen Esau hlan a, ama kungah, “Ka tapa aw,” a ci hi; ama in dawng a, “Kei tanah om ing,” a ci hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in, “En in, kei ka vuoi ta hi; ka si ding hun ka thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ziehin tu-in na hiemte ahi na thallawngte le na thal la inlen, gamlahah pei-in kei adingin sa va beng ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka si masangin thupha kang pieh thei nadingin ka du danin an tui mama hing huon inlen, ka neh dingin ka kungah hing peipi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaac in a tapa Esau a hopi laitahin Rebekah in na ngaidap hi. Tuaci’n Essau in a pa a puoh ding sa beng a gam a kuon ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rebekah in a tapa Jacob kungah, “Na sanggampa Esau kungah na pa thugen ka za a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Ka si masangin Topa mai-ah thupha kang pieh thei nadingin ka kungah gamsa ei puoh inlen, ka neh dingin an tui mama hing bawl in,’ a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in ka tapa aw, kang sawl bangin ei mang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na pa du danin antui ka bawl thei nadingin keelhon lahah va pei inlen keelno a hoi ni hing peipi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A si masangin thupha ang pieh thei nadingin na pa neh dingin ama kungah tuate na puoh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jacob in a nu Rebekah kungah, “En in, ka sanggampa Esau a mulpha ahi a, kei pen a cinel ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pa in kei ei tham kha thei ding a, koi thupha nga tah sangin ama simmaw tawh ka kibang ding a, kei le kei samsiet kitun ka suohzaw thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nu in ama kungah, “Ka tapa aw, keima tungah nang ang kisamsietna tu taheh; ka thu ei mang tapo inlen, va pei-in ka kungah keelnote ei puoh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama pei-in tuate manin a nu kungah a peipi hi; tuale a nu in a pa dei danin an tui mama a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rebekah in a inn-a a kep, a tapa uzaw Esau’ puonhoi pente la-in a tapa nauzaw Jacob a silsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale ama in a khut tung le a cinelna mun a ngawng tengah keelnote’ vun a silsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama nu in a bawlsa antuite le anlumte a tapa Jacob a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pa kungah ama pei a, “Ka pa aw,” a ci hi; tuale ama in, “Tanah om ing; nang koi na hei, ka tapa aw?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jacob in a pa kungah, “Keima na tapa tapen Esau ka hi hi. Nei gen bangin ka bawl zo ta hi; tu-in to inlen kei thupha nei pieh thei nadingin ka sa matsa ne in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahi vangin Isaac in a tapa kungah, “Ka tapa aw, bangci a nang hici mat zuai thei ahiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “ Topa na Pasien in kei ei lawcinsah zieh ahi hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaac in Jacob kungah, “Ka tapa aw, ka ta Esau tahtah na hi amah, awle na hi sih ahei ci kang thei nadingin kang tham thei nadingin ka kung ei nai vawi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pa kungah Jacob peito-in ama a tham a, tuale ama in, “A aw lah Jacob’ aw a bang a, ahi vangin a khut lah Esau’ khut a bang vanuh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A sanggampa Esau’ khut bangin a khutte a mul a phat ziehin ama in a khencien thei sih hi; tuaci’n ama thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in, “Nang ka tapa Esau tahtah na hiei mah? a ci hi. Ama in, “Hi ma ing,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Keima in na sa matsa ne-in thupha kang pieh thei nadingin ka kungah hing peipi in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a kungah a peipi a, ama in a ne hi; tuale ama in lenggazu zong ama kungah peipi-in ama in a dawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pa Isaac in ama kungah, “Ka kung hing nai inlen ei nam in, ka tapa aw,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in nai phei-in ama a nam hi; tuale ama in a puon gim dihin ama thupha pie a, “Ah, ka tapa gimnam khu Topa’ thupha a piehsa gamlah gimnam tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien in na tungah van daitui, leitang hoi le an le lenggazu a kiningcingin hing pie taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mite in na na semin, na mai-ah minamte kun uheh. Na sangamte tungah a topa hi inlen, na mai-ah na nu’ tapate kun uheh. Nang ang samsie poma samsiet hi hinlen, nang thupha ang pie poma thupha nga hi taheh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Isaac in Jacob thupha a pieh zaw, a pa Isaac kung panin Jacob a pei zaw diemin a gamvana panin Esau a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in zong an tuituoh huonin a pa kungah a peipi hi. Ama in a pa kungah, “Kei thupha nei pieh thei nadingin ka pa thoto inlen na tapa’ sa matsa ne in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A pa Isaac in ama kungah, “Nang koi na hiei?” a ci hi. Ama in, “Kei na tapa tapen Esau ka hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua bepin Isaac nahpitahin ling a, “Tua ahile ka kunga a gamsa matsa ei puohpa koi hi mawh ahei? Nang hing pei masangin tua teng a unpi-in ka ne zo a, ama thupha ka pie zo ta hi. Hi hi, ama thupha nga ding ahi mawh ta khula!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Esau in a pa thugen a zah bepin nahpitah le nasie tahin kapin a pa kungah, “Kei thupha ei pie bo ven, kei zong, izaw ka pa!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “Na naupa zuouthu tawh ang pei-in na thupha la siengzo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Esau in, “Ama’ min Jacob a kivaw khu man ngel hi lo amah? Azieh pen ama in ni vei ei sol zo hi. Ama in ka innluoza ei lahpieh hi; tuale en in, tu-in ka thupha ei lahpieh leuleu hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in, “Kei adingin thupha khat beh na hen ta sih amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Isaac in Esau dawng a, “Ama pen na topa dingin ka bawl zo ta hi. A na sem dingin a sanggam zosie ka pie zo a, an le lenggazu tawh ama ka va zo hi. Tua ahi ciengin nang adingin bang kang bawlpieh thei nawn ding ahei, ka tapa aw?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Esau in a pa kungah, “Ka pa aw, thupha khat beh na nei ta sih amah? Kei thupa ei pie in, kei zong, ka pa aw!” a ci hi. Tuale Esau nahpitahin kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pa Isaac in a dawng hi: En in, na tenna mun khu leitang hoi panin a kigamla ding a, van daitui tawh zong a kigamla ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na namsau tawh na nungta ding a, nang in na sanggampa’ na na sem ding hi. Hizongle ama na ledo ciengin, na ngawng panin a hahkol na kuoitan ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A pa in Jacob thupha a pieh zo tah ziehin tu-in Esau in Jacob muda a, tuale Esau in, “Ka pa ading kaa le mau hun ang nai ta hi; tua ciengin ka naupa Jacob ka that ding hi,” ci-in ama le ama a kiho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hizongle Rebekah kungah a tapa tapen ahi Esau’ thugen teng kigen hi; tuaci’n ama in a tapa nauzaw Jacob hlansahin ama kungah, “Na upa Esau in nang hing tha sawmin ama le ama kihenem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka tapa aw, tu-in ka thu ei mang in; Haran-a ka naupa Laban kungah mallangtahin va tai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />na tunga na sanggampa thangpaina a ven masangsie ama tawh bakhat sung va omton inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />na sanggampa a thangpaina ang ven a, a tunga na bawlna teng a mangngil zaw dong cieng va om ta’n. Tua ciengin mi sawlin khum mun panin kang lasah ding hi. Nikhat thu-in na nipi gelin bang dingin hing tan ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rebekah in Isaac kungah, “Hit numeite ziehin ka hinkhuo ka cimtah ta hi. Jacob in tam gama numeite lah panin tam bang Hit numeite hing kinunpi mawh leh kei adingin ka hinkhuo bang matlap om ding ahei,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Isaac in Jacob hlanin ama thupha pie a, tuale thuhilin, “Canaan numeite tawh na kinung sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Paddanaram-a na nu’ pa Bethuel’ inn ah thakhatin pei in; khum muna na nu’ sanggampa Laban’ tanute khat zi-in va la ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi honpi khat na suo thei nadingin Vanglien Pasien in nang thupha hing pie hinlen, hing ciphasahin tampi hing phasah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien in Abraham a piehsa, tu-in pemta banga na tenna leitang na nei thei nadingin ama in Abraham’ thupha nangma le na suonlehlahte tungah hing pie taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua bangin Isaac in Jacob a peisah hi; tuale Jacob le Esau’ nu Rebekah’ sanggampa Aram mi Bethuel’ tapa Laban opna Paddanaram-ah ama a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in Isaac in Jacob thupha pie zo a, khum tah panin Paddanaram-ah zi la dinga a sawl lam le thupha a piehin, “Canaan numeite na tenpi sih ding hi,” ci-in ama thuhil a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jacob in nu le pa thu mangin Paddanaram ah a pei zo lam Esau in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n Canaan numeite in a pa Isaac a lungkimsah lo lam uh zong Esau in a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ishmael kungah Esau pei a, a neisa a zite banah Abraham’ tapa Ishmael’ tanu, Nebaioth’ sanggamnu Mahalath a zi-in a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jacob in Beer-sheba khuo nuasie-in Haran lam zuonin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mun khatah ama tung a, ni tumzo ahi ziehin tuanah a zan gie hi. Tua munah suongtum khat la a, tangkhamin nei-in a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in mang man a, tua a mangin leitungah kalei khat kidaw-in a dawn in van holto hi; tua kalei tungah Pasien’ vantung mite kato kumsuhin a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A gei-ah Topa ding a, “Kei pen na pu Abraham’ Pasien le Isaac’ Pasien, Topa ka hi hi; nang le na suonlehlahte tungah a tunga na lupna leitang kang pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />na suonlehlahte lei-a leivui za-in a tam ding vua, nitumna lam, nisuona lam, leilu lam le leitaw lamah na kizel ding uhi; nang le na suonlehlahte tungtawnin leitung minam zosie in thupha ngalaw ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang hing ompi-in na peina po-ah kang cing ding a, tam gamah kang peipikia ding hi, ci thei in; bangzieh ahei cile na tunga kang ciemsa thute ka bawl sieng masangin nang kang nuasie sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kimutna panin Jacob a khanglo a, “Tam munah Topa om tahtah a, ken lah ka thei kha vawt sih hi!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale ama zau a, “Tami mun bangza taha zau huoi ahiei! Tami khu Pasien’ inn lo adang hi lo a, tami khu vantung lutna kotpi ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n zingmawngin Jacob thobai a, ama in a tangkham-a a zah suongtum la-in khuomin phut a, a tungah sathau a sungsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in khum mun a min Bethel a hisah hi; ahi vangin a masa-in khum khuopi’ min Luz ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in kiciemna khat bawlin, “Pasien in kei ei ompi a, tami ka peina lampi-ah ei kemin neh ding an le sil ding puonte ei pieh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ka pa’ inn lumah lungmuong taha ka tunkia leh, Topa khu ka Pasien ahi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />khuoma ka phu tami suongtum zong Pasien’ inn ahi ding hi; kei nei pieh zosie tungah sesawm- suo-sekhat pel loin nangma kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in a khuolzin maban zom a, nisuona lam mite’ gam a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama a khawdah leh gamlahah tuikhuh khat le a gei-a a lum tuuhon thum a mu hi; azieh pen tua tuikhuh panin tuuhonte tui kipie hi. Tuikhuh vang tunga a om suong pen gol mama a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuuhon zosie khum munah a kisuhtuo ciengun tuucingte in tuikhuh vang suong a liadawh vua, tuute tui pie-in tuikhuh vang tung ama opna ngai-ah tua suong a koikia zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jacob in a kung vuah, “Ka sanggamte aw, hei pana hing pei na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Haran pana hing pei hi ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Nahor’ tapa Laban na thei kha vuoi mah?” a ci hi. Amate in”Thei ma ung,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Ama a dam beh nai mah?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Dam na,” ci-in a dawng vua, “A tanu Rachel zong a tuuhon tawh tamnah ang pei,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in, “En in, ni lah sang lai hi; gan hawi hun nai lo hi. Tuute tui pie unlen, pei-in an maisah lai un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in, “Tuuhon zosie ang kisuhtuo a, tuikhuh vang suong a kiliadawh masangin tuuhonte tui ka pie thei sih uhi; tua ciengin tuute tui ka pie thei beh uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate tawh a kiho laitahin Rachel a pa’ tuute a tung hi; azieh pen ama tuate cing ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in Jacob in a nu’ sanggampa Laban’ tanu Rachel le a nu’ sanggampa Laban’ tuute a mu ciengin peito-in tuikhuh vang panin suong lia a, a nu’ sanggampa Laban’ tuute tui a dawnsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in Rachel namin a kap vapo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jacob in Rachel kungah ama pen a pa’ tanau ahi lam le Rebekah’ tapa ahi lam a gen hi. Tuale ama tai-in a pa kungah a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sanggamnu’ tapa Jacob’ thu Laban in a zah ciengin ama dawn dingin a tai hi; ama kawipomin nam a, a inn ah a peipi hi. Jacob in tam thu zosie gen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuale Laban in ama kungah, “Nang pen ka gu ka tang le ka tel ka vo tahtah na hi khula!” a ci hi. Ama kungah hla khat sung a taam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Laban in Jacob kungah, “Nang, keima’ tanau na hi ziehin bangma lemlaw nei loin ka na ei seppieh ding na hi amah?” Ei gen in, na thaman ding bang ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu-in Laban in tanu ni nei hi; a uzaw’ min Leah ahi a, a nauzaw’ min Rachel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leah pen a mit-ha nem a, Rachel pen ngaibaangin a mel hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jacob in Rachel ngai hi; tuaci’n ama in, “Na tanu a naunu kang thalawna-in kum sagi na na kang seppieh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laban in, “Midang tungah ama ka pieh sangin nang tungah kang pieh ding hoizaw hi; keima kungah hing om in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob in Rachel a nga nadingin kum sagi sung na sem a, ama a itna ziehin ama adingin tua hunte ni tawmno khat tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in Laban kungah, “Ama tawh ka lupton thei nadingin ka zi ei pie in. Bangzieh ahei cile ka hun cing zo ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Laban in tua muna a om mi zosie khawmin pawi khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin nitah lamin ama in Jacob kungah a tanu Leah a zawpi hi; tuale ama in tua nu luppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />(Laban in a tanu Leah tungah a nasem numei dingin ama’ numei nasem nu Zilpah a pie hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zingmawng ciengin Leah na hi mawh hi! Tuale Jacob in Laban kungah, “Kei bang bawla nei bawl ahiei? Rachel ka nga nadingin na na hing seppieh hi lo ka mah? Bang dinga nei sol ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Laban in, “ A unu kanin a naunu mo hlah pen ko gamah kizang lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tam nu adingin nipi kal khat sung mopawi mansah phot inlen, adang kum sagi ma ka na nei seppieh thamanin a khat pen zong kang pie ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jacob in a ci bangin semin tua nu’ mopawi hun a mansah phot hi. Tua ciengin Laban in a tanu Rachel a zi dingin a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />(Laban in a nasem numei Bilhah a tanu Rachel tungah a nasem numei dingin a pie hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob in Rachel zong luppi a, ama in Leah sangin Rachel a itzaw hi. Ama in adang kum sagi sung Laban’ na a seppieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Leah a ki-it lo lam Topa in a thei ciengin ama in a naubu a honpieh hi; ahi vangin Rachel a ciing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leah gai-in tapa khat nei-a, a min Reuben phuo hi; azieh pen ama in, “ Topa in ka gentheina ei mu zo hi. Tu-in ka pasal in kei ei it valon ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama gaikia-in tapa khat nei a, tuale ama in, “ Topa in kei ei kimuda lam za zo ahi ziehin ama in tam tapa zong ei pie zo hi,” ci hi; tuale ama in a min Simeon a phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama gai leuleu-in tapa khat nei a, “Tu-in ama tawh tapa thum nei zo ka hi ziehin ka pasal in kei ei pawl ta ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ziehin ama’ min Levi phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama gai leuleu-in tapa khat nei a, “Tam hunin Topa ka phat ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin ama in ama’ min Judah phuo hi. Tua ciengin a tathang ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rachel in Jacob tawh ta a nei lo lam a kimu bepin ama in a sanggamnu a eng hi; tuale ama in Jacob kungah, “Ta ei neisah in, tua ahi sih mawh leh kisi ta vang!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rachel tungah Jacob lungthah mama a, tuale ama in, “Na naubu a khahtan thei dingin Pasien’ muna om ka hi son amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Ka nasem numei Bilhah tanah om hi; ama in ka phei tungah ta suohin ama ziehin ken zong ta ka nei thei nadingin ama luppi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in Jacob kungah a nasem numei Bilhah a zi dingin a pie hi; tuale Jacob in tua nu a luppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bilhah gai-in Jacob tawh tapa khat nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rachel in, “Pasien in kei thu ei khen zo a, ama in ka aw zong za zo-in tapa khat ei pie zo hi,” a ci hi; tua ahi ziehin ama in a min Dan phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rachel’ nasem numei Bilhah gaikia-in Jacob tawh tapa a nina nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rachel in, “Nahpitaha kibuonna tawh ka sanggamnu buonin ka zo ta hi,” a ci hi; tuaci’n ama in a min Naphtali phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leah in a tathang zo ahi lam a kithei ciengin ama in a nasem numei Zilpah la-in a zi dingin Jacob a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Leah’ nasem numei Zilpah in Jacob tawh tapa khat a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuale Leah in, “Kampha!” ci a, tuaci’n a min Gad phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leah’ nasem numei Zilpah in tapa a nina nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leah in, “Lungdam sam ing e! Azieh pen numeite in kei mi lungdamnu ei ci ding uhi,” a ci hi; tuaci’n ama in a min Asher phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangbu lah hun laitahin lolai-ah Reuben a vahkawi leh zawldei-ai kungte mu a, a nu Leah kungah tuate a puoh hi. Tua ciengin Rachel in Leah kungah, “Hepina tawh na tapa’ zawldei-ai themkhat ei pie vawi” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Leah in, “Ka pasal nei lahpieh thuneu na sa amah? Ka tapa’ zawldei-ai zong ei lahpieh lai ding na mah?” a ci hi. Rachel in, “Ahi leh na tapa’ zawldei-ai man dingin nang tawh tuzanin ama ang lumton thei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nitahin a lo panin Jacob vai a tun ciengin a dawn dingin pusuoh a, “Ka kunga nang lup kul ding hi. Azieh pen ka tapa’ zawldei-ai tawh nang kang thapsa ahi hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n khum zanin ama tawh a lumton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuale Pasien in Leah’ ngetna ngai a, ama gai-in Jacob tawh tapa a ngana nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leah in, “Ka pasal tungah ka nasem numei ka pieh ziehin Pasien in ka thaciel ei piezo ta hi,” a ci hi; tuaci’n a min Issachar phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuale Leah gaikia a, Jacob tawh tapa a guhna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ciengin Leah in, “Pasien in kei moken hoi khat ei pie zo hi. Tu-in ka pasal in kei ei patawi ding hi. Azieh pen ama tawh tapa guh ka nei ta hi,” a ci hi; tuaci’n ama in a min Zebulun phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in tanu khat nei a, a min Dinah phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien in Rachel phawh a, Pasien in ama’ thu ngai-in a naubu a honpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama gai-in tapa khat nei a, “Pasien in ka zalatna a lamang ta hi,” a ci hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuale ama in a min Joseph phuo a, “ Topa in tapa dang khat ei piehbe heh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rachel in Joseph a nei zaw ciengin Jacob in Laban kungah, “Ka inn le ka gamah ka pei thei nadingin kei ei sawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nang kunga ka thalawsa ka zite ka tate ei pie inlen ei peisah in, azieh pen na na kang seppieh lam na thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin Laban in ama kungah, “Tua banga thu nei gensah leh, ka aisanna tung panin nang vang tawh Topa in kei thupha ei piezo hi, ci ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na thaman ding hing gen inlen kang pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jacob in ama kungah, “Na na bang ka ci sep a, ka khut sungah na gante bang hing cipun ahei ci nang mama in na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Azieh pen kei ang tun masangin na gantate tawmno khat ahi a, tuate tampitahin a khang hi; tuale ka kiheina muncin tengah Topa in nang thupha ang pie hi. Ahi vangin tu-in ka innkuonpite ading zong bang cih ciengin vaihawm ta ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in, “Nang bang kang pie diei?” a ci hi. Jacob in, “Bangma zamtawng ei pie sin; tami nei bawlpieh ding po leh na tuuhonte va-in kang cinpieh ding hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na tuuhon zosie lahah ei vahsah inlen, tuate lah panin tuu a puong zosie, a pawl zosie, tuuno a vom zosie, le keelte lah panin a pawl le a puong zosie ei pieh in; tua teng ka thaman hi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n mailam hunah ka thamante en dinga nang pei ciengin ka thumanna kei adingin teci ahi ding hi. Keel lahah a puong lo le a pawl lo poma le tuuno lahah a vom lo poma, kei kunga a kimu khah leh, guhin kisim pailien ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Laban in, “Hoi e! Na cisa bangin hi taheh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ahi vangin Laban in khum ni-in keeltang a dung pawl le a bem pawlte, keelpi a puong le a pawlte, a ci tunga themkhat a kang pawl tapo ladawhin a tapate a cingsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />tuale Jacob in Laban’ tuuhon a omlai teng a cin laitahin ama in ama le Jacob kikal nithum khuolzinna munah tua ganhonte peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in hieng sing, zuonmuot sing, le theiba panin a ba thate sat a, a hawte khe siengin a sunga a kangte a kidawhsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama in tuipiehna kuong sunga gantate mai-ah a haw kikhesa singbate koi hi. Tam pen gantate tui dawn dinga a peina uh tuidawnna mun ahi hi. Tui dawn dinga amate a pei ciengun a kizangmat vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />tuale singbate mai-ah gantate kizangmatin, tuaci’n gantate in a dung pawl, a puong le a pawl tate a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Jacob in tuunote khenkhie a, tua gantate Laban’ gantate lahah a dungpawl le a vomcip teng lam a ngasah hi; tuale ama’ tan ding teng tuom koi-in Laban’ tuuhonte tawh koiton lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ganta thahatte a zangmat hun sielin, singbate lahah a kizangmat thei nadingun Jacob in tuuhonte masanga gan tuipiehna kuong sungah singbate koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahi vangin ganta zawngkhalte mai-ah tua singbate koi lo hi; tuaci’n ganta zawngkhal teng pen Laban-a’ suohin ganta thahat teng pen Jacob-a’ a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ci bangin mipa nahpitahin hau a, ama in ganta honpi, sila numei, sila pasal, kalaohte le laa tampitah a nei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Laban’ tapate in, “Jacob in i pa-a’ zosie la zo ta hi; ama in i pa tawh kisai tami hauna zosie nga zo hi,” a ci uh Jacob in a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Laban in masanglai bangin maipha tawh ama a don nawn lona lam Jacob in mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa in Jacob kungah, “Na pu na pa le na tanaute’ gamah kilekia in, nang kang ompi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob in mi sawlin a ganhon opna gamlahah Rachel le Leah hlansah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a kung vuah, “Na pa un masanglai bangin maipha tawh kei ei don lo lam ka mu hi. Ahi vangin ka pa’ Pasien in kei ei ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tha nei zosie tawh na pa uh’ na ka sep lam na thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahi vangin na pa un kei ei solin ka thaman sawmvei khel a, hizongle kei ei bawlsiet ding Pasien in phal lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in, ‘A pawl teng na thaman ding hi heh,’ a ci leh ganhon zosie in ta a pawl ngentang a nei uhi. Tuale ama in, ‘A dung pawl teng na thaman hi heh,’ a ci leh ganhon zosie in ta a dungpawl a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam bangin Pasien in na pa’ ganhonte la-in kei ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Ganhonte zangmat hunin ka khuodah leh keelpi tunga kikhap keeltang zosie a dungpawl, a bempawl, a puonga a opna khu ka mangin ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien’ vantungmi in ka mangin ka kungah, ’ Jacob,’ ei ci-a, tuale keima in, “Tanah om ing!’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in, ‘Dahto inlen en in, keelpi tunga kikhap keeltang zosie dungpawl, bem pawlin puong uhi; bangzieh ahei cile na tunga Laban gamtat zosie ka mu zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei pen nang in khuom khat sathau nu-in kei tungah kiciemna nang bawlna mun Bethel Pasien ka hi hi. Tu-in tam gam nuasie pailien inlen na pienna gamah kilekia in,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Rachel le Leah in ama dawngin, “I pa’ inn sungah ei dinga a kinuasie tanh le luo khat beh a om ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in ei gel pen gamdangmi banga ei ngaituo hi lo amah? Azieh pen ama in eite ei zua zo a, ei dinga ei kipie sum zang mang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien in i pa tung pana a lahpieh neisa zosie eite le i tate-a’ ahi hi; tua ahi ciengin tu-in Pasien in na kunga ang gen popo bawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob tho a, kalaoh tungah a tate le a zite a tuongsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tuale ama in a ganhon zosie, a nei a lam zosie, Paddanaram gam sunga a nei a ganhon zosie hawi-in a pa Isaac’ tenna Canaan gam zuonin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuumul heu dingin Laban a kuon laitahin Rachel in a pa’ innsung pasien-te na gu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale Jacob in a tai sawm lam ama kungah gen loin Aram mi Laban sol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n a neisa vannuoi tawh ama tai hi. Ama in a kipatna-ah Euphrates gun kanin Gilead gam muoltung lam a manaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in Jacob a tai lam Laban kungah kigen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a sanggamte zawpi-in ama a phah masangsie Gilead muoltung gamah ni sagi sung a del hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahi vangin Aram mi Laban kungah zanlai a mangin Pasien pei-in ama kungah, “Jacob kungah thupha ahi a, thusie ahi zongin kamteng khat zong na gen lo nadingin kidawm in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Laban in Jacob a nuaphah hi. Tu-in Jacob in Gilead muoltung gamah a puonbuh na lam a, Laban in Gilead muoltung gamah a sanggamte tawh giephuol a sat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Laban in Jacob kungah, “Na bawl bang ahei? Kei nei sol a, ka tanute zong namsau lahsanin galmat bangin na peipi zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bang dingin kei ei solin bangma ei gen loin na daptai mawh na hei? Tawm le lyre tumin guolnopna late tawh hing hla buong sam ding hi veng maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuale bang dingin ka tanute le ka tapate tawh mangpha pai-in ei kitawpsah beh lo na hei? Na mot gamtat mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nang bawlsietna khop ding thu ka nei hi; ahi vangin zani zanin na pa’ Pasien in ei hopi a, ‘Jacob kungah thupha ahi a, thusie ahi zongin kamteng khat zong na gen lo nadingin kidawm in,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na pa’ inn na ngai seng zieha a pei ding hi nan lacin bang dinga ka pasien-te na guh mawh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jacob in Laban dawng a, “Ka kung panin pauhat thu tawh na tanute nang kaidawh khah ding ka zau zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanle na pasien-te na muna penpen koikoi hitaleh kihinkhawi lo ding hi. I sanggamte muna-ah ka kunga om nang-a’ teng kawh inlen kilah in,” a ci hi. Rachel in tua pasien-te a guh lam Jacob in a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob’ puonbuh sungah Laban lutin, tuale Leah’ puonbuh, le a nasem numei gel’ puonbuhte sungah zong lut a, ahi vangin ama in tuate a mu sih hi. Leah’ puonbuh panin ama pei-in Rachel’ puonbuh sungah a lut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua laitahin Rachel in innsung pasien-te la-in kalaoh phaw kawmah koi-in a tungah a to hi. Laban in puonbuh sung teng zosie long a, ahi vangin tuate a mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuale ama in a pa kungah, “Na mai-ah kang din thei lo ziehin ka pu lungthah sin. Numei’ ngaina nin ka nei zieh ahi bo hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a sui vangin innsung pasien-te a mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob lungthah a, Laban phawhsie gawpin, “Ka tatkhielna bang ahiei? Tamza taha nei del nadingin ka mawna bang ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka van zosie na lonsieng vangin na innsung van bang teng ahiei na mu? Ei gel kikalah amate in thu a khen thei nadingun kei sanggamte le nang sanggamte mai-ah tuate hing koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tami tam kum sawmni sung nang tawh kang om zo ta hi; na tuupite le na keelpite a tatol om loin na ganhonte lahah tuutang sa ka ne sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Gamsate’ thasate zong na kungah kang puoh ngai vateh sih hi; kei mama in tua bang supnate ka thuoh hi; sunlai-a kigute hile zanlai-a kigute hile kei nei losah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Kei pen tu-a bang ka hi hi. Sunlai-in nisa in ei katum a, zanlai-in khuovot in ei tawpkangin ka kimu thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tami kum sawmni sung na inn ah ka om hi. Na tanu nite ziehin kum sawm le li sung nangma’ na semin kum guh sung na ganhonte ka cing a, ka thamante sawmvei na khel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka pa’ Pasien, Abraham’ Pasien, le Isaac’ Giinpa kei lamah ang om lo khat hi leh, khut guoha nei sawlmang tahpi ding ahi hi. Pasien in ka gentheina le ka khut tawh ka sepnate mu a, zani zanin nang ang phawhsie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ciengin Laban in dawngin Jacob kungah, “Tanu teng keima’ tanu, naupang teng keima’ naupang, ganhon teng keima’ ganhon ahi a, khum na mu teng zosie khu keima-a’ ahi hi. Ahi vangin tam ka tanute tung ahi a, amate sunga pieng naupangte tungah ahi zongin tuni-in ken bang law thei ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tu-in hing pei inlen nang le kei in thuciemna khat bawl vai; nang le kei kikalah teci hisah vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob in suong khat la-in khuomin phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tuale Jacob in a sanggamte kungah, “Suongte khawm un,” ci a, amate in suong la-in a lomin a cieng uhi; amate in tua suongcien gei-ah an a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tua khu Laban in Jegar-sahadutha ci-a, ahi vangin Jacob in Galeed ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Laban in, “Tam suongcien pen tuni-in nang le kei kikala teci ahi hi,” a ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin ama in tua khu Galeed, ci-in minvaw a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />a khuom pen Mizpah ci hi. Azieh pen Laban in, “Ei tegel khatlekhat i opton lo ciengin Topa in nang le kei kikalah ei cing tuoh taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka tanute na bawlsiet a, ahi sihle ka tanute banah zi na lah be leh ei tawh koima a opton sih vangin nang le kei kikalah i teci Pasien ahi lam khu phawh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Tua ciengin Laban in Jacob kungah, “Keima in nang le kei kikala ka phusa tami suongcien le khuom en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nangma ang susie dingin tami suongcien kalsanin na kungah kang pei lo nading, nang zong kei ei susie dingin tam suongcien kalsanin kei kunga nang pei lo nadingin tami suongcien teci ahi a, tami khuom zong teci ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Abraham’ Pasien le Nahor’ Pasien - amate pate’ Pasien- in eite kikalah thu khen taheh,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n a pa Isaac’ Giinpa tawh Jacob a kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuale Jacob in a sangna munah biehpiehna lui a, an ne dingin a sanggamte hlan hi; tuale amate in an a ne vua, zan tungtawnin muoltung gamah a taam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Zingmawng tungin Laban tho a, a tute le a tanute tawpin thupha a pie hi; tua ciengin ama pei-in inn lamah a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jacob zong a lampi-ah peisuoh a, Pasien’ vantung mite in ama na dawn uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jacob in tuate a mu bepin, “Tami khu Pasien’ giephuol ahi hi!” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in khum mun pen Mahanaim ci-in min a phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jacob in a sanggampa Esau opna mun Edom gam Seir leitangah kamtaite a masangah sawlin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />amate thu a hil a, “Ka pu Esau kungah tam bangin na va gen ding uhi: Na nasempa Jacob in, ‘Laban tawh pemta bangin ka teng a, tu dong ciengin ka om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuale keima in bawngtang, laa, ganhon, sila pasal, sila numeite ka nei hi; na muna-ah maipha ka mu thei nadingin ka pu kungah a gen dingin kang sawl hi, ci hi,’ va ci un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jacob kungah kamtaite a kilekia vua, “Na pu Esau kungah ka va pei ta vua, tuale nang ang dawn dingin ama ang pei-in mihing zali ang zawpi hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob nahpitahin zau-in a lungkham hi; tuale ama’ zawpite, ganhonte, bawnghonte, le kalaohte pawl ni-in khen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Esau ang pei-in pawlkhat a suhsiet leh, a kinuasie pawlkhat suohta ding hi,” ci-in a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuale Jacob in, “Aw, ka pa Abraham’ Pasien le ka pa Isaac’ Pasien, ka kungah, ‘Na gam le na tanaute kungah kilekia in, na tungah sil hoi kang bawl ding hi,’ ei ci Topa aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na nasempa kunga nei lahsa itna kip le muontahna vannuoi lahah a neupen khat zong a tang dingin ka kilawm vawt sih hi; azieh pen keima in ka ciengkhut beh tawh tami Jordan ka kantan hi. Tu-in pawl ni ka suoh ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka sanggampa’ khut, Esau’ khut sung panin ei hun in, ci-in kang thum hi, azieh pen ama ka giing hi; ama ang pei-in, kote zosie, nute, naupangte tawh ka unpi-un ei that thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle nang in, ‘Na tungah sil hoi kang bawl ding a, na suonlehlahte tuipi senel za-in a tam sengin a kisim thei loin ka bawl ding hi,’ nei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum zanin tua munah ama gieh a, a neisa lah panin a sanggampa Esau adingin letsong
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />keelpi zani le keeltang sawmni, tuupi zani le tuutang sawmni
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />kalaoh nawisuh sawmthum le a note, bawngpi sawmli le bawngtang sawm, laapi sawmni le laatang sawm a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a nasemte khut sungah tam teng amau’ hon cietin pie a a nasemte kungah, “Ka masangah pei unlen ganhonte honkhat le honkhat kihalsah un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a masapen pa kungah, “Ka sanggampa Esau tawh na kituo vua, ‘No koi-a’ na hi uh ahei? Hei-a haw sawm na hi uh ahei? Na masang vua om tuate koi-a’ ahei?’ ci-a ang dawh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />note in, ‘Tam teng pen na nasempa Jacob-a’ ahi hi; tamte ka pu Esau kungah letsonga ang kihlah ahi hi; tua tham loin ama ka nua vuah om hi,’ ci-un,” ci-in thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in tua ma bangin a ni na, a thumna, le gantahon a zuite zosie kungah, “Esau tawh na kituo ciengun a kibangin na gen ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />note in , ‘Tua tham loin na nasempa Jacob ka nua vuah om hi,’ na ci ding uhi,” ci-in thu a hil hi. Azieh pen ama in, “Ka masanga a pei letsong tawh ama ka lungdamsah zo kha ding a, tua zaw ciengin a mai ka mu thei ding hi,” ci-in ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n a mai-ah letsongte a peisah hi; khum zanin giephuol ah ama a gieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum zan ma-in ama tho-in a zi nite, a nasem numei nite, le a tapa sawm le khatte zawpi-in Jabbok tanmun a kantan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in amate zawpi-in luigal a kaipi a, tua ma bangin a neisa zosie a galkaisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama guohin Jacob a om hi; tuale zingmawng khuovah dongin mi khat in ama a buon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua mipa in Jacob a zaw lo lam a thei ciengin, ama in a khelgu a suhpieh hi; tua mipa tawh a kibuon ziehin Jacob’ khelgu a kilawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Khuovah ding hi ta, ei hla in,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Jacob in, “Thupha nei pieh sih leh kang hla sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a kungah, “Na min bang ahiei? “ a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Jacob,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin mipa in, “Na min Jacob kici nawn loin Israel kici ta ding hi, azieh pen Pasien le mite tawh kibuonin na zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in ama dongin, “Hepina tawh na min ei gen in,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin ama in, “Bang dinga ka min nei dawh ahei?” a ci hi. Tua munah ama in Jacob thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob in tua mun Peniel, ci-in a min phuo hi. “Bangzieh ahei cile kimaituo-in Pasien ka mu zo a, hizongle ei kihinkhawi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A khelgu a kilawi ziehin ama khelbai a, Peniel a kantan laitahin ni a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua ziehin tuni dongin Israel-te in khelkom tunga a om khel thagui a ne sih uhi. Ama in Jacob’ khelkom, a khel thagui a suhpieh zieh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jacob khuodahin a en leh mi zali tawh ang zawhton Esau a mu hi. Tuaci’n ama in Leah, Rachel, le a nasem numei nite kungah a tate a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a masangah numei nasemte le a tate koi a, tua ciengin Rachel le Joseph a nukhia penin koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A masang vuah ama pei-in a sanggampa kung a tun masangin sagi vei tuolah a kun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama dawn dingin Esau tai a, ama pomin ngawngkawi-in a nam vatuh a, tuaci’n a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Esau a khuodahin numeite le naupangte a mu ciengin ama in, “Nang zawpi tamte khu koi ahi vuoi?” a ci hi. Jacob in, “Pasien in lungsietna tawh na nasempa a pieh tate ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin nasem numeite le a tate in nehin a kun uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tua ma bangin Leah le a tate zong a kung nehin a kun uhi. A nukhia penin Joseph le Rachel in nehin a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Esau in, “Ka kituopi tami a honte zosie bang na cinopna ahiei?” a ci hi. Jacob in, “Ka pu’ maipha sui na ding ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Esau in, “Ken zong a kicing tahin nei ing, ka sanggampa aw, nang’ neite nangma adingin kikep kon in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jacob in, “Hi lo hi; na maipha ka mu leh nei hepina tawh ka khut panin ka letsongte ei sanpieh in; bangzieh ahei cile na maitang ka mu khu Pasien’ maitang mu ka bang tahtah vawt hi. Azieh pen nang in tam bang angvanna tawh kei nei sangzo hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nei hepina tawh na kunga kang tawi ka letsong ei sanpieh in. Bangzieh ahei cile Pasien in ei lungsiet mama a, ka tulmaw zosie ka nei hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in a kut tentun ziehin tuate a sanpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Esau in, “I lampi zuonin khuolzin vai. Nangma tawh hing zawhton vang,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hizongle Jacob in ama kungah, “Naupangte a hat lo lam ka pu in na thei a, tuuhonte, ganhonte, bawnghon le keel hon nawitep laite keima’ kep ding ahi hi; ni khat kinaw hawl seng leh ganhon zosie a si sieng ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na nasempa mai-ah ka pu na pei inlen, ka mai-a ganhonte kalsuon le naupangte kal tawh dan kituohin Seir-a ka pu kung kang tun dongin damdamin kang peipi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Esau in, “Kang zawpi mi pawlkhat kang nuasiepieh ding hi,” a ci hi. Ahi vangin Jacob in, “Kei tungah ka pu bang dinga hici migit sengseng na hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-in Seir lamah Esau a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle Succoth lamah Jacob khuolzinin ama adingin inn khat lam a, a ganhonte adingin hlamphengte a bawl hi; tua ahi ziehin khum mun pen a min Succoth, kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Paddanaram pana peina lampi, Canaan gam sunga om Shechem khuopi-ah damle bitin Jacob a tung hi; tuale ama in tua khuopi mai-ah phuol a sat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Shechem’ pa Hamor’ tapate kung panin a puonbuh lamnasa leitang pen dangka zakhat tawh a lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in khum munah maitam khat tung a, a min El-Elohe-Israel a phuoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in khum gam numeite kunga haw dingin Jacob tawh a nei Leah’ tanu Dinah a kuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum gam ulien Hiv mi Hamor’ tapa Shechem in a mu ciengin, ama in tua nu manin pauhat thu tawh a luppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Jacob’ tanu Dinah a lunggul vatuh hi; ama in tua nu ngai-in awnem no tawh a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Shechem in a pa Hamor kungah, “Tami numei nu ka zi dingin ei lahpieh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in Shechem in a tanu Dinah a suhthaang lam Jacob in a za hi; ahi vangin a tate gamlahah ganhonte tawh a om uhi. Tuaci’n amate a tun masangsie-in Jacob ham loin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jacob hopi dingin ama kungah Shechem’ pa Hamor haw a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />khum hun tahin gamlah panin Jacob’ tapate a tung uhi. Amate in tam thu a zah ciengun a sin uh so-in a lungthah mama uhi, azieh pen Jacob’ tanu tawh a lupton ziehin ama in Israel sungah mot gamtatna tun hi, bangzieh ahei cile tua bang pen bawl dinga a kilawm vawt lo thu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Hamor in amate a hopi a, “Ka tapa Shechem in na tanu uh a lunggul vangut hi; hepina tawh a zi dingin ama ei pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ko zi le ta-in ei zong un; na tanute ei pie unlen, ka tanute uzong la un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ko lahah nang teng ding vua, no adingin leitang ang kipie ding hi; a sungah tengin sum bawl unlen nei le lam zong khol un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Shechem in zong a pa le a sanggamte kungah, “Na maipha ei musah unlen, ka kunga na gen popo uh kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mo man le letsong na dei bangun a tam thei zaza ei ngen un, nei nget bangbang uh kang pie ding hi; ka zi dingin numei nu ei pie ta popo un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in a sanggamnu uh Dinah a suhthaangsa ahi ziehin Jacob’ tate in Shechem le a pa Hamor solna tawh a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate in, “Tep tan lo mipa tunga ka sanggamnu uh ka pieh ding uh hi thei ka sa sih uhi. Tua bang pen ko adingin mindai huoi luo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tami thu khat tungtawn behin kang thukimpi ding uhi: Ko tawh na kibah nadingun no lahah pasal zosie a tep uh kitan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin ka tanute uh kang pie ding vua, tuaci’n ko adingin na tanute ka la ding uhi. Tuale note lahah kote hing tengin mi khat i suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka thu ei mang loin tep na tan sih uleh ka tanu uh kai-in ka pei ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau’ thusun in Hamor le Hamor’ tapa Shechem lungdamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tangvalpa in Jacob’ tanu a dei seng ziehin tami bawl ding pen a kiheh sih hi. A innkuonpi zosiete lahah ama a kipatawi pen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n a khuopi vuah Hamor le a tapa Shechem pei-in a khuosung mite tawh a kiho vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ Tam mite ei tungah thunuom mama uhi; gam sungah tengsahin summet bawlsah vai, azieh pen amate dingin gam zai mama hi; a tanute uh zi-in la vai-in, i tanute uzong amate pie vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eite lahah a ten ding uh thukimin mi khat i suo thei nading tam thu khat beh a om hi. Amate tep a kitan ma bangun eite lahah pasal zosie tep kitan ding hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amau’ ganhonte, amau’ nei le lamte, le a ganhingte zosie uh eite -a’ ding hi lo amah? Amate tawh kithukim lel phot vai. Tua hile eite lahah amate ang teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuale khuopi tunkot pana a pusuoh mi zosie in Hamor le a tapa Shechem’ thugen a mang uhi; tuale khuopi tunkot pana a pusuoh pasal zosie tep a kitan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in amate in na a sah laitahun Jacob’ tapa nite, Dinah’ sanggam Simeon le Levi in a namsau uh tawi-in thei lo kalin khuopi a sim vua, pasal zosie a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama gel in namsau tawh Hamor le a tapa Shechem thatin Shechem inn sung panin Dinah kaiphitin a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jacob’ tapa dangte zong a pei vua, siluong tungah lam hla-in a sanggamnu uh kisuhthangna khuopi a bulu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in ganhonte le bawnghonte, laate, a khuopi sung ule a lo sung vua om popo a tomgam sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nei a lam zosie uh, a naupang zosie ule a zite, a inn sung vua om zosie manin gal vanlahin a puomang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin Simeon le Levi kungah, “No tegel in tami gama a teng Canaan-te le Periz-te tungah nei gimsiesah vua, kei tungah lunggim nei guon uhi; ka mite lah halno khat ahi bo a, kei ei do dingin amate kisutuo-in ei simin ei bulu uleh kei le ka innkuonpite ei kisusie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in, “Ka sanggamnu uh numei pahtat banga kibawl dingin a kilawm amah?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien in Jacob kungah, “Dingin Bethel-ah peito inlen khum munah va teng in. Na sanggampa Esau kung panin na taimang lai-in na kunga ang kilah Pasien adingin khum munah maitam khat bawl in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob in a innkuonpite le a zawpi zosiete kungah, “Na lah vua om gamdang pasien-te paimangin no le no kisiensuo unlen na puonsilte uh khel un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tua ciengin ka lungkham huna ei dawng, ka peina cintenga ei ompi Pasien adingin khum munah maitam khat ka bawl thei nadingin Bethel-ah peito vai,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in a nei uh gamdang pasien-te zosie, le a bila a ba uh bilbate, Jacob tungah a pie uh hi. Jacob in Shechem khuo gei gangpi sing phungah tuate a phuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate khuolzinin a pei laitahun koima in a nuadel lo nadingin Pasien kung panin a kimvel vua om khuopite tungah zauhuoina khat tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jacob le a zawpi mi zosie Canaan gam sunga om Luz (Bethel) ah a tung vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama in khum munah maitam khat lamin a min Elbethel, phuo hi. Azieh pen a sanggampa kung panin ama a taimang lai-in tua mun ama kungah Pasien mama a kilang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rebekah a cingnu Deborah si a, Bethel hlanglam gangpi sing nei khatah kivui hi. Tuaci’n khum mun Allonbakuth, kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Paddan-aram pan a pei ciengin Jacob kungah Pasien kilangkia a, ama thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien in ama kungah, “Na min Jacob ahi hi; Jacob ang kici nawn sih ding hi, na min Israel hi ta ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama Israel kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien in ama kungah, “Keima Vanglien Pasien ka hi hi. Pung inlen tampi pha in; na sung panin minam khat le minam honkhat pieng ding a, na sung panin kumpite pieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abraham le Isaac tunga ka pieh tua leitang nang kang pie ding a, nang zaw cienga na suonlehlahte tungah zong tua leitang ka pie ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama tawh a kihona mun panin Pasien a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jacob in ama tawh a kihona munah suong khuom khat a phut hi; tuale ama in tua tungah dawn thei biehna a sung hi, tua tungah sathau zong a sung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n Jacob in Pasien tawh a kihona mun pen a min Bethel, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ciengin Bethel panin amate khuol a zin uhi; Ephrath panin a gamla sim lai mun a gei ciengun Rachel a nau suo hun tung a, takei-in a gim mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama nu takei-in a thuohla mama laitahin naudom nu in ama kungah, “Zau sin. Azieh pen tu-in nang in tapa adang khat na nei ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua nu’ hlagau a peikhiet laitahin, (bangzieh ahei cile ama a si hi) tua nu in a min Benoni ci-in phuo hi; ahi vangin a pa in ama’ min pen Benjamin hisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Rachel si-in Ephrath (Bethlehem) zuotna lampi-ah kivui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jacob in tua nu’ hankhuh ah khuom khat phut hi; tuni dongin khum muna om pen Rachel’ han muolsuong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel in a khuolzin zom a, Eder tausang galkhat ah a puonbuh a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khum gamah Jacob a ten laitahin Reuben in a pa’ meinu Bilhah luppi hi; tua thu Israel in a za hi. Tu-in Jacob’ tapate sawm le ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leah’ tapate: Reuben (Jacob’ ta masa pen), Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, le Zebulun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rachel’ tapate: Joseph le Benjamin ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rachel’ nasem nu Bilhah’ tapate: Dan le Naphtali ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leah’ nasem nu Zilpah’ tapate: Gad le Asher ahi hi. Tam teng pen Paddan-aram gama a nei Jacob’ tapate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abraham le Isaac pemta banga a tenna Mamre, ahi sihle Kiriath-arba (tua pen Hebron)-a om a pa Isaac kungah Jacob a va haw ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tu-in Isaac’ khan kum pen kum za le kum sawmgiet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuale Isaac in a hu nukhia pen a sang hi; ama vuoi-in a kum tam a, a mite kungah a kigawm hi; a tapa Esau le Jacob in ama a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Esau’ (tua pen Edom) suonlehlahte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Esau in Canaan-te panin a zite a la hi. Hit mi Elon’ tanu Adah, Hiv mi Zibeon’ tapa Anah’ tanu Oholibamah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />le Nebaioth’ sanggamnu, Ishmael’ tanu Basemath ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Adah in Esau tawh Eliphaz nei hi; Basemath in Reuel nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Olibamah in Jeush, Jalam, le Korah nei hi. Tam teng pen Canaan gam sunga a nei Esau’ tapate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin Esau in a zite, a tapate, a tanute, a innsung mi zosie, a gantate, a ganhon zosie, le Canaan gama a lam a neisa zosie tawh a la hi; a sanggampa Jacob kung pan a gamla sim mun khatah ama kituon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A neisate uh a tam seng ziehin a tengton thei sih uhi. A ganhonte uh ziehin a tenna uh leitang in amate a va zo ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n Seir muoltung gamah Esau teng hi; Esau pen Edom ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam teng pen Sier muoltung gama Edom mite’ pupi Esau’ suonlehlahte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam teng pen Esau’ tapate ahi hi: Esau’ zi Adah’ tapa Eliphaz, Esau’ zi Basemath’ tapa Reuel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eliphaz’ tapate: Teman, Omar, Zepho, Gatam, le Kenaz ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />(Timna pen Esau’ tapa Eliphaz’ a meinu ahi hi; ama in Eliphaz tawh Amalech nei hi.) Tam teng pen Esau’ zi Adah’ tapate a hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam teng pen Reuel’ tapate ahi hi: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, le Mizzah ahi hi. Tam teng pen Esau’ zi Basemath’ tapate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam teng pen Esau’ zi, Zibeon’ tapa Anah’ tanu Oholibamah’ tapate ahi hi: Jesuh, Jalam, le Korah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam teng Esau’ tapate’ be le phungte ahi hi. Esau’ ta masa pen Eliphaz’ tate: Teman, Omar, Zepho, Kenaz,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Korah, Gatam, le Amalech-te’ be le phungte ahi hi; tam teng pen Edom gam sunga Eliphaz’ be le phung te ahi hi; amate pen Adah’ tapate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tam teng pen Esau’ tapa Reuel’ tapate ahi uhi: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, le Mizzah-te’ be le phungte ahi uhi; tam teng pen Edom gam sunga Reuel’ be le phungte a hi uhi; amate pen Esau’ zi Basemath’ tapate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tam teng pen Esau’ zi Oholibamah’ tapate ahi hi: Jeush, Jalam, le Korah-te’ be le phungte ahi hi; tam teng pen Anah’ tanu Esau’ zi Oholibamah sunga a pieng be le phungte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tam teng pen Esau’ (tua pen Edom) tapate ahi a, tam teng amau’ be le phungte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam teng pen khum gama a teng Hori mi Seir’ tapate ahi hi: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dishon, Ezer, le Dishan-te ahi hi; tam teng pen Edom gam sunga Seir’ tapate ahi Hori mite’ be le phungte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lotan’ tapate pen Hori le Heman ahi hi; tuale Lotan’ sanggamnu Timna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Shobal’ tapate pen Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho, le Onam ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tam teng pen Zibeon’ tapate ahi uhi: Aiah le Anah ahi hi. Ama pen a pa Zibeon’ laate a cin laitahin gamlahah tuisa pulna ciatui a mu pa Anah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anah’ tapate ahile Dishon le Anah’ tanu Oholibamah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Dishon’ tapate pen Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran, le Cheran ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ezer’ tapate pen Bilhan, Zaavan, le Akan ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Dishan’ tapate pen Uz le Aran ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tam teng pen Hori mite’ be le phungte ahi uhi: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dishon, Ezer, le Dishan ahi hi. Tam teng pen Seir gama be le phung zui-a Hori mite’ be le phungte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tam teng pen Israel-te tungah koima kumpi khat beh in a uh masangin Edom gam sunga kumpite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Beor’ tapa Bela in Edom gam sung uh a, a khuopi min Dinhabah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bela si a, Bozrah khuomi Zerah’ tapa Jobab in ama tangin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jobab si a, Teman-te’ gammi Husham in ama tangin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Husham si a, Moab gam sungah Midian mite a zo Bedad’ tapa Hadad in ama tangin a uh a, a khuopi min Avith ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hadad si a, Masrekah khuomi Samlah in ama tangin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Samlah si a, Euphrates gun gei-a om Rehoboth khuomi Shaul in ama tangin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shaul si a, Akbor’ tapa Baalhanan in ama tangin uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Achbor’ tapa Baalhanan si a, Hadar in ama tangin uh a, a khuopi min Pau ahi hi. Ama zi’ min Mehetabel hi a, Mezahab’ tanu Matred, Matred tanu Mehetabel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tam teng pen amau’ innkuon le amate tenna, amau’ min tawh kizui-a Esau’ be le phung minte ahi hi: Timna, Alvah, Jetheth
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Magdiel, le Iram-te’ be le phungte ahi uhi. Tam teng pen amau’ lahsa, a tenna gam utawh kizui-a Edom’ (Esau pen Edom’ pa ahi hi) be le phungte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A pa pemta banga a tenna Canaan gamah Jacob a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tami pen Jacob’ innkuon tangthu ahi hi. Kum sawm le kum sagi pha ta ahi ziehin Joseph in a sanggamte tawh tuuhonte a cing hi; ama pen a pa’ zite tapate ahi Bilhah le Zilpah hu ahi hi; Joseph in amau’ hoi lona thu a pa kungah tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu-in Israel in a teh zaw-a a nei tapa ahi ziehin a tapa dang teng sangin Joseph a itzaw a, ama ading puontuol bansau khat a khuipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pa un a sanggam zosie teng sangin Joseph a it zawh lam a thei bepun ama a muda vua, hoitahin zong a hopi thei va-ia sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joseph in khatvei mang khat a man a, a sanggamte kungah a mang a va gen taleh ama a muda semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a kung vuah, “Tam ka mang mat ngai un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Eite in lolai-ah buphai i lomhen vua, tuale thakhatin ka buphai ang tho-in ang ding tang hi; tua ciengin tua kimah na buphaite uh ang kikhawm a, ka buphai mai-ah a kun uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A sanggamte in ama kungah, “Kote ei uh tahtah ding na hi amah? Ko tunga uhna aana ang nei tahtah ding na hi amah?” a ci uhi. Tuaci’n a mang le a thugen teng ziehin ama a muda semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in mang adang khat mankia a, tuale ama’n zong a sanggamte kungah tua a mang a gen a, “En un, mang adang khat ka man hi. Ka mai-ah ni, hla, le aasi sawm le khatte a kun uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a pa le a sanggamte kungah tua a mangmat a gen leh a pa in ama a phawhsie a, “Tami na mang mat khu a bangci mang bep ahiei? Na mai-ah kei le na nu le na sanggamte a tuolkun dinga ang pei tahtah ding ka hi uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaci’n a sanggamte in ama a haza vua, ahi vangin a pa in a lungsim sungah tam thu a ciemte hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in a pa uh’ tuuhonte cing dingin Shechem gei-ah a sanggamte a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuale Israel in Joseph kungah, “Shechem ah na sanggamte in tuuhonte cing hi lo uh amah? Hing pei in, amate kungah kang sawl ding hi,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Tanah om ing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama kungah, “Tu mama-in pei inlen, na sanggamte le tuuhonte a dam na vuoi mah va en tan; ka kungah ei genkia in,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Hebron kuom panin ama a sawl hi. Shechem ah ama a tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />gamlah ah a vahvaih mi khat in ama a mu hi; tua mipa in ama kungah, “Bang sui na hei?” ci-in a dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka sanggamte sui ka hi hi,” a ci hi; mipa in, “A tuuhonte uh hei sunga a cin uh ahei, hepina tawh ei gen in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua mipa in, “Pei zo ta uh, azieh pen, ‘Dothan-ah pei vai,’ a kici uh ka za hi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n Joseph in a sanggamte a nua zui a, Dothan ah amate a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in a gamlapi panin ama a galmu vua, ama kung a tun masangun ama tha na sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Tanah mangman pa hing pei ta ei,” ci-in khatlekhat a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu-in hing pei un, ama thatin dum sung khatah khiesuh vai; tua ciengin gamsa khat in ama valtum ta ci vai-in, a mangmatte bang ang suoh ngel ei en phot vei,” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Reuben in tua thu a zah ciengin ama in, “A hinna lahpieh lieng sih vai,” a ci a, tuaci’n amate khut sung panin ama a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate khut sung panin ama hunkhie-in a pa kungah tunpikia thei kha leng ci a ngaisutna tawh Reuben in a kung vuah, “Sisan suohsah sih un. Senel gama tami dum sungah ama khie unlen, ahi vangin ama tungah bangma na khut nga sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuaci’n a sanggamte kungah Joseph a tun ciengin a puontuol bansau a na sutpieh uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuale ama kai-in dum sung khatah a khiesuh uhi. A dum pen a hawm ahi hi; a sungah tui om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate an ne dingin a to uhi. A khuodah uleh Gilead panin a kalaohte utawh singnai, lingsi, le myrrh gimnamtuite, Egypt gama a puosuh dinga a pei Ishmael khuolzinte a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah in a sanggamte kungah, “I sanggampa thatin ama’ sisan phuol leih i lemlaw uh bang pen ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hing pei un, Ishmael-te kungah ama zua vai. Ama tungah i khut nga sih vai, bang ding ahei cile ama i sanggampa, eima’ cilesa ahi bo hi,” a ci hi. Tuale a sanggamte a thukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Midian sumbawlte in a nawh uh ciengin amate in Joseph kaito-in dum sung panin a domto vua, Ishmael mite kungah ngun shekel sawmni tawh a zua uhi. Tuale amate in Egypt gamah Joseph a peipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Dum sungah Reuben peikia a, tuami dum sungah Joseph a op lo lam ama in a thei ciengin a puon a ehmal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A sanggamte kungah kilekia-in, “Naupang pa om nawn lo hi; kei hei lamah ka kihei ta diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in Joseph’ puon la-in keel khat a go vua, sisan lahah tua puontuol a die uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in a pa kungah tua puontuol bansaupi a puoh vua, “Tam hing mu ung e; na tapa’ puontuol ahile ahi lo kivel aw,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in a thei pai a, “Ka tapa’ puon ahi na khula! Gamsa gilo khat in ama netum zo hi; Joseph a ki-ehmal tahtah lah ahi ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in a puon ehmal a, la-ip puon a kawngah tengin ni tampi sung a tapa a kaa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A tapate le a tanu zosie in ama henep ding a hanciem vangun ama kihenem zo lo hi; tuale ama in, “Hi lo hi, ka kaa kawmin ka tapa kung Misikhuo ah ka pei ding hi,” a ci hi. Tua bangin ama ziehin a pa a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua kikal sungin Midian-te in Pharaoh khut nei-a uliente lahah khat ahi kumpi inncing galkapmangpa Potiphar kungah Joseph na zua uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khum hun lai-in a sanggamte kung panin Judah a peisuh a, Adullam mi Hirah kici pa khat kungah a teng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum munah Judah in Canaan mi khat’ tanu Shua mu hi; tua nu tawh ama kinungin a luppi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua nu gai-in tapa khat nei a, a min Er phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua nu gaikia-in tapa khat nei a, ama in a min Onan phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua nu in tapa khat nei leuleu a, a min Shelah phuo hi. Ama a pien laitahin Chezib gamah tua nu a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Judah in a ta masa Er adingin zi khat a lahpieh hi; tua nu’ min Tamar ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa muna-ah Judah’ ta masa Er khu a gilo a, Topa in ama that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah in Onan kungah, “Na sanggampa’ zi luppi inlen, tua nu tungah pasal’ sanggampa tavuon sem in; na sanggampa adingin suonlehlah piengsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi vangin Onan in tate pen ama ading ahi lo lam thei ahi ziehin a sanggampa’ zi a luppi sielin a sanggampa’ khang a kizop lo nadingin a bawtui tuolah a buosuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa muna ah ama’ gamtat a lungkimhuoi lo ziehin ama zong a that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah in a monu Tamar kungah, “Ka tapa Shelah a gol masangsie na pa’ inn ah meigongin va om in,” a ci hi. Azieh pen a sanggamte bangin ama zong a si ding a zau hi. Tuaci’n a pa’ inna om dingin Tamar a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hun phabep khat zaw ciengin Judah’ zi, Shua’ tanu a si hi; Judah a dan a hun a ven ciengin Adullam mi a guolpa Hirah tawh Timnah khuo-a ama’ tuumul heute kungah a peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuumul heu dingin Timnah ah na innpipa ang peito hi,” ci-in Tamar kungah a kigen ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a meigong puonte suo-in a lu puon khu-in ama kituom a, Timnah khuo peina lampi gei-a om Enaim khuo lutna munah ama na to hi. Azieh pen ama in Shelah a khan kihlit lam a thei a, hizongle ama tawh a kinungsah tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah in ama a mu bepin ama in a mai a na tuom ziehin numei pahtat ding khatin a ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lampi gei ama kungah va pei a, a monu ahi lam a thei lo ziehin, “ Hing pei in, kei tawh lumton vai,” a ci hi. Khum nu in, “Kei nei luppi thei nadingin bang nei pie diei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in dawng a, “Ka ganhonte lah panin ganno khat hing puoh vang,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in, “Tuami nei puoh masangin vankhap khat nei pie diei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in, “Bang vankhap kang pie diei?” a ci hi. Tua nu in a dawng a, “Na seal le a awna khau le na khut sunga om na ciengkhut,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in tua teng a pie a, ama tawh lumtonin tua nu a gai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua nu dingto-in a peikhie a, a kikhuna puon suodawhin a meigong puonte a silkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Numei nu tung panin vankhap lakia dingin Judah in Adullam mi a guolpa a ganno tawh a sawl ciengin ama in tua nu a mu zo ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in khuo mite kungah, “Enaim lam gei biehinnpi sunga numei pahtat nu hei sunga om ahiei ?” ci-in a dong hi. Amate in, “Tami munah numei pahtat koima om ngai sih,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Judah kungah ama kilekia a, “Ama ka mu sih hi; tua banah khuo mite in, ‘Tami munah numei pahtat om ngai sih,’ ei ci bo vuh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Judah in a dawng a, “Ka vante ama-a’ bangin kem ta mai heh. Tua hi si leh ei kinuisan ding hi; ken tami ganno ka puoh a, nang in tua nu na mu lo lam na thei hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zaw hla thum bang ciengin Judah kungah, “Na monu a pahtat ahi bo hi; tham loin a pahtatna zieha gai ahi hi,” ci-in kigen hi. Tuale Judah in, “Kaiphit unlen ama kihaltum heh,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama a kipusuopi laitahin ama in a innpipa kam vaihlah a, “Kei tam teng a nei pa tawh kigai ka hi hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Hepina tawh ciemte in, tami seal le a awna khau le ciengkhut, tam teng koi-a’ ahiei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah in tua vante ama-a’ ahi lam a thei a, “Ka tapa Shelah tawh ka kinunsah lo lang kalsie ama pen kei sanga a thudih zaw ahi hi,” a ci hi. Ama pen tua nu tawh lumton kia nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua nu a kinisuo hun a tun ciengin a naubu sungah takop a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama takei-in na a sah laitahin khat in a khut a dawhsah hi; tuale naudom nu in vau sandup khat la-in a khut tungah khi a, “Tami khu ang dawh masa ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hizongle ama in a khut a nuakaih zaw lienin a sanggampa a suoh hi; tuale ama in, “ Nang adinga a vang na kibawltawm!” a ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin ama’ min Perez kiphuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin a khut tungah vauzam dupsan kikhisa-in a sanggampa a suoh hi; ama’ min Zerah kiphuo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in Egypt ah Joseph kipeipi suh a, khum muna a peipi suh ahi Ishmael-te kung panin Egypt mi, Pharaoh’ ulien inncing galkapmangpa Potiphar in ama na lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joseph tawh Topa a omton a, a lawcing mi khat a suoh hi; Egypt mi a pupa’ inn ah ama a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in ama ompi a, a khut tawh a bawlsa zosie mavangsah hi, ci-in a pupa in a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joseph in a mai-ah maipha nga-in ama’ na a sem hi; ama in a innsungah a makai-in koi a, a neisa zosie a uhsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A a innsung le a neisa zosie tungah vaisai-a a koi huna kipan Joseph ziehin Topa in Egypt mipa’ innsung thupha a pie hi; innsung hitale lo sung hitale ama’ neisa zosie tungah Topa’ thupha a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a neisa vannuoi Joseph khut sungah a ap sieng hi; khum munah a an neh ding simlo bangma lunghimawna a nei sih hi. Joseph ngaihbaangin melhoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hun khat zaw ciengin a pupa’ zi in ama zawlmit ha a, “Kei ei luppi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a niel a, a pupa’ zinu kungah, “En in, kei ziehin inn sungah ka pupa in lunghimawna kici bangma nei nawn loin a nei vannuoi ka khut sungah koi zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami inn sungah ama kei sanga a lienzaw ahi tuon sih a, nang ama’ zi na hi ziehin nang khat ci simlo kei kung panin ama in a keptuom bangma khat beh a om sih hi. Tua ahi ziehin kei in bangci bangin tam bang gitlona lienpite bawlin Pasien tungah maw thei ding ka hei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in ni khat zaw ni khat Joseph a zawl vangin, ama tawh lupton ding hitale ama tawh opton ding hitale a thukim sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin ni khat, a nasep sem dingin ama inn sungah a lut a, tua inn sungah midang koima khat beh a op lo laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tua nu in ama a puonin man a, “Ei luppi in!” a ci hi. Hinanle tua nu khut sungah a puon nuasie-in inn pulamah a taimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A khut sungah a puon nuasie-in inn pulamah ama a tai khu tua nu in a mu bepin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a innkuonpite hlanin amate kungah, “En un, eite ei simmaw dingin ka pasal in Hebrew mi khat i lah vuah ang tut hi! Kei tawh a lumton dingin ama ang lut a, kei zong nahpitahin ka kiko pai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka aw sangsahin ka kiko a zah bepin ama in ka gei-ah a puon nuasie-in inn pulamah a taimang ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pu inn a tun masangsie-in tua nu in a puon a kemcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua nu in ama kungah tua thu ma a gen a, “Kei ei no dingin i lah vua nang tut Hebrew nasempa ang lut a, ahi vangin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ka aw sangsahin ka kiko bepin ama in ka gei-ah a puon nuasie-in inn pulamah a taimang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Na nasempa in kei ei bawl dan tam bang ahi hi,” ci-in a zinu in ama kunga a thugen teng a pupa in a zah ciengin a hangzah gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale Joseph’ pupa in ama manin kumpipa’ thongkiete kikoina thong sungah ama a khum hi; tua thong sungah ama a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahi vangin Joseph tawh Topa a omton a, ama tungah a itna kip a lah hi; ama in thongcing pa’ maipha a ngasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thongcing pa in thong sunga om thongkie mi zosie Joseph’ et dingin ap a, khumi muna kisem zosie ama sepsa vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in ama a oppi ziehin Joseph’ etna sunga a om poma thongcing pa in donin zong a nei vet sih hi; tuale a bawl na khat popo ah Topa in a dau a peisah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam zaw a sawt loin Egypt kumpipa’ haitawi pa le moh-em pa in a pu uh Egypt kumpipa a lungthahsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ulien nite ahi haitawi makaipa le moh-em makaipa tungah Pharaoh lungthah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joseph kikhumna thong sung, inncing mangpa’ inn sungah ama gel a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Inncing mangpa in Joseph’ et dingin ama gel ap hi; tuale ama in ama gel a kem a, thong sungah ama gel bakhat sung kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thong sunga kikhum Egypt kumpipa’ haitawi pa le moh-empa in zan khatin a ni gelin mang a man tuoh vua, a mang uh a tuom tuoh le a mang’ khietna uzong a tuom tuoh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingmawngin ama gel kungah Joseph a pei ciengin a lunggim-a om ama gel a va mu ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pu’ inn sunga ama tawh a kikhumton Pharaoh’ uliente kungah, “Bang dinga tuni-in damai na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama gel in, “Mang ka man vua, tuate khie thei ding mi koima a om sih hi,” a ci uhi. Tuale Joseph in ama gel kungah, “Mang khieh theina Pasien-a’ hi lo amah? Kei kungah tuate ei gen un, kang thum hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joseph kungah haitawi makaipa in a mang gen a, ama in, “Ka mangin ka mai-ah lenggui khat a om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua lenggui tungah a bazam thum om hi. Ang sel behin ang paa pai a, a bawhte lengga min hi pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka khut sungah Pharaoh’ hai a om hi. Lenggate ka la a, tuate a tui hlawhin Pharaoh khut sungah tua hai ka koi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in ama kungah, “A khietna tam bang ahi hi: A bazam thumte ni thum ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ni thum sungin Pharaoh in na lu hing phong ding a, na za-ah ang koikia ding hi; nang in ama’ haitawi na hi lai-a na bawl ngai bang lienin ama khut sungah Pharaoh’ hai na koikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin na tungah thu ang hoi leh kei ei mangngil sin; hepina tawh Pharaoh’ kungah ka thu ei genpiehin kei tungah hing migi inlen, tuaci’n tam mun panin kei ei ladawh in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei ci le, a tahtahin kei pen Hebrew-te’ gam pana ei na kigu ka hi hi. Amate in tami thong miel sunga ei khum valia nadingun bangma ka bawl sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Moh-em makaipa in Joseph mang khieh a hoi lam ahi hi, ci-a a mu ciengin ama in Joseph kungah, “Kei zong mang khat ka man hi: Ka lu tungah mohlaw thum om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tua law tungta pen sungah Pharaoh adingin a ki-emsa an namkim om a, ahi vangin ka lu tunga law sung panin vate in tuate a ne uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joseph in dawng a, “A khietna tam bang ahi hi: Law thumte, ni thum ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ni thum sungin Pharaoh in na lu hing phong ding a- nang tung panin! - sing dawn khatah hing khai-in vate in na sa a ne ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ni thum ni, Pharaoh’ suo ni-in ama’ nasemte zosie adingin pawi khat bawl a, tuale ama in nasemte lahah a haitawi makaipa’ lu le a moh-empa’ lu a phong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in haitawi makaipa pen ama’ haitawina mun ma-ah koikia a, Pharaoh’ khut sungah a hai a koi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ahi vangin Joseph’ khiet bangin ama in moh-em makaipa a khailia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin haitawi makaipa in Joseph phawh kha nawn lo a, ama a mangngil ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zaw kum ni bih a cin ciengin Pharaoh in mang man a, a mangin Nile gun gei-ah a din laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nile gun panin a zol thau sepsop bawngpi sagi pusuoh a, phai lopate a mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin Nile gun sung panin a melsie le a gawngtam bawngpi dang sagi pusuoh a, Nile gun gei-a bawngpi dangte kungah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A melsie le a gawngtam bawngpi sagite in a thau a zol sepsop bawngpi sagite a netum uhi. Tuale Pharaoh khanglo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kimu-in a ni veina mang a mankia hi; a tahsa a hoi buvui sagi kung khatah vui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin nisuona hui in a semdaang gawp buvui hawm sagi a po hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Buvui hawmte in a tahsa buvui sagite a valtum hi. Pharaoh a khanglo a, tua pen a mang a na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zingmawngin Pharaoh a lungkham hi; tuaci’n ama in Egypt mitphiel siem zosie le a mipil zosie hlansah hi. Pharaoh in amate kungah a mang gen a, hinanle Pharaoh kungah a mang khie thei koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin haitawi makaipa in Pharaoh kungah, “Tuni-in ka khielnate ka phawhkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khatvei lai-in Pharaoh, a nasemte tungah lungthah a, kumpi inncing galkap mangpa’ inn sungah kei le an huon makaipa ei khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ni gelin zan khat thu-in mang ka man gel a, ka mangte gel in khietna a tuom tuoh nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpi inncing galkap mangpa’ nasem Hebrew tangval khat tawh ka omton vua, ka mang uh ka gen ciengun ka mang om dan tuoh uh dung zui-in ei khiehpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in ka tung vua ei khiehpieh ma bangin ang tung mintah hi; kei ka za-ah ei kikoikia a, an huonpa pen kikhailum hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in Joseph hlansah a, ama thong mielpi sung panin mallang tahin kipeipi hi. Ama in a khamul heu-in a puon a khel zaw ciengin Pharaoh mai-ah a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharaoh in Joseph kungah, “Mang khat ka nei a, tua ka mang a khie thei koima a om sih hi. Nang in mang kigen khat na zah leh tua mang na khie thei hi, ci-in ei kigen ka za hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph in Pharaoh a dawng a, “Ka pilna tawh mang khie thei ka hi sih hi. Pharaoh tungah Pasien in a hoi lamin hing dawng na va,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in Joseph kungah, “Ka mangin Nile gun gei-ah ka ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nile gun panin a thau a zol sepsop bawngpi sagi ang pusuoh a, phai lopate a mai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin a hepi huoi, a melsie mama le a gawngtam adang bawngpi sagi ang pusuoh kia hi. Egypt gam sung zosie-ah tam bang ganhing melsie ka mu ngai nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A gawngtam le a melsie bawngpite in amasa bawngpi thau a zol sepsop sagite a netum vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ahi vangin tuate a neh zaw ciengun, koima in a neh lam uh a thei sih hi. Bangzieh ahei cile amate a thau tuom sih vua, amasa lai bangin melsie lai veve uhi. Tua ciengin ka khanglo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni veina ka kimukia a, ka mangin buvui hoi sagi kung khat tungah a vui ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nisuona lam hui in semdaangin a gawtasah buvui hawm sagi ang po hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tua buvui hawmte in buvui hoi sagite a valmang hi. Mitphiel siemte kungah ka gen a, ahi vangin ka kunga ei gencien thei koima a om sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in Pharaoh kungah, “Pharaoh’ mang tegel pen khat ahi bo a, a khietna kibang ahi hi; Pasien in Pharaoh kungah a bawl dingte ang lah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A hoi bawngpi sagite, kum sagi ahi a, a hoi buvui sagite pen kum sagi ma ahi hi. A mang khietna a kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuate zaw cienga ang pusuoh a gawngtam le a melsie bawngpi sagite khu kum sagi ahi a, nisuona lam huipi in a semdaang buvui hawm sagite pen kielpi kum sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pharaoh kunga kang gen bangin Pasien in Pharaoh kungah a sil bawl ding ang lah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Egypt gam sung zosie-ah kum sagi sung an kihau ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuate zaw ciengin kum sagi kielpi tung ding a, Egypt gam sunga hauna zosie kimangngil ding hi; tua kielpi in gam sung teng a netum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A nuazui kielpi a natsiet seng ziehin gam sung hau hunlaite a kithei kha ta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pharaoh’ mangmat a kithuop pen khu Pasien’ sesa hi, a cinopna hi a, Pasien in bakhat sungin ang tungsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in Pharaoh in mi pilvang le misiem khat kitel inlen, Egypt gam sung vaisai dingin koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pharaoh in gam sungah makaite se inlen, an a kihauh kum sagi sungin Egypt leitanga pieng ante nga-a-khat la in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ang tung ding tami kum hoi sunga an zosie amate khawmsah inlen, neh dingin khuopite sunga Pharaoh’ uhna nei-a khuopite sungah kholsahin kemcingsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tua an pen kielpi zieha gam sung a siet lo nadingin Egypt gam sunga ang tung ding kum sagi kielpi dal nadinga a kikoicing an hi ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tami a thugel dan pen Pharaoh le a nasem zosie in hoi a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pharaoh in a nasemte kungah, “ Ama sunga Pasien’ hlagau a opna, tam bang midang i mu zo ding uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh in Joseph kungah, “Pasien in nang tungah tam teng zosie pi hing lah zo ahi ziehin, nang banga mi pilvang le mi siem koima dang a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka inn sungah na vaihawm ding a, ka mite zosie in na thupieh bangin a gamta ding uhi; kumpi topha tawh kisai-in ahileh nang sangin kei ka lienzaw beh ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pharaoh in Joseph kungah, “En in, Egypt gam zosie-ah thunei vaihawmin kang koi zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Pharaoh in a suoikaina khutsip a khut panin sutin Joseph bunsah a, puon hoi tawh zemin a ngawngah kham khainieng khat a awsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in sakol leeng a nina pen tungah ama’ nei-a pa a tosah hi; tuale a masanga pei mite kiko-in, “Khupdin un!” a ci uhi. Tua ahi ciengin Egypt gam zosie tungah ama a vaihawmin a pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua tham loin Pharaoh in Joseph kungah, “Keima Pharaoh ka hi a, Egypt gam sung zosie-ah nangma’ thu loin koima khut lehin vai a hawm thei sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Pharaoh in Joseph min Zaphenath-paneah a phuo hi. Ama in On khuo siempu Potiphera’ tanu Asenath tawh a kinungsah hi. Tuaci bangin Joseph in Egypt gam sungah thuneina nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Egypt kumpipa Pharaoh’ nasemin a lut lai-in Joseph kum sawm thum pha hi. Pharaoh’ opna panin Joseph pusuohin Egypt gam zosie-ah a zin kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />An hau kum sagi sungin leitang in an tampi a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Egypt gamah kum sagi an a kihau sungin ama in an zosie khawm a, khuopite-ah a khol hi; tuale ama in khuopi zosie-ah a kima lote sunga a pieng ante a khol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joseph in tuipi-a senel za-in antang tampi khol a, te zawh ding ahi lo ziehin ama in a te ding a khawl vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Kielpi a tun masangin Joseph in On khuo siempu Potiphera’ tanu Asenath tawh tapa ni a nei hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Joseph in a tapa masa’ min Manasseh hisah hi. Ama in, “Pasien in ka hamsatna zosie le ka pa’ innkuon zosie ei mangngilsah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A nina pen Ephraim a phuo hi. “Ka hamsietna gam sungah Pasien in keima a pung dingin ei siem hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Egypt gamah kum sagi sung anhau hun a tawp ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />tuale Joseph’ gensa bangin kum sagi kielpi kipan hi. Gam zosie-ah kielpi a tun vangin Egypt gam sung tengah an a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Egypt gam zosie a kiel ciengin Pharaoh kungah an ngenin mite a kiko uhi. Pharaoh in Egypt mi zosie kungah, “Joseph kungah pei un; ama ci bangin gamta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Gambup ah kielpi a tunkim bepin Joseph in ansalte phetin Egypt-te a leisah hi, azieh pen Egypt leitangah kielpi a nasie mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tua tham loin leitung zosie-ah kielpi nasie mama ahi ziehin antang lei dingin leitung mi zosie Joseph kungah a pei uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Egypt gamah an a op lam Jacob in a thei ciengin a tapate kungah, “Bang dinga khatlekhat hici kigum-et giagua mawh na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Egypt gamah an om hi, ci thu ka za hi; puhsi lo-a i hin thei nadingin peisuh unlen khum sungah an va lei ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaci’n an lei dingin Joseph’ tapa sawmte Egypt ah a peisuh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jacob in a sanggamte tawh Joseph’ sanggampa Benjamin zawhsah lo hi, azieh pen ama tungah sietna a tun khah ding a zausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Canaan gamah kielpi a tun ziehin Israel’ tapate zong an lei dinga pei mite tawh Egypt gamah a peiton uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in Joseph pen tua gam uhpa ahi a, gammi zosie tunga an zuapa ama ahi hi. Joseph’ sanggamte pei-in a maitang uh leilam ngatin a mai-ah a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joseph in a sanggamte a mu ciengin a thei a, hinanle geltate bangin bawlin a na khauh hopi hi. Ama in, “Hei pana hing pei na hi vuoi?” a ci hi. Amate in, “Canaan gam pana an lei dinga ang pei ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joseph in a sanggamte a thei vangin amate in ama a thei ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate tawh kisai a mang matte Joseph in a phawh hi. Ama in a kung vuah, “Note pen thukante na hi uhi; gam sung gitnat lona en dinga ang pei hi ngel uteh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in a kungah, “Hi vawt sih ung ka pu aw; na silate an lei dinga ang pei ka hi bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka unpi-un pa khat’ hlah ka hi bo vua, mi citah ka hi bo uhi; na nasemte thukante ka hi vawt sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in a kung vuah, “Hi lo hi, gam sung gitnat lona en dinga ang pei hi bo uteh!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in, “Kote, na nasemte sanggam pasal sawm le ni ka hi vua, Canaan gama mipa khat’ tate ka hi uhi; tu laitahin a tum pen ka pa uh tawh om a, hinanle khat pen om nawn lo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin Joseph in amate kungah, “Na kung vua kang gensa bang tehteh ahi hi; note, thukan ma hi bo uteh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kang ze-et dan ding pen tam bang ahi hi: Pharaoh a hin ma bangin na nautum pen uh tam sunga ang pei sih poma leh tam mun panin na pei thei sih ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Note lah panin khat pei unlen na sanggampa uh hing zawpi ta un. Na sung vuah thuman a om amah, om lo ahei ci-in a kimu nading, na thugente uh a kikantel thei nadingin thong sungah no adang teng om tadi un; tua ahi sihle Pharaoh a hin ma bangin thukante na hi valon uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in thong sungah a unpi-un ni thum sung a khumcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni thum ni-in Joseph in amate kungah, “Pasien ka zatah ziehin tam bangin gamta un, tua hile na hing ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi citah na hi uleh ang kikhumna uh tam munah na sanggamte uh khat omsah un. Na innkuonpite uh’ kieldo nadingin no adang teng in an puo-in pei ta unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ka kungah na nau tumpen uh hing peipi un. Tua bang hi leh na thu gen uh a man hi ding a, na si sih ding uhi,” a ci hi. Tua banga bawl dingin amate a thukim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate khatlekhat in, “Kasai, eite i hi leh i sanggampa uh tunga i bawl mawna dan a lokia i hi ta uhi; ama in eite kunga ang thum lai-in a lungkhamna i mu vua, hinanle a thu i ngai sih uhi. Tua ahi ziehin i tung vua tami lungkhamna ang tung ahi hi,” ci-in a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ciengin Reuben in amate dawng a, “Na kung vuah tua naupang pa bawlsiet lo ding hing gen hi lo ka mah? Ahi vangin ka thu nei mang sih uhi. Tuaci’n tu-in eite tungah ama’ sisan phu ang kingen ahi ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kamphen khat tungtawnin amate a hopi ziehin Joseph in amau’ ham a tel lam a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuale amate kung panin ama kihemin a kap hi. Tua ciengin peikia-in amate a hopi hi. Ama in Simeon tuom teelin a muna vuah khau tawh a khisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in a ip dimun antang guonpieh a, a ip sung ciet vuah a sum uh koi piehkia-in, a khuolzinna vua a neh ding uh lam-an zong a guonpieh nadingun thu a pie hi. Amate dingin tam bangin kibawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in a laate uh antang puosahin a dingkhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate lahah khat in giena mun vuah a laa an pie dingin a ip a hong leh a ip gongah a sum mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in a sanggamte kungah, “Ka sum na kikoikia hi. Ka ip sungah om ei!” a ci hi. Tam thu ziehin lungkia-in citunin khatlekhat a ki-en vua, “Pasien in eite tunga ang bawl tami khu a bangci thu ahi tai?” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Canaan gama a pa uh Jacob kung a tun ciengun, amate in a tung vua thu pieng zosie a sut vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Tua gam a uhpa in ei khauh hopi a, tua gam thu a kandapin ei ngawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahi vangin kote in a kungah, “Ko mi citah ka hi vua, thukante ka hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pa khat’ hlah sanggam pasal sawm le ni ka hi vua, ka sanggam uh khat a om nawn sih a, a tum pen tu laitahin ka pa utawh Canaan gamah a om hi,” ka ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ciengin tua gam a uhpa, tua mipa in ka kung vuah, ‘Mi citah na hina uh tam tawh kithei ding hi: Na sanggamte uh khat ka kungah nuasie unlen, na innkuonpite’ kiel do nadingin antang guong unlen, na lampi vuah pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na nautum pen uh keima kungah hing peipi ta unlen, note pen thukante hi loin mi citahte na hi zawh lam uh keima in kang thei ding hi. Tua ciengin na sanggampa uh kang suohta sah ding a, gam sungah sum na bawl thei ding uhi,’ ei ci hi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in a ip uh a buh sieng ciengun a van ciet vuah a sumip ciet uh na om mawh hi. Amate le a pa un a sum kitunte a mu ciengun a patau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuale a pa uh Jacob in a kung vuah, “Ka tate nei taansah zo ta uhi: Joseph lah om ta lo, Simeon lah om ta lo, tu-in Benjamin a peipi lai ding na hi uhi. Kei tunga tam teng zosie pi ang pieng ahi ta khula!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin Reuben in a pa kungah, “Na kungah ama kang tutkia sih tah leh ka tapa tegel kitha ta’n. Ka khut sungah ama hing koi in. Na kungah ama kang tutkia ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in, “A sanggampa si a, ama beh om ta bo ahi ziehin note tawh ka tapa a peisuh sih ding hi. Na khuolzin nading uh lampi-ah ama in sietna bang lo khat hing tuoh kha mawh leh note in Misikhuo-ah dana tawh ka samkang na tun ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu-in gam sungah kielpi nasie mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in Egypt gam pana a puoh uh antang a khawn zaw ciengun a pa un a kung vuah, “Kuonkia unlen an halkhat va leibe kia ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Judah in ama kungah, “Tua mipa in khautahin ei hilkhol a, ‘Na sanggampa nang zawpi sih uleh ka mai na mu sih ding uhi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sanggampa tawh nei zawsah ding leh, an lei dingin ka kuonsuh ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />nei zawsah sih dinga ahile ka kuonsuh sih ding uhi, azieh pen tua mipa in ka kung vuah, ‘Na sanggampa utawh nang zaw sih uleh ka mai na mu sih ding uhi,’ ei ci hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel in, “Mipa kungah bang dingin sanggam dang khat ka nei uhi, ci-in genin ei hici bawlsiet na hi uh ahei?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a dawng vua, “Mipa in kote le ka tanaute uh thu limtahin ei dong a, ‘Na pa uh a dam lai ei mah? Sanggam dang na nei na vuoi mah?’ ei ci hi. Ama in tam banga ei dawhna teng a dawngkia ka hi bo uhi. ‘Na sanggampa hing zawpisuh ta un,’ ei ci ding lam bang ka ci thei ding uh ahei?” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ciengin Judah in a pa Israel kungah, “Tangvalpa ei zawpisah in. Nangma, kote, le i nausente si loin i hin thei nadingin ka va pei ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei mama ama adinga a kikham kang hi ding hi; ama tangin kei tungah mawna nei suon thei hi. Na kungah ama kang tutkia sih a, na mai-ah kang koikia sih tah leh tua mawna kei ei puosah zing ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A vaikai lo khat hi leih tu-in nivei a kilekia zo ding ka hi ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin a pa uh Jacob in amate kungah, “Tua bang ahi vawt tah leh tam bangin bawl un: Na ip sung vuah gam sunga a tuituoh pen singga pawlkhat puo unlen, tua pa tungah letsong dingin lingsi halkhat, khuoizu halkhat, singnai, myrrh panamtui, pistachio ga, le almond gate puosuh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na sum uh a zani vom un. Na vangong sung vua kikoi sumte puokia un; a kiphawh kha lo zong hi thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na sanggampa uh zawpi ta unlen, tua mipa kungah peikia ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in tua adang na sanggampa ule Benjamin ang hlakia thei nadingin Vanglien Pasien in mipa mai-ah note hing lungsiet taheh. Kei ka hile ka tate ka tan le zong a tan hi ta mai veng,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in letsong la-in sum a zani a kenbe vua, Benjamin zong a zawpi uhi. Tua ciengin Egypt gamah a peisuh vua, Joseph mai-ah a ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph in amate tawh ang zawhton Benjamin a mu ciengin a inncingpa kungah, “Inn sungah mite peipi inlen, tam mite sun an nehpi nuom ka hi ziehin gan khat go-in a baisa-in na omsah in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joseph’ gen bangin tua mipa in bawl a, Joseph’ inn sungah tua mite a zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu-in Joseph’ inn ah a kizawpi ziehin a zausi vua, amate in, “A masa lai-a i ip sung vua kikoi sumte ziehin i tung vuah thu sui-in sila tengta-in ei bawlin i laate a mat thei nading vua ei kipeipi hi ta,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joseph’ inncingpa kungah a peito vua, inn kotbiengah ama tawh a kiho uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in, “Ka pu aw, a masa-in an lei dingin kang peisuh uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />giena mun ka tun ciengun ka ip ka hong ule ka sum uh a gih za a kimin ka ip gong ciet vuah na om hi. Tua ahi ziehin tua sumte kang puokia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua banah an lei nading sum kang kenbe lai uhi. Ka sumte uh ka ip sung vuah koi pen koi ahei, ci ka thei sih uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in dawngin, “Kilungnuom sah unlen zau sih un; na Pasien ule na pate uh’ Pasien in na ip sung vuah na gou ding vua ang koipieh hi ding hi; na sum uh ka nga na hi,” a ci hi. Tua ciengin ama in amate tungah Simeon a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Inncingpa in Joseph’ inn ah amate zawpi-in tui pie a, a keng uh silin a kalaohte uh an a pieh zaw ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />tua munah a an neh ding lam uh a zah ziehun sun lai-a Joseph ang pei cienga a pieh ding uh letsong a baisa-in a koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Inn ah Joseph a tun ciengin amate in inn sunga a tawi uh letsongte ama kungah a peipi vua, ama’ mai lei lahah a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in dam le dam lo thu teng dongin, “Na gen uh na pa vuoi uh a dam dam nai mah? Ama a hing lai ma amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in, “Na nasempa ka pa uh dam lai hi; ama hing lai hi,” a ci uhi. Tuale a lu uh kunin zatahna a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph a dahto leh a nu’ tapa a sanggampa Benjamin mu a, ama in, “Ka kunga nei gen uh na nautum pen uh tampa ahiei mah? Pasien in nang hing khuotuo taheh, ka tapa aw!” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua bangin a sanggampa a ngai seng ziehin Joseph pusuohin a kap dingin a kisa hi. Tuaci’n inndan tuom khatah pei-in kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua ciengin a maiphietin a pusuoh hi; ama le ama ki-ip kenkonin, “An ei thua un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amate in Joseph ama guohin nesahin, amate zong a tuom ma-in nesah a, a an nehpi Egypt-te in a tuom ma-in a nesah uhi, azieh pen Hebrew-te tawh ankuong imton pen Egypt-te adingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate a suoh masa a suo kum utawh kizui le a tumpen a khangdawnna tawh kizui-in ama mai-ah a to ciengun mite in lamdangsa-in khatlekhat a ki-en uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Joseph’ sabuoi pan a tanh ciet uh kithuapieh a, hinanle amau’ tanh sangin Benjamin-a’ a za nga-in a tamzaw hi. Tuaci’n amate in an ne tui dawnin ama tawh a guol nuom uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a inncing pa thu pie a, “Tua mite’ ip sungah a puoh khop zaza uh an guon inlen, a ip gong ciet vuah a sum uh koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hai, ngun hai pen a an lei nading sum tawh nautum pen pa’ ip gong ah guonpieh in,” a ci hi. Tuale ama in Joseph’ gen bangin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zingmawng khuova behin a laate utawh mite kipeisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuopi panin amate tomkal no khat a pei zaw uh ciengin Joseph in a inncingpa kungah, “Pei inlen tua mite va del ta’n; amate na phah ciengin a kung vuah, ‘Bang dinga a hoi pen a sie tawh ei thuh na hi uh ahei? Bang dinga ka pu’ ngun hai na guh uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka pu in tami hai tawh zu a dawn hi lo amah? Ama in aisanna-a tami hai a zah tahtah hi lo amah? Tam bang na bawl ziehun na khiel uhi,’ va ci ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate a phah ciengin ama in a kung vuah tam thu teng a genkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in, “Bang dinga ka pu in tam bang kammalte nang gen mawh ahei? Na nasemte tua banga gamta ding ahi vawt sih uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />En in, Canaan gam panin ka ip gong vua ka mu uh sumte na kungah kang puokia uhi; tua ahile na pu’ inn panin ngun ahi a, kham ahi zongin bang dinga ka guh tah lawm ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na nasemte lahah tua hai a kimuna pen pa kithat taheh; tham loin ko adang teng zong ka pu’ sila kang hi ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in, “Na ci bang uh hi taheh: A kimuna pa ka sila hi ding a, hizongle no adang teng a suohta-in na pei ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ciengin a milipin a ip uh lei ah ngasuhin a ip ciet uh a nawhon pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in long pai a, a tapen panin kipanin a tumpen tawh a tawp hi; tuale Benjamin’ ip sungah tua hai kimu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tam thu ziehin amate in a puon uh a ehmal vua, a laate uh van suonin khuopi lamah a kilekia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joseph’ inn ah Judah le a sanggamte a tun ciengun khum munah Joseph na om lai hi; tuale ama’ mai lei lahah amate a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Joseph in amate kungah, “Na gamtat uh bangci gamtat ahiei? Kei aisan thei mi khat ka hi lam nei thei sih uh amah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuale Judah in, “Ka pu kungah bang thu ka gen thei ding uh ahei? Bang gen thei ding ka hi uh e? Ko le ko bangci kiphel thei ding ka hi uh ahei? Pasien in na nasemte’ khielna mu zo hi; tua ahile tam sunga om kote le a khut sunga hai kimuna pa zong, ka pu’ sila ka hi ta uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle ama in, “Tua bangin sem vawt sih vang! Hai a kimuna a nei pa beh ka sila hi ding hi; ahi vangin no na hi uleh na pa kung vuah lungnuomin peito ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kungah Judah peito a, “Ka pu aw, hepina tawh na nasempa in ka pu’ bil kawmah kam khat ei gensah inlen, na nasempa tungah lungthah sin; bang ding ahei cile nang pen Pharaoh ma tawh kibang na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka pu in a nasemte nei dong a, ‘Pa ahi a, sanggam ahi zongin na nei vuoi mah?’ nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuale kote in ka pu kungah, ‘Pa vuoi khat ka nei vua, a khangham zaw cienga a nei sanggam pasal khat ka nei uhi. A sanggampa si zo hi. A nu’ tate sung panin ama beh omlai a, a pa in ama it mama hi,’ kang ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin nangma in na nasemte kungah, ‘Ka mit tawh ama ka mu thei nadingin ka kungah hing zawpisuh ta un,’ nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kote in zong ka pu uh kungah, ‘Tua tangvalpa in a pa nuasie thei mawh sih va. Azieh pen a pa nuasie leh a pa si thei mawh ding hi,’ kang ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin nang in na nasemte kungah, ‘Na nautum pen uh nang zawpi sih uleh ka mai na mu nawn sih ding uhi,’ nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na nasempa ka pa uh kung ka tun ciengun ka pu thugen teng ama kungah ka gensawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka pa un, ‘Peikia unlen an themkhat va leikia ta un,’ ei ci ciengin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />kote in, ‘Ka peisuh thei sih ding uhi. Ka nautum pen utawh ka zawton uleh beh ka peisuh ding uhi; azieh pen ka nautum utawh ka zaw sih ngeingei uleh tua mipa mai ka mu thei sih ding uhi,’ ka ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ciengin na nasempa ka pa un ka kung vuah, ‘Ka zi in tapa ni a nei na thei uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />khat in lah ei nuasie ta a, keima in ama pen a ki-ehmal zo hi ta, ka ci hi. Khum huna kipanin ama ka mu ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka kung panin tami a khat zong na lah kia vua, ama tungah sietna khat ang tun leh, Misikhuo ah ka samkangte dana tawh na peipisuh ding uh ahi ta hi,’ ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in na nasempa ka pa kungah ka tun ciengun tami tangvalpa zawpi sih uleng, tangvalpa’ hinna khu ama’ hinna tawh a kikhiton ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />kote tawh tua tangvalpa ka zawton lo uh ama in ei mu ciengin ama si mawh ding hi; ko na nasemte in dana tawh na nasempa ka pa uh’ samkangte Misikhuo-a a puohsuh ka hi ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azieh pen na nasempa keima khu tua tangvalpa tangin ka pa kunga kikham ka hi a, ‘Na kunga ama kang nuatut sih tah leh na muna-ah tua mawna ka khan tawntungin ka puo ding hi,’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin tu-in hepina tawh tangvalpa tangin ka pu kungah keima na nasempa sila-in ei omsah zing inlen; a sanggamte tawh tua tangvalpa peisahkia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Azieh pen tua tangvalpa zawpi loin ka pa kung bangci zot thei ding ka hei? Ka pa tunga ang tung ding gimna ka en ngam sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama kunga a ding mi zosie mai-ah Joseph ki-ip zo nawn loin, “Ka kung panin mi zosie peikhie sah un,” ci-in kiko hi. Tuaci’n a sanggamte kungah Joseph a kipulah ciengin ama kungah koima dang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A gingin kap ahi ziehin Egypt-te le Pharaoh’ inn kuonte in za uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joseph in a sanggamte kungah, “Keima Joseph ka hi hi. Ka pa a hing lai nai mah?” a ci hi. Hinanle a sanggamte in ama a dawng sih vua, tuaci’n ama mai-ah amkham gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in a sanggamte kungah, “Ka kung ei nai un,” a ci hi. Tuale amate in ama kung a nai uhi. Ama in, “Kei pen Egypt gama nei zua uh na sanggampa uh Joseph ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu-in lungkham sih unlen, tam munah nei zua ziehun zong kithangpai suo sih un; azieh pen mihing’ hinna a hu dinga Pasien in na masang vua ei na sawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen gam sungah tam kum ni sung kielpi tung zo hi; lo hlaw lo nading le an lah lo nading kum nga sung omlai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na mai vuah leitunga a omlai teng a kemcing ding le a suohta no mi tampitah hinsuo dinga Pasien in kei ei na sawl ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n tam sunga kei ei sawl pen note na hi sih vua, Pasien ahi zaw hi; ama in Pharaoh khut nei-ah a ulien penin ei bawlin ama’ innkuonpi zosie le Egypt gam bup-ah vaihawm dingin keima ei koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka pa kungah mallang tahin va pei unlen ama kungah, ‘Na tapa Joseph in tam bangin gen hi: Pasien in Egypt gam buppi’ vaihawmin ei koi zo hi; ka kungah hing peisuh taheh. Kiheh sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Goshen leitangah na teng ding a, nang le na tate le na tate’ tate, na tuuhonte, na bawnghonte, le na nei zosie tawh ka gei-ah na om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ang tung ding kielpi kum nga omlai ahi ziehin nang le na innkuonpite, le na neisa zosie tungah zawnna a tun lo nadingin khum sungah kang va ding hi, ci hi,’ va ci ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu-in keima in ka kam tawh na kung vua kang thugente noma’ mit le ka nau Benjamin’ mit in nei mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pa kungah Egypt gama keima ei kipatawi dan le na mu zosie uh na gen ding uhi. Kinaw unlen tam sungah ka pa hing zawpisuh ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a sanggampa Benjamin ngawng kawi kawmin puasuhin kap a, Benjamin in zong ama ngawng kawi-in a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuale ama in a sanggam zosie tawpin a kaa hi; tua zaw ciengin a sanggamte in ama a hopi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Joseph’ sanggamte ang pei zo ta uhi,” ci thu Pharaoh’ inn sungah a kizah ciengin Pharaoh le a nasemte a lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pharaoh in Joseph kungah, “Na sanggamte kungah, ‘Hici bangin gamta un: Na ganhingte’ van suo unlen Canaan gamah peikia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na pa ule na innkuonte va la unlen keima kungah hing pei ta un. Tuaci’n Egypt gama mun hoipen note kang pie ding a, leitang hoi sunga piengte na ne ding uhi,’ ci-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma in na genbe lai dingah, ‘Tam bangin gamta un: Na tate le na zite vua dingin Egypt panin leengte kengin na pa uh hing zawpi unlen hing pei ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Egypt gam sung mun hoi zosie nomau-a’ ahi ziehin na neisate uh ngaisutin nei da lel un,’ ci-in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua bang ma-in Israel’ tapate a gamta uhi. Pharaoh’ thupieh dung zui-in Joseph in amate leeng pie a, lampi-a a neh ding uh an zong guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in puon sil khat ciet amate guon hi; ahi vangin Benjamin pen ngun shekel zathum le puon sil nga guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in tam teng a pa a hlah ahi hi: Egypt’ van hoite a puo laa sawm khat, le antang, moh, le lampi-a a pa neh ding an puo ding laapi sawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin a sanggamte sawl a, amate a pei ciengun ama in a kung vuah, “Lampi-ah kihau malmal sih un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n Egypt gam panin a peito vua, a pa uh Jacob kung Canaan gam a tung uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuale amate in a kungah, “Joseph hing lai hi! Egypt gam buppi nangawn ah ama vaihawmpi pa ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Ama a lungam gawp hi; ama in amau’ thugen um thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahi vangin Joseph’ thugen zosie ama kungah a gen uh ciengin ama kipuoh nadinga Joseph in a sawl leengte a mu bepin, a pa uh Jacob’ lungsim a hingkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jacob in, “Pha zo ta! Ka tapa Joseph hing lai hi. Ka si masangin pei-in ama ka mu ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A neisa zosie tawh Israel khuolzin a, Beer-sheba a tun tahin a pa Isaac’ Pasien tungah biehpiehnate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zanlai a mangmuna-ah Pasien in Israel hopi a, “Jacob, Jacob,” ci hi. Ama in, “Kei tanah om ing,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in, “Kei pen na pa’ Pasien ahi, Pasien ka hi hi; Egypt gam peisuh ding zau sin, azieh pen khum sungah minam lien khatin kang bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei mama in Egypt ah hing zawpi suhin kang peipito kia ding hi; tuale Joseph’ mit in na mit tungah a khut nga ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Beer-sheba panin Jacob a dingkhie hi; Israel’ tapate in ama tuon nadinga Pharaoh’ hlah leengte tungah a pa uh Jacob, a tate, le a zite a puo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a ganhonte ule Canaan gam sunga a lam uh vante la-in a peipi vua, Jacob le a suonlehlahte zosie ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a tapate, le a tapate’ tapate tawh, a tanute, le a tapate’ tanute; ama’ suonlehlahte zosie Egypt gamah a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu-in tam teng Egypt gama pei Jacob’ suonlehlahte’ min ahi hi. Jacob’ ta a upa pen Reuben
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />le Reuben’ tapate: Hanoch, Pallu, Hezron, le Carmi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simeon’ tapate: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jachin, Zohar, le Canaan numei’ tapa Shaul ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi’ tapate: Gershon, Kohath, le Merari ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah’ tapate: Er, Onan, Shelah, Perez, le Zerah ahi hi. (ahi vangin Canaan gamah Er le Onan a si hi); tuale Perez’ tapate pen Hezron le Hamul ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Issachar’ tapate: Tola, Puvah, Jashub, le Shimron ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zebulun’ tapate: Sered, Elon, le Jahleel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />(tam teng pen Paddanaram-ah Leah tawh a nei Jacob’ suonte hi a, a tanu Dinah tawh zong ahi hi; a tapate zosie a tanute zosie sawmthum le thum ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gad’ tapate: Ziphion, Haggi, Shuni, Ezbon, Eri, Arodi, le Areli ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asher’ tapate: Imnah, Ishvah, Ashvi, Beriah, le a sanggamnu uh Serah ahi hi. Beriah’ tapate: Heber le Malchiel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Tam teng pen Laban in a tanu Leah tunga a pieh Zilpah’ tapate ahi hi; ama in Jacob tawh tam teng nei a, mimal sawm le guh ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jacob’ zi Rachel’ tapate: Joseph le Benjamin ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joseph in Egypt gamah On khuo siempu Potiphera’ tanu Asenath tawh Manasseh le Ephraim nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin’ tapate: Bela, Becher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, le Ard ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />(Tam teng pen Rachel tawh a nei Jacob’ suonte hi a, a unpi-in mimal sawm le ni ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan’ tapa Hushim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Naphtali’ tapate: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, le Shillem ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />(Tam teng pen Laban in a tanu Rachel’ tunga a pieh Bilhah in Jacob tawh a nei tapate hi a, a unpi-in mimal sagi ahi hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Egypt gam sunga a lut Jacob-a’ ahi ama suonlehlah, Jacob tate’ zite kisim lo, a unpi-in mimal sawmguh le guh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Joseph in Egypt gam-a a nei a tapate ni ahi hi; Egypt gama pei Jacob’ innkuon zosie sawm sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel in ama’ mai Goshen ah lam lah dingin Joseph kungah Judah a masawl hi. Goshen gamah a tun ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Joseph in a leengte kithawisahin a pa Jacob dawn dingin Goshen ah a peito hi. Ama kungah a va kihil ta a, tuale ama ngawng kawi-in bapi khat sung a kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel in Joseph kungah, “Kei mama in a hing lai na hi lam hing mu zo ka hi ziehin tu-in ka si thei ta hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joseph in a sanggamte le a pa’ innkuonpite kungah, “Pharaoh kungah keima va peito-in, ‘Ka kungah Canaan gama a teng ka sanggamte le ka pa’ innkuonpite ang ptung zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua mite pen gankhawite ahi ziehun amate tuucingte ahi uhi. Amate in a tuuhonte uh, a bawnghonte ule a nei a lam zosie uh ang peipi uhi,’ ka va ci ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pharaoh in ang hlat a, na kung vuah, ‘Bang sem na hi vuoi?’ ang ci ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />‘Na nasemte in ka neu lai panun tu dongin koma le ka pate ka ni-un gancing mi ka hi uhi,’ na ci ding uhi. Tua hileh Goshen leitangah na teng thei ding uhi, azieh pen Egypt-te adingin tuucing kici poma a kidahhuoi ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joseph pei-in Pharaoh kungah, “Ka pa le ka sanggamte, a tuuhonte, a bawnghonte ule a neisa zosie utawh Canaan gam panin ang pei uhi; tu-in Goshen gamah a om uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a sanggamte lahah mihing nga zawpi-in Pharaoh kungah a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pharaoh in a sanggamte kungah, “Na nasep uh bang ahiei?” a ci hi. Amate in Pharaoh kungah, “Ka pu ka pate uh ma bangin na nasem kote tuucing ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in Pharaoh kungah, “Tam gamah pemta dinga ang pei ka hi uhi; azieh pen Canaan gamah kielpi a natsiet ziehin khum munah na nasemte’ gantate neh ding hampa lohing a om nawn sih hi. Tu-in Goshen gamah na nasemte ei tengsah in, kang thum uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pharaoh in Joseph kungah, “Na kungah na pa le na sanggamte ang tung zo ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma mai-ah Egypt leitang a om hi. Gam hoipen munah na pa le na sanggamte tengsah in; Goshen leitangah amate tengsah in; amate lahah mi pilvang a om lam na thei leh ka ganhingte kem dingin koi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in a pa Jacob zawpi-in Pharaoh’ mai-ah laa a, tuale Jacob in zong Pharaoh thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pharaoh in Jacob kungah, “Kum bang za na pha tai?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jacob in Pharaoh kungah, “Leisiet ka pemta hinkhuo khu kum za le kum sawmthum ahi hi; ka nuntah hun pen tomin hamsa hi. Kum sawtveipi pemta a na hi sung uh ka pate’ kumte tawh tekah thei ding ahi sih hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in Pharaoh thupha a pie a, Pharaoh’ opna panin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pharaoh’ thupieh bangin Joseph in amau’ nei dingin Egypt gama leitang hoipen ahi Rameses leitang pie a, tua sungah a pa le a sanggamte a tengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joseph in a pa, a sanggamte, le a pa’ innkuonpi zosie a ne ding za tawh kituohin an a va hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu-in ahile kielpi a natsiet seng ziehin gam zosie-ah an om nawn lo hi. Kielpi ziehin Egypt gam le Canaan gam a vulnaang gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Egypt gam le Canaan gam sunga antang lei nadinga a khel uh sum kinga zosie Joseph in a kaikhawm hi; tuale Joseph in Pharaoh’ inn ah tua sum teng a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Egypt gam le Canaan gam sunga sum zosie a tawp sieng zaw ciengin Joseph kungah Egypt mi zosie a pei vua, “An ei pie in! Bang dingin na muna-ah si ding ka hi uh ahei? Azieh pen ka sum teng uh tawp sieng zo hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joseph in dawng a, “Na sum uh a tawp sieng tah leh na ganhonte ei pie un. Keima in an kang pie ding a, na gante utawh i kikhel ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Joseph kungah a ganhonte a peipi uhi; tuale Joseph in sakolte, tuuhonte, bawnghonte, le laate khelna-in amate an a pie hi. Tua kumin amate an pie a, a ganhon zosie utawh a khelpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua kum a tawp zaw, a kumkia ciengin a peikia vua, “Ka sum uh a tawp lam ka pu kungah kang pha thei sih uhi. Ka ganta zosie ulah ka pu-a’ ahi ta hi. Ka pumpite ule ka mun ka gamte uh ci simlo ka pu’ muna-ah bangma om nawn lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma’ muna-ah kote le ka gam uh a siton ding ka ta uh amah? Koma le ka leitang uh an tawh ei khel in. Koma, ka leitang utawh Pharaoh’ sila ka hi ding uhi; kielsi loin ka hin nading ule ka gam uh a hawmsuo lo nadingin khaici ei pie in,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joseph in Pharaoh adingin Egypt gam zosie a lei hi. Amate tungah kielpi a natsiet ziehin Egypt mi zosie in a logamte uh a zuamang uhi; tuale leitang teng Pharaoh-a’ a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihingte ahile, ama in Egypt mongkhat panin mong khat dongin amau’ sila-in bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in siempute’ leitang beh lei lo hi; bangzieh ahei cile siempute in Pharaoh kung panin a kiciengtan za an a nga vua, Pharaoh in a pieh an tawh amate a luhing thei uhi; tua ahi ziehin amate in a leitangte uh a zua sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in mite kungah, “Tu-in noma le na leitang uh Pharaoh adingin ka lei zo hi. Tam sungah note dingin khaici a om hi; leitang tungah vaw un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anlah hun ciengin Pharaoh tungah nga-a-khat na pie ding vua, nga-a-li pen khaici ding, noma le na innkuonpite le na tate an neh dingin na tang ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in, “Ka hinna uh nei hun zo hi; ka pu uh lungdam heh, Pharaoh’ sila ka hi ta ding uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pharaoh in nga-ah-khat nei ding hi, a ci pen, tuni donga a om, Egypt leitang tawh kisai-in Joseph in ngaina kip khatin a bawl hi. Siempute’ leitang beh Pharaoh-a’ suoh lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua ahi ciengin Egypt gam sung Goshen leitangah Israel teng hi; tua sungah neisa tampi nei-in suonlehlah tampi a pha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Egypt gamah Jacob kum sawm le kum sagi sung teng hi; tuaci’n Jacob’ khan kum za le sawmli le sagi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel a si ding hun a nai ciengin ama in a tapa Joseph hlanin a kungah, “Na mitmu-in maipha ka nga leh ka phei nei-ah na khut hing koi inlen, thuman thutah tawh nei bawl nadingin hing kiciem in. Egypt gamah ei vui poma sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate tawh ka lupton ciengin Egypt gam panin ka luong ei puo inlen, amau’ kivuina hanah ei vui in,” a ci hi. Ama in dawng a, “Na gen bangin ka bawl ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka kungah hing kiciem in,” a ci hi; tuale a pa kungah ama kiciem hi. Tua ciengin ama’ lupna khawhlung ah Israel a kunsuh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami zaw ciengin Joseph kungah, “Na pa a cina hi,” ci-in kigen hi. Tuaci’n ama in a tate ni, Manasseh le Ephraim a zawpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jacob kungah, “Na tapa Joseph na kungah hing tung ta,” a kici ciengin ama in a tha sanin lupna tungah a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jacob in Joseph kungah, “Canaan gam Luz khuo-a ka kungah Vanglien Pasien hing kilahin thupha ei pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama in keima kungah, “Nang kang ciphasah ding a, tampi-in kang khangsah ding hi; mi honpi khat kang suohsah ding a, nang zaw cienga na suonlehlahte in a nei zing dingin tam leitang ka pie ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Egypt gam nangma kung kang tun masanga Egypt gam sunga a suoh na tapa nite tu-in keima-a’ ahi hi; Reuben le Simeon-te ma bangin Ephraim le Manasseh zong keima-a’ hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate zaw cienga a pieng ta le naute pen nangma-a’ hi ding hi. Amau’ gouluona tawh kisai-in a sanggamte’ minin amate kiciemte ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen Paddan panin ka pei lai-in Canaan gam Ephrath khuo tun kuon, Canaan gam lamkalah ka da ka kaa nadingin Rachel in ei na sisan a, Ephrath (tua pen Bethlehem) peina lampi-ah ama ka vui hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jacob in Joseph’ tate a mu bepin, “Tam naupangte koi-a’ ahiei,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joseph in a pa kungah, “Pasien in tam sunga ei pieh ka tapate ahi hi,” a ci hi. Ama in, “Thupha ka pieh thei nadingin hepina tawh ka kungah hing peipi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu-in Jacob a khangham ziehin ama in khuo a mu thei ta sih hi. Tuaci’n Joseph in ama kungah amate a peipi hi; tuale ama in amate tawpin a kawipom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel in Joseph kungah, “Na maitang mu dingin ka kinem vawt sih hi; Pasien in tam sungah na tate zong ei musah hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in ama gel a pa’ khup panin ladawhin lei lam nga-in a kunsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joseph in Ephraim’ zietlam khut, Jacob’ veilam khutah, Manasseh’ veilam khut, Jacob’ zietlam khutah a nipi-in ama gel kai-in ama lam nehin a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahi vangin Jacob in a khut zahin a naupa Ephraim’ lu tungah ngam a, Manasseh a suoh masa pen ahi ziehin a khut kipaipe sahin a lu tungah a veilam khut ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in Joseph thupha pie a, “Ka pu ka pa Abraham le Isaac in ama’ mai-ah a na peina Pasien, tuni dong ka hinkhuo vannuoi-ah ka tuucingpa ahi Pasien,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />sietna zosie panin ei tankhie vantungmi in naupangte thupha pie taheh; amate sungah keima’ min le ka pu ka pate ahi Abraham le Isaac’ minin kilo hinlen; amate mihonpi khatin leitungah pung ta uheh” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pa in Ephraim’ lu tungah a zietlam khut a koi pen Joseph in a mu ciengin lung kim lo hi; tuaci’n ama in a pa’ khut la dawh a, Ephraim’ lu tung panin Manasseh’ lu tungah koipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Joseph in a pa kungah, “Tua bang hi lo hi, ka pa aw! Tam pa a suoh masa zaw ahi ziehin na zietlam khut ama’ lu tungah koi in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin a pa in a niel a, “Thei ing, ka ta aw, ka thei hi; ama zong mi nam khat suohin a lien ding hi. Ahi vangin ama sangin a naupa a lienzaw ding a, ama’ suonlehlahte minam honpi khat suoh ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n khum ni-in ama in amate thupha pie a, Note’ min tawh Israel-te thupha kipie ding a, ‘Ephraim le Manasseh bangin Pasien in note hing bawl taheh,’ a ci ding uhi,” a ci hi. Tuaci’n ama in Manasseh mai-ah Ephraim a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in Joseph kungah, “Kei a si ding ka hi ta a, ahi vangin Pasien in nang hing ompi-in na pu na pate’ leitangah ang peipikia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tu-in ka namsau le ka thalpi tawh Amor’ mite khut tung pana ka na lah ahi tanh lah panin na sanggamte sangin tanh khat a tamzaw-in kang pie hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Jacob in a tapate hlan a: “Ang tung ding hunte-ah na tung vuah bang teng ang pieng ding ci kang gen thei nadingin hing ki-im un, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jacob’ tapate aw, hing kikhawmin za unlen, na pa Israel’ thugen ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Reuben, nang ka tapa tapen, ka thahatna le ka tacil, zalien pente tunga zalien pen le thunei pente’ tunga thunei pen na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuihuol bangin na sih ding a, tungnung pen zong na hi sih ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile na pa’ lupna-ah na kato hi; nang ka lupna tungah na ka a, ka lupna na buasah hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simeon le Levi, unau ahi hi; a namsaute uh pen tatsietna’ hiem ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau’ kikhopna-ah ei lutsah ngai sinlen; amate tawh ei kipawlsah sin. Bangzieh ahei cile amate lungthahin mi a that vua, amate in guolnop apmaina-in bawngtangte’ kapzahui a sattan pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lungthahna uh a zauhuoi a, a thangpaina uh a giinhuoi ziehin amate in samsiet nga ta uheh! Jacob sungah amate khenkhe-in amate Israel sungah ka thezah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Judah aw, na sanggamte in nang ang phat ding uhi; na galte’ ngawngah na khut a om ding hi; na mai-ah na pa’ tapate ang kun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah, humpi khanglai ahi hi; ka ta aw, nangma in na samatsa na nehna panin na kipeito ta hi. Humpi apa bangin ama kize-in a lum hi. Humpi anu tawh a kibang ama koi in phong ngam ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama tungah sieh le kaih a tun masang, mite in ama’ thu a man masangin, Judah panin kumpi ciengkhut le ama’ keng kikala uhpa’ ciengkhut kikhin lo ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in lenggui-ah a sakolno khi-in, lenggui hoi penah a laano khi a, lenggazu sungah a puonte sawpin, lenggatui san sungah a puonsilte sawp hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a mitte lenggazu sangin sanzaw a, a hate bawngnawi sangin kangzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zebulun tuipi gei-ah teng ding a, tembaw khawlna mun suoh ding hi. Sidon khu ama’ gamgi hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Issachar, a hat laa tawh kibang a, tuuhuong kikalah lum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ama in khawlna mun hoi khat le leitang nop tuoh khat mu hi. Tuaci’n ama in van puo dingin a liengko niemsah a, thona aana nasepna ah ama sila a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dan in Israel minam khat bangin a mipite thu a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dan, lam gei-a gulpi hi ding a, lam dunga gul gunei hi ding hi. Sakol tunga tuong pa a thalpua nadingin ama in sakol’ ketul a tuhpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa aw, keima in na hutdamna ka ngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Misuomte in Gad sim ding a, ahi vangin ama in amau’ ketul a sim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asher’ a an tui ding a, ama in kumpi antuite a bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Naphtali, a kihla sakhipi ahi a, a melhoi sakhinote a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joseph, singba gapha ahi a, ciatui gei-a po singba gapha hi-in, kul tungah a bate a zam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thal kap siemte in nasie tahin ama a do vua, amate in thal tawh kapin ama a genthei bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hinanle a thal nem ngai loin a bante gang mama hi. Jacob’ Vanglien Pa’ khut, Israel Suongpi, Tuucingpa’ min,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ang hu ding na pa’ Pasien, thupha ang pie ding Vanglienpa , vantunga om thuphate, leinei a thuhna sunga thuphate, nawi le sul thuphate, na tungah ang pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na pa’ thuphate pen kumtawn muolte’ thuphate, tawntung muoltangte’ thuphate sangin a lienzaw hi. Tua thuphate, Joseph’ lu tung, a sanggamte lahah a kituomkoi pa’ talpang tungah hing tu taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Benjamin khu ngie gilkiel ahi a, zingmawngin a sa mat nawmvalin, nitah ciengin a matsa teng a hawm hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tam teng zosie Israel minam sawm le nite ahi vua, tam pen a pa un amate khat ciet tawh kituohin thupha a pieh kawma a kung vua a gen thute ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in amate thuhilin a kung vuah, “Kei ka hi leh ka mite tawh a kigawm ding ka hi ta hi. Hit mi Ephron’ lolai-a suonghawm sungah ka pu ka pate tawh ei vuiton unlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />tuami suonghawm khu Mamre nisuona lam Machpelah lomun Canaan gam sunga om ahi a, Abraham in hankhuh dinga a na leisa mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua munah Abraham le a zi Sarah kivui hi; tua mun ma-ah Isaac le a zi Rebekah zong kivui hi; tuale keima in tua munah Leah ka na vui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A lo le a sunga om suonghawm pen Hit-te kung pana kilei ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jacob in a tate thuhil a man zaw ciengin a lupna tungah laitat a, a nukhia pen a husangin a mipite kung a zuon ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph a pa tungah pua-in a pa kaa-in a nam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joseph in a pa luong a muot lo nadinga a bawl dingin zatui siemte thu a pie hi. Tuaci’n zatui siemte in Israel zatui a nu uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate in tami bawl nadingin ni sawmli sung hun a zang uhi, bang ding ahei cile tua khu zatui nu nadinga a kisam hun ahi hi. Tuale Egypt-te in ni sawm sagi sung ama kaa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama zieha kaana nite a tawp ciengin Joseph in Pharaoh’ innkuonte kungah, “Tu-in na mai vuah maipha ka nga leh hepina tawh Pharaoh kungah tam bangin thu ei genpieh un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka pa in ei kiciemsah hi; ama in, ‘Kei a si ding ka hi ta hi. Canaan leitanga keima dinga ka lemsa hankhuh sungah nei vui ding hi,’ ei ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin ka pa ka vui thei nadingin tu-in ei peitosah in; tua ciengin kang kilekia ding hi, ci hi, ei va cipieh ta un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pharaoh in dawng a, “Peito-in ang kiciemsah bangin na pa va vui ta’n,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaci’n a pa vui dingin Joseph a peito hi. Ama tawh Pharaoh’ nasemte zosie, a innsung upate, le Egypt gam sunga upate zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joseph’ innkuonte zosie, a sanggamte, a pa’ innkuonte tawh zong a peito uhi. Gosheh gamah a tate uh, a tuuhonte uh, le a bawnghonte beh uh kinuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leengte le sakol galkapte tawh ama a peito hi. Amate a pawlcing mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan gun galkhat, Atad’ bucilna phuol a tun ciengun, khum munah nahpitahin a kap uhi; tuale ama in a pa ziehin ni sagi sung dana hun a zang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khum gama a teng Canaan-te in Atad’ bucilna phuola kaa le mau a mu ciengun, “Tam khu Egypt-te adinga a nasie mama kaa le mau ahi hi,” a ci uhi. Tua ahi ziehin khum mun pen Abel-Mizraim kici hi. Khum mun khu Jordan gun galkhat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate tunga a vaihlah bangin a tapate in a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in Canaan gamah ama a puo vua, Abraham in hankhuh dinga Hit mi Ephron’ kung pana a na leisa ahi Mamre nisuona lam Machpelah mun lolai-a suonghawm sungah a vui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa a vui zaw ciengin a sanggamte le a zawpito mi zosie tawh Egypt ah ama a kilekia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A pa uh si zo ci a thei ciengun Joseph’ sanggamte in, “Joseph in eite ei lungsim puohin ama tunga i bawlsa uh khielnate a unpi-in ei thuhkia mawh leh maw?” a kici uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Joseph kung a nai vua, “Na pa in a si masangin tam thuhilna ei nei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Joseph kungah tam bangin gen un: Na sanggamte in na tunga sietna ang bawl ziehun a khielnate uh maisah in, kang thum hi,’ a ci hi. Tua ahi ziehin tu-in hepina tawh na pa Pasien’ nasemte khielna ei maisah in,” a ci uhi. Amate in ama a hopi ciengun Joseph kap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin a sanggamte zong kapin ama’ mai-ah a pua vua, “Tami munah na silate ka hi uhi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Joseph in a kung vuah, “Zau sih un! Kei Pasien muna om ka hi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Note in kei siet nading na gel vangun, Pasien in tuni-a a sep bangin mi tampite’ hinna a humbih thei nadingin a hoi dinga a na gel ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuaci’n zau sih ulen, keima in noma le na tate kang va ding hi,” a ci hi. Tam bang danin amate a lungnuomsah a, kamhlum no tawh amate a hopi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joseph, ama le a pa’ innkuonte tawh Egypt gamah a teng uhi; tuale Joseph kum za le kum sawm a hing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Joseph in Ephraim’ tate khang thumna dong mu hi; Manasseh’ tapa Machir’ tate zong Joseph’ khup tunga suoh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ciengin Joseph in a sanggamte kungah, “Kei a si ding ka hi ta hi; ahi vangin na kung vuah Pasien ang pei valon ding a, tuale ama in tami leitang panin Abraham, Isaac, le Jacob tunga a ciemsa leitangah note ang peipito ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaci’n Joseph in Israel-te kiciemsah a, “Na kung vuah Pasien ang pei ciengin tami mun panin ka gu ka tangte na puoto ding uhi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kum za le kum sawm a phahin Joseph a si hi; ama zatui kinu a, Egypt gam sunga misi kuong khatah kikoi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
